},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/7785b0c9b6914f768e22f61634f54a5ce45ad2b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:11:38Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:11:38Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Redesign both calendars like a phone calendar, with a colour legend\n\nMonday-first grid with the adjacent months'' days faded in, tall cells\nwith coloured chips (holiday name, on time, late, MC), Sundays in red,\ntoday highlighted, and a legend under each calendar. The admin calendar\nshows per-day counts (or one intern''s status when filtered); tapping a\nday in the intern''s history opens a popup with clock-in/out, mode and\nstatus. The separate holiday list is gone -- names now sit in the cells.\nWorks in both light and dark themes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b70903d8c266acef5f5147a6290dbfabfad5899","url":"https://api.gi