184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/6f1e7c5a44d4d3ee83f54a58217019319ce710b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T06:42:59Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T06:42:59Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Enforce the rota at clock-in instead of displaying it\n\nThe intern-schedule rota now decides how someone may clock in: on an\nonsite day the Hybrid option is hidden and the server refuses a Hybrid\nclock-in, so the office QR + GPS is required. Hybrid/remote days allow\neither mode, and anyone not on the rota -- or any rota outage -- is left\nunrestricted so that dependency never blocks attendance. Clock-out already\nhas to match clock-in''s mode. The admin rota display is removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e19a4ce322ec45e1f78959b68fb4817ec013ec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/7e19a4ce322ec45e1f78959b68fb4817ec013ec7"},"url":"https://api.githu