m/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/b10e26c64276f31c42f7a61235a11cc23e32a370/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T03:39:24Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T03:39:24Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Add the gateway button, the daily rota, and fix holiday dates\n\n- index.html loads the gateway''s shared button (MICROAPP_GATEWAY_BUTTON.md),\n  lifted clear of the bottom nav; the app''s own Sign out button and\n  /api/signout are removed, since the gateway is the only place to sign out.\n- The admin day view shows that day''s rota (onsite / hybrid / remote) from\n  the intern-schedule service, cached 10 minutes, best-effort.\n- department-api and calendar-db token code merged into serviceToken(),\n  now also used for intern-schedule, surfacing the gateway''s own reason\n  when a grant is missing.\n- Company holidays landed a day early: all-day events are stored as local\n  midnight (16:00Z the day before) and were read in UTC. Now converted to\n  the app''s timezone, with local-day query bounds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tr