OCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/ae942dcb9f6a855b9d4b8b1a1ea5da09fedb444e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:27:41Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:27:41Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Remove the QR-image-upload option from clock in/out\n\nInterns now only clock in/out with the live camera scan; the \"Use a QR\nimage\" file-upload fallback and its handler are gone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2ae713fbca7db1c650a3ddedf8dae4121e35279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/d2ae713fbca7db1c650a3ddedf8dae4121e35279"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/ae942dcb9f6a855b9d4b8b1a1ea5da09fedb444e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/ae942dcb9f6a855b9d4b8b1a1ea5da09fedb444e","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGFlOTQyZGNiOWY2YTg1NWI5ZDRiOGIxYTFlYTVkYTA5ZmVkYjQ0NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/d323064113885f4267b8bd2bb7727cb287ccf585","sha":"d323064113885f4267b8bd2bb7727cb287ccf585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/d323064113885f4267b8bd2bb7727cb287ccf585"}],"sha":"ae942dcb9f6a855b9d4b8b1a1ea5da09fedb444e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/ae942dcb9f6a855b9d4b8b1a1ea5da09fedb444e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/d323064113885f4267b8bd2bb7727cb287ccf585/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:14:44Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:14:54Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Run in the Singapore region, fail faster on gateway calls, fix QR upload\n\nvercel.json now pins functions to sin1 -- the database geolocates to Kuala\nLumpur, but functions were defaulting to iad1 (Washington DC), so every\nrequest paid a cross-Pacific round trip. Measured /health at ~1s and\n/openapi.json at ~330ms before the fix; both should drop once redeployed.\n\nhttpJson()''s default timeout drops from 20s to 5s so a hung gateway call\n(session introspect runs on every signed-in request) fails fast instead of\nstalling a page load.\n\nThe QR-image-upload input had capture=\"environment\", which forces the\ncamera open directly on many Android browsers instead of showing the\nphoto/file picker -- so it wasn''t actually letting anyone pick an existing\nQR photo from their gallery. Removing it lets the OS''s normal picker show,\nPhotos/Gallery included.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdb9d4ed434ac34d21ca2ac31ebc4096b8650189","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/fdb9d4ed434ac34d21ca2ac31ebc4096b8650189"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/d323064113885f4267b8bd2bb7727cb287ccf585","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/d323064113885f4267b8bd2bb7727cb287ccf585","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGQzMjMwNjQxMTM4ODVmNDI2N2I4YmQyYmI3NzI3Y2IyODdjY2Y1ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/80e10f926793851b6d98a138734c9d7fe81e3b91","sha":"80e10f926793851b6d98a138734c9d7fe81e3b91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/80e10f926793851b6d98a138734c9d7fe81e3b91"}],"sha":"d323064113885f4267b8bd2bb7727cb287ccf585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/d323064113885f4267b8bd2bb7727cb287ccf585"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/80e10f926793851b6d98a138734c9d7fe81e3b91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:07:52Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:07:52Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Add CSV export for attendance data (opens in Excel)\n\nNew \"Export CSV\" button in the admin panel, next to the Late/On time\ntoggles. Reuses the existing /api/admin/attendance month-fetch logic\nvia a new &format=csv mode -- same rows the screen is already showing\n(honoring the active status/intern filter if any), just written as a\ndownloadable CSV instead of JSON. Columns: date, intern, reference,\ndepartment, clock in/out, mode, status.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de0ef217ee7630cf02885f50cf945175266d63c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/de0ef217ee7630cf02885f50cf945175266d63c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/80e10f926793851b6d98a138734c9d7fe81e3b91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/80e10f926793851b6d98a138734c9d7fe81e3b91","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDgwZTEwZjkyNjc5Mzg1MWI2ZDk4YTEzODczNGM5ZDdmZTgxZTNiOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/cb63e0cc3512509ae5efc5dc651bcfe58a3a4225","sha":"cb63e0cc3512509ae5efc5dc651bcfe58a3a4225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/cb63e0cc3512509ae5efc5dc651bcfe58a3a4225"}],"sha":"80e10f926793851b6d98a138734c9d7fe81e3b91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/80e10f926793851b6d98a138734c9d7fe81e3b91"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/cb63e0cc3512509ae5efc5dc651bcfe58a3a4225/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:53:34Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:53:34Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Add follow-up reminders and admin late/on-time filtering\n\nReminders: each clock-in/clock-out reminder now gets a one-shot\nfollow-up ~5 minutes later if the intern still hasn''t resolved it,\nvia two more once-daily cron entries and a second reminders_sent\nstage per type. REMINDER_LEAD_MINUTES is no longer used, since the\nclock-out check dropped its upper bound entirely.\n\nAdmin calendar: filtering to one intern now shows that day''s actual\nstatus as a dot (on time/late/excused), like the intern''s own\ncalendar, instead of a generic count. Added Late/On time toggle\nbuttons that filter the day list and dim non-matching calendar days\n-- and, since a single day rarely has much to show, clicking one now\npulls every matching record for the whole visible month instead of\njust the selected day, via a new optional ?month=&status= mode on the\nexisting /api/admin/attendance endpoint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72e754d96a83737141218dc4429072e43e3c0a60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/72e754d96a83737141218dc4429072e43e3c0a60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/cb63e0cc3512509ae5efc5dc651bcfe58a3a4225","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/cb63e0cc3512509ae5efc5dc651bcfe58a3a4225","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGNiNjNlMGNjMzUxMjUwOWFlNWVmYzVkYzY1MWJjZmU1OGEzYTQyMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/22f43ee5fa5012a1b2c8089dfd5b62375fa80bb9","sha":"22f43ee5fa5012a1b2c8089dfd5b62375fa80bb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/22f43ee5fa5012a1b2c8089dfd5b62375fa80bb9"}],"sha":"cb63e0cc3512509ae5efc5dc651bcfe58a3a4225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/cb63e0cc3512509ae5efc5dc651bcfe58a3a4225"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/22f43ee5fa5012a1b2c8089dfd5b62375fa80bb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:39:39Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:39:39Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Filter admin calendar by intern, and give interns their own history calendar\n\nAdmin: clicking an intern''s name in the day list now filters the whole\ncalendar (day counts and late dots) to just that person, with a\n\"Name x\" chip to clear it -- backed by an optional &intern= param on\nthe attendance-calendar summary query.\n\nInterns: the History tab''s flat \"last 30 records\" list is replaced\nwith a real month calendar, mirroring the admin one -- each day shows\na colored dot for on-time/late/excused, with month navigation to\nbrowse any month. Reuses the existing /api/attendance endpoint via a\nnew optional ?month= param rather than adding a new route, so it\nstays under the same scope/documentation as the rest of the endpoint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d613980e202a6cb5340ec18e7af8aaff0e348807","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/d613980e202a6cb5340ec18e7af8aaff0e348807"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/22f43ee5fa5012a1b2c8089dfd5b62375fa80bb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/22f43ee5fa5012a1b2c8089dfd5b62375fa80bb9","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDIyZjQzZWU1ZmE1MDEyYTFiMmM4MDg5ZGZkNWI2MjM3NWZhODBiYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/7c6c478527f737f65f8c0a47612023932eaa74ae","sha":"7c6c478527f737f65f8c0a47612023932eaa74ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/7c6c478527f737f65f8c0a47612023932eaa74ae"}],"sha":"22f43ee5fa5012a1b2c8089dfd5b62375fa80bb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/22f43ee5fa5012a1b2c8089dfd5b62375fa80bb9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/7c6c478527f737f65f8c0a47612023932eaa74ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:04:08Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:04:08Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Replace the admin date picker with a custom calendar\n\nThe native date input only let admins step one day at a time with no\nsense of the month. Built a real month-grid calendar instead: each\nday shows an attendance count and a late-count dot, clicking a day\nloads its detail list below, and month navigation doesn''t disturb the\nselected day.\n\nBacked by a new GET /api/admin/attendance-calendar?month=YYYY-MM\nendpoint that aggregates the whole visible month in one query\n(attendance_feed GROUP BY attendance_date) rather than one query per\nday. Also fixed the same toISOString() timezone bug this session hit\nearlier -- the calendar''s initial month and \"today\" both now read\nlocal date fields instead of converting through UTC.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f4242528ef05cca72232fba17c2725b7bcd8c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/8f4242528ef05cca72232fba17c2725b7bcd8c95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/7c6c478527f737f65f8c0a47612023932eaa74ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/7c6c478527f737f65f8c0a47612023932eaa74ae","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDdjNmM0Nzg1MjdmNzM3ZjY1ZjhjMGE0NzYxMjAyMzkzMmVhYTc0YWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/523272dedcd8acfc7ab9129ff50f800ca32ebae7","sha":"523272dedcd8acfc7ab9129ff50f800ca32ebae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/523272dedcd8acfc7ab9129ff50f800ca32ebae7"}],"sha":"7c6c478527f737f65f8c0a47612023932eaa74ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/7c6c478527f737f65f8c0a47612023932eaa74ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/523272dedcd8acfc7ab9129ff50f800ca32ebae7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T04:24:40Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T04:24:40Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Move Admin out of the bottom nav into the profile drawer\n\nThe bottom nav is now Home/Scan/History for everyone. Admins get an\n\"Admin\" entry in the profile drawer instead (below Dark mode), which\nopens the same admin panel and closes the drawer -- easy for an admin\nto reach without permanently taking a slot in the main tab bar that\nevery non-admin user never sees used anyway.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c6ff2e0fffa15cb2682c9e64ace69bf20159bf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/8c6ff2e0fffa15cb2682c9e64ace69bf20159bf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/523272dedcd8acfc7ab9129ff50f800ca32ebae7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/523272dedcd8acfc7ab9129ff50f800ca32ebae7","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDUyMzI3MmRlZGNkOGFjZmM3YWI5MTI5ZmY1MGY4MDBjYTMyZWJhZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/08e751501db5f1a910c890424b9dbba1c48bece5","sha":"08e751501db5f1a910c890424b9dbba1c48bece5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/08e751501db5f1a910c890424b9dbba1c48bece5"}],"sha":"523272dedcd8acfc7ab9129ff50f800ca32ebae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/523272dedcd8acfc7ab9129ff50f800ca32ebae7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/08e751501db5f1a910c890424b9dbba1c48bece5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T04:03:31Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T04:03:31Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Fall back to explicit camera selection for QR scanning\n\nSome Android OEM browsers (seen on Honor/Huawei devices, which often\nship without Chrome) can''t resolve a bare facingMode:''environment''\nconstraint and reject the request before ever showing the permission\nprompt -- indistinguishable from the camera silently not being asked\nfor at all. Falls back to enumerating cameras and starting with an\nexplicit camera id, the library''s own documented workaround for this\nclass of device, and only skips the fallback when the failure is\ntruly a user-denied permission. Error messages are now specific to\nwhat actually failed (blocked / no camera / couldn''t start) instead\nof one generic message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d61b0e035176dfe7cbb44484b6dd4d041b7883e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/4d61b0e035176dfe7cbb44484b6dd4d041b7883e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/08e751501db5f1a910c890424b9dbba1c48bece5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at"