ents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/b25c81305ce0facd6b29c67cab6e64849a9e6744/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T03:45:50Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T03:45:50Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Remove the desktop-console breadcrumb header for a mobile-app feel\n\nThe topbar had a leftover \"Attendance console / Dashboard\" breadcrumb\nbar, and the welcome heading had a CSS-injected \"Gateway console / \"\nlabel above it -- both remnants of the original desktop dashboard\ntemplate, unrelated to this app. Removed both plus the dead\nmain-nav/menu-button CSS that only existed to support that header''s\nhamburger-menu behavior, which this app never used (navigation is the\nbottom tab bar). The topbar is now just the logo and profile chip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a14be4361ac440e3a8121d6dba21747508ea2de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/5a14be4361ac440e3a8121d6dba21747508ea2de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/b25c81305ce0facd6b29c67cab6e64849a9e6744","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/b25c81305ce0facd6b29c67cab6e64849a9e6744","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGIyNWM4MTMwNWNlMGZhY2Q2YjI5YzY3Y2FiNmU2NDg0OWE5ZTY3NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/1657186a2c0aacac0241237ffcbba7870b934bea","sha":"1657186a2c0aacac0241237ffcbba7870b934bea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/1657186a2c0aacac0241237ffcbba7870b934bea"}],"sha":"b25c81305ce0facd6b29c67cab6e64849a9e6744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/b25c81305ce0facd6b29c67cab6e64849a9e6744"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/1657186a2c0aacac0241237ffcbba7870b934bea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T02:43:08Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T02:43:08Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Reject service-to-service tokens on user-only endpoints\n\n/api/me, /api/devices, and /api/subscribe were never added to the\nOpenAPI document, so the scope check silently required zero scopes\nfor them -- combined with the app trusting a raw ?intern_id= query\nparam for any token caller, a token with any (or no) real scope could\nread or modify another intern''s devices/subscriptions, or read the\nlive office QR via /api/me. These three are pure signed-in-user\nfeatures with no legitimate machine caller, unlike /api/attendance\nand /api/leave, so reject token auth on them outright instead of\ninventing scopes for a use case that shouldn''t exist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a268d46fc5fc34c749b039635a17c612ff65aee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/9a268d46fc5fc34c749b039635a17c612ff65aee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/1657186a2c0aacac0241237ffcbba7870b934bea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/1657186a2c0aacac0241237ffcbba7870b934bea","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDE2NTcxODZhMmMwYWFjYWMwMjQxMjM3ZmZjYmJhNzg3MGI5MzRiZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/a2344c88becbb76ebca0baa156582eaddfd37d17","sha":"a2344c88becbb76ebca0baa156582eaddfd37d17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/a2344c88becbb76ebca0baa156582eaddfd37d17"}],"sha":"1657186a2c0aacac0241237ffcbba7870b934bea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/1657186a2c0aacac0241237ffcbba7870b934bea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/a2344c88becbb76ebca0baa156582eaddfd37d17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T01:27:46Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T01:27:46Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Commit api/vendor -- the Vercel PHP runtime wasn''t installing it\n\nConfirmed via a diagnostic 500 that api/vendor/autoload.php never\nexisted in the deployed function: the vercel-php@0.7.4 runtime isn''t\nreliably running `composer install` for composer.json nested in api/\nrather than the project root. Committing the installed dependencies\ndirectly (production-only, --no-dev --optimize-autoloader) guarantees\nthe exact same code that already works locally actually ships,\ninstead of depending on a build step that''s been silently no-op''ing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e787169714e413e3bbc568c1f8aac768aed9eaa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/e787169714e413e3bbc568c1f8aac768aed9eaa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/a2344c88becbb76ebca0baa156582eaddfd37d17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/a2344c88becbb76ebca0baa156582eaddfd37d17","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGEyMzQ0Yzg4YmVjYmI3NmViY2EwYmFhMTU2NTgyZWFkZGZkMzdkMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/f11b22e6700035f24da3ed95afc7c65e7a455877","sha":"f11b22e6700035f24da3ed95afc7c65e7a455877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/f11b22e6700035f24da3ed95afc7c65e7a455877"}],"sha":"a2344c88becbb76ebca0baa156582eaddfd37d17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/a2344c88becbb76ebca0baa156582eaddfd37d17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/f11b22e6700035f24da3ed95afc7c65e7a455877/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T01:24:38Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T01:24:38Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Diagnose the cron-reminders 500 instead of guessing\n\nProduction has been returning a bare 500 with 6ms execution and zero\noutgoing requests -- it dies before ever reaching the database, which\nrules out everything except the handful of lines at the very top of\nthe file. Added an explicit check for vendor/autoload.php so the next\ncall names the exact failure instead of falling through to the\ngeneric handler.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ca01e36accb3dab8c42c0578d2534f55139c25d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/2ca01e36accb3dab8c42c0578d2534f55139c25d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/f11b22e6700035f24da3ed95afc7c65e7a455877","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizatio