eta.vercel.app, and even a working call would have parsed\nzero departments -- the real service returns a bare JSON array, not\n{\"data\": [...]}. Verified the correct URL and shape against the real\ngateway/service.\n\nAlso stopped disguising the department name as a location: the home\nbadge used a map-pin icon and a \"live\" dot, and the profile drawer had\nno department field at all. Home badge now uses a briefcase icon, and\nthe profile drawer shows a clearly labeled Department row again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6aa21701841c1b38da8617f0108d82dc7965ca85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/6aa21701841c1b38da8617f0108d82dc7965ca85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/3a36d726ccba534971781e1ffa21bbceb2d4d5ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/3a36d726ccba534971781e1ffa21bbceb2d4d5ee","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDNhMzZkNzI2Y2NiYTUzNDk3MTc4MWUxZmZhMjFiYmNlYjJkNGQ1ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/b25f32cb3287a4d976f5dc4ed87c9136f8e81ba3","sha":"b25f32cb3287a4d976f5dc4ed87c9136f8e81ba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/b25f32cb3287a4d976f5dc4ed87c9136f8e81ba3"}],"sha":"3a36d726ccba534971781e1ffa21bbceb2d4d5ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/3a36d726ccba534971781e1ffa21bbceb2d4d5ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/b25f32cb3287a4d976f5dc4ed87c9136f8e81ba3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T09:09:48Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T09:09:48Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Add admin panel: view all attendance, randomize office QR\n\nReuses the gateway''s existing role claim (no new login) to gate a new\nAdmin tab. Admins can browse every intern''s attendance by date and\nregenerate the office QR code, which now lives in a DB table\n(office_settings) instead of a fixed env var so it can change without\na redeploy. Regenerating invalidates the old code immediately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e0bb6e530fb04aa71a2346be04037c3a0362916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/2e0bb6e530fb04aa71a2346be04037c3a0362916"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/b25f32cb3287a4d976f5dc4ed87c9136f8e81ba3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/b25f32cb3287a4d976f5dc4ed87c9136f8e81ba3","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGIyNWYzMmNiMzI4N2E0ZDk3NmY1ZGM0ZWQ4N2M5MTM2ZjhlODFiYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/a251701cc9421b1b5304c36a43d5ed425c98c0ea","sha":"a251701cc9421b1b5304c36a43d5ed425c98c0ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/a251701cc9421b1b5304c36a43d5ed425c98c0ea"}],"sha":"b25f32cb3287a4d976f5dc4ed87c9136f8e81ba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/b25f32cb3287a4d976f5dc4ed87c9136f8e81ba3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/a251701cc9421b1b5304c36a43d5ed425c98c0ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:41:12Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:41:12Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Make the topbar logo bigger\n\n28px -> 40px (22px -> 32px on mobile). Still fits comfortably within the\n72px topbar at both sizes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e976ce16b6b9fb8aebefdfa45665835881e7e538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/tree