rs/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/6facaa623b8dc37b3e0d3479788d03a8e09c3b92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:36:30Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:36:30Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Add the Rizurf Realty logo to the topbar, theme-aware\n\nTwo logo variants (dark navy text for light backgrounds, white text for\ndark backgrounds) moved into public/ so Vite serves them alongside the\nexisting static assets. The topbar picks whichever one actually reads\nclearly against the current theme.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7495c7cfa563b80f0d8a05e45d07a1af3f7212e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/f7495c7cfa563b80f0d8a05e45d07a1af3f7212e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/6facaa623b8dc37b3e0d3479788d03a8e09c3b92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/6facaa623b8dc37b3e0d3479788d03a8e09c3b92","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDZmYWNhYTYyM2I4ZGMzN2IzZTBkMzQ3OTc4OGQwM2E4ZTA5YzNiOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/db6a44100487d90057db5efed50821ca068afc26","sha":"db6a44100487d90057db5efed50821ca068afc26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/db6a44100487d90057db5efed50821ca068afc26"}],"sha":"6facaa623b8dc37b3e0d3479788d03a8e09c3b92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/6facaa623b8dc37b3e0d3479788d03a8e09c3b92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/db6a44100487d90057db5efed50821ca068afc26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T09:40:27Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T09:40:27Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Require clock-out mode to match clock-in mode\n\nClock-in and clock-out mode were validated independently: Office required a\nvalid QR + geofence check, but that check only ever ran for whichever mode\nwas actually submitted. Clocking in via Office (proving you were physically\nthere) and then clocking out via Hybrid skipped the check entirely for the\ndeparture half of the record, with nothing to show the mismatch afterward.\n\napi/attendance.php now rejects a clock-out whose mode doesn''t match the\nday''s clock_in_mode (422, clear message naming which mode to use). Backend\nenforces this regardless of what the frontend sends.\n\nsrc/App.jsx: since there''s now only one valid mode to clock out with, skip\nthe \"How are you working today?\" picker on clock-out and go straight to\nwhichever mode matches the clock-in -- showing a choice where one option is\nguaranteed to fail isn''t useful.\n\nVerified via curl: Office-in -> Hybrid-out now 422s with a clear message;\nOffice-in -> Office-out still succeeds. Verified in-browser: clocking out\nafter a Hybrid clock-in skips the picker entirely and completes directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c18d37ac5a5788d4f1b42e589343453537d833e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/c18d37ac5a5788d4f1b42e589343453537d833e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/db6a44100487d90057db5efed50821ca068afc26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/db6a44100487d90057db5efed50821ca068afc26","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGRiNmE0NDEwMDQ4N2Q5MDA1N2RiNWVmZWQ1MDgyMWNhMDY4YWZjMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/6d850c11289d5c0fec1429b924233f5e16c14538","sha":"6d850c11289d5c0fec1429b924233f5e16c14538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/6d850c11289d5c0fec1429b924233f5e16c14538"}],"sha":"db6a44100487d90057db5efed50821ca068afc26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/db6a44100487d90057db5efed50821ca068afc26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/6d850c11289d5c0fec1429b924233f5e16c14538/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T09:14:43Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T09:14:43Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Replace single-device status with a WhatsApp-style linked-devices list\n\nThe profile drawer only ever showed the current device''s own link status\n(\"Linked to you\" / \"Not linked yet\") with a self-only unlink button. An\nintern can already be linked from several devices at once (phone, laptop --\neach independently claims its own row in device_links), but there was no\nway to see or manage any of them except the one you happened to be using.\n\n- database/schema.mysql.sql: device_links gains a user_agent column,\n  captured once when a device is first claimed, purely for display.\n- api/config.php: deviceFriendlyLabel() turns a User-Agent into something\n  like \"Chrome on Windows\" (simple pattern matching, not a full UA parser --\n  good enough to tell devices apart in a short list). internDeviceLinks()\n  lists every device linked to the current intern, newest-used first, each\n  with a friendly last-active time (friendlyLastUsed(), same \"format in the\n  app''s own local time\" technique formatRecord() already uses for\n  clock_in/clock_out) and whether it''s the one making the request.\n  releaseDeviceLinkById() unlinks any one of them by id, still\n  ownership-checked (WHERE ... AND intern_id = ?) so it can only ever\n  remove a device that''s actually the caller''s own.\n- api/index.php: /api/device -> /api/devices (GET the list, POST\n  {deviceId} to unlink one -- any one, not just the current device, mirroring\n  how WhatsApp''s own linked-devices list lets you log out another session\n  remotely).\n- src/App.jsx: the drawer''s single \"My device\" row is now a \"Linked\n  devices\" list, each row tappable to unlink, the current device marked.\n\nApplied the schema change to both the local test DB and the real VPS DB.\nVerified end-to-end locally: two distinct devices (different User-Agents)\nboth show up with correct labels and last-active times, unlinking one\nremotely from the other''s session works and immediately frees it for a\ndifferent intern to claim, and unlinking a device that isn''t the caller''s\nown correctly 404s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9d7fbb990d5ab02d06821f012e48461c1020bf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/c9d7fbb990d5ab02d06821f012e48461c1020bf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/6d850c11289d5c0fec1429b924233f5e16c14538","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/6d850c11289d5c0fec1429b924233f5e16c14538","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDZkODUwYzExMjg5ZDVjMGZlYzE0MjliOTI0MjMzZjVlMTZjMTQ1Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/9cc255d3415a8c463f421c1ce1afec5be6988eda","sha":"9cc255d3415a8c463f421c1ce1afec5be6988eda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/9cc255d3415a8c463f421c1ce1afec5be6988eda"}],"sha":"6d850c11289d5c0fec1429b924233f5e16c14538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/6d850c11289d5c0fec1429b924233f5e16c14538"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/9cc255d3415a8c463f421c1ce1afec5be6988eda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T09:02:47Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T09:02:47Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Fix cron schedule rejected by Vercel''s Hobby plan limit\n\n\"*/10 * * * *\" (every 10 minutes) exceeds the Hobby plan''s once-per-day cron\nlimit, which almost certainly failed every deployment outright from the\nmoment this was added -- not just run less often than intended, the whole\nbuild would have been rejected.\n\nTwo separate once-daily crons cover both reminder checks within that limit:\none timed to land at the clock-in deadline, one inside the clock-out\nwindow. cron-reminders.php already checks both conditions on every run\nregardless of which cron fired it, so this doesn''t change its logic, only\nhow often it''s invoked. Vercel Cron schedules are always UTC, never the\napp''s APP_TIMEZONE, so both times are converted from the .env.example\ndefaults (Asia/Kuala_Lumpur, UTC+8) -- documented in cron-reminders.php''s\nheader since they''ll need updating by hand if REMINDER_CLOCK_IN_DEADLINE or\nREMINDER_SHIFT_END ever change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93ca6001af4380e35a44a3d1f9892cc42937a8d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/93ca6001af4380e35a44a3d1f9892cc42937a8d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/9cc255d3415a8c463f421c1ce1afec5be6988eda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/9cc255d3415a8c463f421c1ce1afec5be6988eda","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDljYzI1NWQzNDE1YThjNDYzZjQyMWMxY2UxYWZlYzViZTY5ODhlZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/b3f9be99f9a4de0bde1af0c464a7317dae0393dc","sha":"b3f9be99f9a4de0bde1af0c464a7317dae0393dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/b3f9be99f9a4de0bde1af0c464a7317dae0393dc"}],"sha":"9cc255d3415a8c463f421c1ce1afec5be6988eda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/9cc255d3415a8c463f421c1ce1afec5be6988eda"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/b3f9be99f9a4de0bde1af0c464a7317dae0393dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:39:57Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:39:57Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Fix invisible \"Dashboard\" breadcrumb text in dark mode\n\n.breadcrumbs strong used var(--brand-dark) for its text color -- fine in\nlight mode, but that token was redefined for dark mode as a near-black\nbackground color (for buttons), not text. On the dark page that made\n\"Dashboard\" render nearly the same color as the background behind it.\nSwitched to var(--neutral-dark), the token actually meant for primary text\nand already correctly redefined light-on-dark for the dark theme.\n\n(--brand-dark''s other two text-color usages, .brand and .main-nav a:hover,\nare dead CSS not rendered by the current App.jsx, so left alone.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"661c9df2018c6d9132b373d8e61784fbf9d2ddad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/661c9df2018c6d9132b373d8e61784fbf9d2ddad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/b3f9be99f9a4de0bde1af0c464a7317dae0393dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/b3f9be99f9a4de0bde1af0c464a7317dae0393dc","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGIzZjliZTk5ZjlhNGRlMGJkZTFhZjBjNDY0YTczMTdkYWUwMzkzZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/3b6b78bca5be3fb13f2754be3f2213eb417ac54a","sha":"3b6b78bca5be3fb13f2754be3f2213eb417ac54a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/3b6b78bca5be3fb13f2754be3f2213eb417ac54a"}],"sha":"b3f9be99f9a4de0bde1af0c464a7317dae0393dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/b3f9be99f9a4de0bde1af0c464a7317dae0393dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/3b6b78bca5be3fb13f2754be3f2213eb417ac54a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:35:27Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:35:27Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Fix year-long immutable cache on sw.js and other unhashed static files\n\nserveStaticFile() sent Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable\nfor every static file it served -- correct for Vite''s content-hashed bundle\noutput (dist/assets/*.js|css, whose filename changes whenever the content\ndoes), but wrong for everything else it also serves this way: sw.js,\nmanifest.webmanifest, favicon.svg, icons.svg. Those keep the same filename\nrelease to release, so telling every browser and the Vercel CDN edge \"this\nnever changes, cache it for a year, never revalidate\" means an updated\nsw.js is invisible to anyone who already has the old one cached --\nseemingly forever, regardless of how many new deployments ship.\n\nThis is very likely why sw.js''s own earlier fix (removing the ''/'' precache\nthat crashed install) didn''t appear to take effect on the live site even\nafter that deployment succeeded. Now only files actually under dist/assets/\nget the immutable treatment; everything else gets\nCache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate so an update is picked up on the\nnext request instead of sitting stale for up to a year.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11497098ef656ac3931fb22422f8abc24795b6a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/11497098ef656ac3931fb22422f8abc24795b6a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/3b6b78bca5be3fb13f2754be3f2213eb417ac54a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/3b6b78bca5be3fb13f2754be3f2213eb417ac54a","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDNiNmI3OGJjYTViZTNmYjEzZjI3NTRiZTNmMjIxM2ViNDE3YWM1NGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/1b0d03baef933b038c6a3de1c5fca8315c30a256","sha":"1b0d03baef933b038c6a3de1c5fca8315c30a256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/1b0d03baef933b038c6a3de1c5fca8315c30a256"}],"sha":"3b6b78bca5be3fb13f2754be3f2213eb417ac54a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/3b6b78bca5be3fb13f2754be3f2213eb417ac54a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/1b0d03baef933b038c6a3de1c5fca8315c30a256/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:23:45Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:23:45Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Remove the department row from the profile drawer\n\nDepartment is already visible in the home page''s location pill; showing it\nagain in the drawer (where it briefly replaced \"Full legal name\") was\nredundant. The drawer''s credential list is now just the Rizurf account.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49abab0a83b1dde0ac73f96605cb4d0b685fb30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/49abab0a83b1dde0ac73f96605cb4d0b685fb30e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/1b0d03baef933b038c6a3de1c5fca8315c30a256","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/1b0d03baef933b038c6a3de1c5fca8315c30a256","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDFiMGQwM2JhZWY5MzNiMDM4YzZhM2RlMWM1ZmNhODMxNWMzMGEyNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/f0cbf63b8122dc2bd70bac64a50b96d264f796d2","sha":"f0cbf63b8122dc2bd70bac64a50b96d264f796d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/f0cbf63b8122dc2bd70bac64a50b96d264f796d2"}],"sha":"1b0d03baef933b038c6a3de1c5fca8315c30a256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/1b0d03baef933b038c6a3de1c5fca8315c30a256"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/f0cbf63b8122dc2bd70bac64a50b96d264f796d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:20:15Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:20:15Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Show department name instead of raw department_id, replace \"Full legal name\"\n\nThe Intern Database only stores department_id (e.g. \"DEP-0001\") -- names\nlive in a separate service, department-api, per its own openapi.json:\n\"Resolve names/details via that service''s GET /api/departments\". Wired up\ndepartmentName()/departmentDirectory() in api/config.php, merged into the\nintern object /api/me returns as department_name, and used it for the home\nlocation pill (was showing the raw \"Dept DEP-0001\") and the profile\ndrawer''s now-renamed \"Department\" row (was \"Full legal name\", which just\nrepeated the drawer''s own heading).\n\ndepartment-api turns out to be currently broken -- confirmed directly, its\nown root path self-reports \"Invalid prisma.$executeRaw(): Can''t reach\ndatabase server\". Not something fixable here, so this degrades gracefully:\ndepartmentName() falls back to the raw code on any failure, exactly what\nwas already showing before this change, and both the token fetch and the\nlookup itself use a 4s timeout (httpJson() gained an optional\n$timeoutSeconds param for this) so a down dependency costs a few seconds\nonce, not on every request -- the result (success or failure) is cached to\na temp file for 60s/10min, mirroring health.php''s cachedCheck(). The whole\nthing starts showing real names automatically once department-api is\nfixed, no further change needed here.\n\nVerified against the real, currently-broken service (fails fast and caches\ncorrectly) and against mock data locally (both mock interns resolve to\ntheir real department names).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eff42c06a2a71a426353770c6cce282c4535fd87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/eff42c06a2a71a426353770c6cce282c4535fd87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/f0cbf63b8122dc2bd70bac64a50b96d264f796d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/f0cbf63b8122dc2bd70bac64a50b96d264f796d2","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGYwY2JmNjNiODEyMmRjMmJkNzBiYWM2NGE1MGI5NmQyNjRmNzk2ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/26121b6ce1996ac34778c16416c7175ccbd360f5","sha":"26121b6ce1996ac34778c16416c7175ccbd360f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/26121b6ce1996ac34778c16416c7175ccbd360f5"}],"sha":"f0cbf63b8122dc2bd70bac64a50b96d264f796d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/f0cbf63b8122dc2bd70bac64a50b96d264f796d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/26121b6ce1996ac34778c16416c7175ccbd360f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:16:41Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:16:41Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Add skeleton loading placeholders for the dashboard\n\nThe topbar avatar/name, welcome header, attendance hero card, and quick\nmetric cards all quietly showed fallback text (\"Intern\", \"—\", \"Ready to\nclock in?\") while /api/me and /api/attendance were still in flight, then\nsnapped to real content once they resolved. Now they show shaped skeleton\nplaceholders instead, sized to match the real content so nothing shifts\nwhen it swaps in. Same treatment for the History tab''s rows while\nattendance is still loading.\n\nThe office-verification card stays real immediately since it''s static\nconfig, not fetched data -- no reason to skeleton it.\n\nVerified with a temporary artificial delay on the /api/me fetch (reverted\nbefore committing) in both light and dark mode, then confirmed the swap to\nreal content is clean with no layout jump.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff600bf7d7013dc97c85358e1f035c7069d8f6d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/ff600bf7d7013dc97c85358e1f035c7069d8f6d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/26121b6ce1996ac34778c16416c7175ccbd360f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/26121b6ce1996ac34778c16416c7175ccbd360f5","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDI2MTIxYjZjZTE5OTZhYzM0Nzc4YzE2NDE2YzcxNzVjY2JkMzYwZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/7824cc07f48c31ae1d7cb09b6233b98c2427a782","sha":"7824cc07f48c31ae1d7cb09b6233b98c2427a782","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/7824cc07f48c31ae1d7cb09b6233b98c2427a782"}],"sha":"26121b6ce1996ac34778c16416c7175ccbd360f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/26121b6ce1996ac34778c16416c7175ccbd360f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/7824cc07f48c31ae1d7cb09b6233b98c2427a782/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:08:46Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:08:46Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Make the clock in/out reminder toggle actually send push notifications\n\nReal Web Push, not just a UI toggle: a subscribed device gets a browser\nnotification if it hasn''t clocked in past REMINDER_CLOCK_IN_DEADLINE, or is\nstill clocked in within REMINDER_LEAD_MINUTES of REMINDER_SHIFT_END.\n\n- database/schema.mysql.sql: push_subscriptions (one row per subscribed\n  device) and reminders_sent (dedup, so the cron''s re-check on every run\n  never double-sends the same reminder to the same intern on the same day).\n  Applied to both the local test DB and the real VPS DB.\n- api/subscribe.php: save/drop a device''s PushSubscription, gated behind the\n  normal gateway/session auth like every other endpoint.\n- api/cron-reminders.php: the actual sweep, via minishlink/web-push. Meant\n  to be hit by Vercel Cron (wired up in vercel.json, every 10 minutes) --\n  authenticates that caller with CRON_SECRET (Vercel sends it automatically\n  as \"Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET\" when that env var is set) rather\n  than a gateway token, since it''s the scheduler calling, not a person. Also\n  runs standalone via `php api/cron-reminders.php` for local testing.\n- src/App.jsx: the drawer toggle now actually requests Notification\n  permission, registers a real push subscription, and posts it to the\n  server -- reflecting real subscription state on load instead of just\n  defaulting to \"on\".\n- public/sw.js: handles the incoming push event and notification taps\n  (reusing the includeUncontrolled fix from the existing notificationclick\n  handling, so tapping a reminder focuses an already-open tab).\n- Fresh VAPID keypair (public half in src/App.jsx, private in .env) -- not\n  reusing the mismatched pair from an earlier, abandoned architecture.\n\nGenerated a fresh api/composer.json for minishlink/web-push +\nphp-http/guzzle7-adapter, since this branch never had one.\n\nNeeds a manual step this can''t do remotely: the Vercel project''s own\nenvironment variables need VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY, VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY,\nVAPID_SUBJECT, REMINDER_CLOCK_IN_DEADLINE, REMINDER_SHIFT_END,\nREMINDER_LEAD_MINUTES, and CRON_SECRET added (see .env.example) -- local\n.env changes never reach the deployed app.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19395c4d2a4c561776154b2851c785b79c183b8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/19395c4d2a4c561776154b2851c785b79c183b8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/7824cc07f48c31ae1d7cb09b6233b98c2427a782","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/7824cc07f48c31ae1d7cb09b6233b98c2427a782","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDc4MjRjYzA3ZjQ4YzMxYWUxZDdjYjA5YjYyMzNiOThjMjQyN2E3ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/c43f25b7a8b7257f210349fbf5c8ddac90109fd2","sha":"c43f25b7a8b7257f210349fbf5c8ddac90109fd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/c43f25b7a8b7257f210349fbf5c8ddac90109fd2"}],"sha":"7824cc07f48c31ae1d7cb09b6233b98c2427a782","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/7824cc07f48c31ae1d7cb09b6233b98c2427a782"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/c43f25b7a8b7257f210349fbf5c8ddac90109fd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T06:51:54Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T06:51:54Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Add dark mode\n\nA toggle in the profile drawer (next to the notification toggle) switches\nbetween light and dark. Defaults to the OS''s prefers-color-scheme on first\nvisit, then remembers an explicit choice in localStorage. An inline script\nin index.html applies the stored/detected theme before React mounts, so\nthere''s no flash of the wrong theme on load.\n\nMost colors already came from the --brand-*/--neutral-* custom properties,\nso redefining those under [data-theme=''dark''] covers a lot -- but a fair\namount of this file was written with literal light hex colors instead of a\ntoken (notices, status tags, metric icon chips, the modal, the mode picker,\nthe bottom nav, the toggle track, the logout button), so those needed their\nown dark overrides too. Also fixes a real regression from adopting the\ngateway architecture as main: index.html''s title had reverted to the old\n\"Northstar Attendance\" placeholder, which the other (now archived) lineage\nhad already fixed to \"Rizurf Realty Attendance\" -- lost when that branch''s\nhistory was set aside in favor of this one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"122c2c1d32644b400035762d6a07c0858d16143b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/122c2c1d32644b400035762d6a07c0858d16143b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/c43f25b7a8b7257f210349fbf5c8ddac90109fd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/c43f25b7a8b7257f210349fbf5c8ddac90109fd2","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGM0M2YyNWI3YThiNzI1N2YyMTAzNDlmYmY1YzhkZGFjOTAxMDlmZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/71c164b84bfec80b29a1739f1738740915d29679","sha":"71c164b84bfec80b29a1739f1738740915d29679","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/71c164b84bfec80b29a1739f1738740915d29679"}],"sha":"c43f25b7a8b7257f210349fbf5c8ddac90109fd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/c43f25b7a8b7257f210349fbf5c8ddac90109fd2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/71c164b84bfec80b29a1739f1738740915d29679/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T03:38:52Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T03:38:52Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Use persistent PDO connections to cut per-request DB latency\n\nMeasured against the real VPS DB: queries themselves are fast (15-30ms),\nbut establishing the connection (TCP+TLS to a remote host) costs 40-430ms,\npaid fresh on every request since this runs as short-lived serverless\nfunctions with no long-running process to hold a connection open between\nrequests. PDO::ATTR_PERSISTENT lets a warm function container reuse an\nexisting MySQL socket across invocations instead of re-handshaking every\ntime. Existing rollback-on-exception handling in attendance.php already\nguards against a stuck transaction poisoning a reused connection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1436ebd2597005321a35d4714942bb8650865358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/1436ebd2597005321a35d4714942bb8650865358"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/71c164b84bfec80b29a1739f1738740915d29679","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/71c164b84bfec80b29a1739f1738740915d29679","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDcxYzE2NGI4NGJmZWM4MGIyOWExNzM5ZjE3Mzg3NDA5MTVkMjk2Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/1df0d34268eecd28c8de166465e422a4611694b0","sha":"1df0d34268eecd28c8de166465e422a4611694b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/1df0d34268eecd28c8de166465e422a4611694b0"}],"sha":"71c164b84bfec80b29a1739f1738740915d29679","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/71c164b84bfec80b29a1739f1738740915d29679"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/1df0d34268eecd28c8de166465e422a4611694b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:44:17Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:44:17Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Sign out now lands on the gateway itself, not back through ''/''\n\nReloading our own ''/'' after clearing the session still goes through\nrequirePageSession()''s redirect to the gateway -- but if the gateway''s own\nSSO session is still alive in that browser, it can silently hand back a\nfresh code and sign the visitor straight back into this app, which isn''t\nwhat \"sign out\" should feel like. POST /api/signout now returns the\ngateway''s own URL, and the frontend navigates there directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ecef658c58e11f1bc6aec7a41c1cf4925b168708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/ecef658c58e11f1bc6aec7a41c1cf4925b168708"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/1df0d34268eecd28c8de166465e422a4611694b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/1df0d34268eecd28c8de166465e422a4611694b0","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDFkZjBkMzQyNjhlZWNkMjhjOGRlMTY2NDY1ZTQyMmE0NjExNjk0YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/5e73897460d2a7b583e5cd95b088b06fa0ffb38f","sha":"5e73897460d2a7b583e5cd95b088b06fa0ffb38f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/5e73897460d2a7b583e5cd95b088b06fa0ffb38f"}],"sha":"1df0d34268eecd28c8de166465e422a4611694b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/1df0d34268eecd28c8de166465e422a4611694b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/5e73897460d2a7b583e5cd95b088b06fa0ffb38f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:38:15Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:38:15Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Add a working sign-out button to the profile drawer\n\nReplaces the dead \"Account settings\" button (no onClick handler) and the\n\"sign out there\" note pointing away from the app. POST /api/signout clears\nthis app''s own session cookie (clearAppSession()); the frontend then\nreloads ''/'', which sends an unauthenticated visitor back through the\ngateway''s sign-in flow.\n\nPer MICROAPP_AUTH.md S24, sign-out is authoritative at the gateway, not\nhere -- this only ends the local app session. On a device shared with other\ninterns, someone still signed in at the gateway itself may get bounced\nstraight back in without re-entering credentials; the UI copy says so.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4733c071b39722d9f7f678a508d909a4daa64cfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/4733c071b39722d9f7f678a508d909a4daa64cfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/5e73897460d2a7b583e5cd95b088b06fa0ffb38f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/5e73897460d2a7b583e5cd95b088b06fa0ffb38f","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDVlNzM4OTc0NjBkMmE3YjU4M2U1Y2Q5NWIwODhiMDZmYTBmZmIzOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/c02bb83ee61ec4ac545af1b807582a9371189d92","sha":"c02bb83ee61ec4ac545af1b807582a9371189d92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/c02bb83ee61ec4ac545af1b807582a9371189d92"}],"sha":"5e73897460d2a7b583e5cd95b088b06fa0ffb38f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/5e73897460d2a7b583e5cd95b088b06fa0ffb38f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/c02bb83ee61ec4ac545af1b807582a9371189d92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:20:33Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:20:33Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Fix service worker install crash on real auth (no more DEV_ALLOW_NO_AUTH)\n\nAPP_SHELL precached ''/'' and ''/index.html'' via cache.addAll(), which is\nall-or-nothing. In real auth mode (unlike the DEV_ALLOW_NO_AUTH bypass this\nwas always tested under), an unauthenticated visit to ''/'' redirects (302)\nto the gateway -- not a cacheable response -- and ''/index.html'' 404s\noutright since vercel.json''s build step moves it to app.shell.html. Either\none crashed the whole install step with \"Failed to execute ''addAll''\".\n\nOnly precache the one file that''s genuinely static in both modes\n(manifest.webmanifest), and don''t let a future bad entry crash install\neither way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5feb6207c3994b9b4960665e68d7de578b7b44f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/5feb6207c3994b9b4960665e68d7de578b7b44f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/c02bb83ee61ec4ac545af1b807582a9371189d92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"ht