b.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/eddc2ccf064b4cb76507aae8c2dfd1d9ffcd9a38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T07:44:53Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T07:44:53Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Remove the notification bell and Profile tab\n\nThe bell icon in the topbar didn''t do anything when tapped -- no dropdown\nor panel exists -- so drop it. Profile is now reached only via the topbar\navatar chip, so also drop the redundant Profile tab from the bottom nav.\n\nWhile in there, fix the bottom nav''s grid: it was still repeat(5, 1fr) from\nwhen there were 5 tabs (Holidays and Profile have since been removed),\nleaving the remaining tabs lopsided instead of centered. Now it''s a\ncentered 3-column layout with a sensible max-width instead of stretching\nedge-to-edge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e6d86ae2571f1b85a9a69b8845514f666fdb7f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/8e6d86ae2571f1b85a9a69b8845514f666fdb7f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/eddc2ccf064b4cb76507aae8c2dfd1d9ffcd9a38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.g