616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/a97d6b606755257688af3e47933f931e4c455e9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T07:26:32Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T07:26:32Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Fix mobile layout bugs and trim the profile drawer\n\n- Opening the profile drawer set activeTab to ''profile'', which existing CSS\n  uses to hide the whole dashboard -- since the old profile-preview tab\n  panel that used to fill that space is gone, closing the drawer left a\n  blank home screen. The drawer''s open state is now tracked independently\n  of tab navigation.\n- The notification bell was a 30x30px touch target on mobile, under the\n  44px minimum; sized it up.\n- The topbar breadcrumb wrapped to two lines on narrow phones (<=380px,\n  e.g. iPhone SE); it now collapses to just the current page name there.\n- Drop Reference, Arrangement, and Internship duration from the profile\n  drawer''s credential list, and the now-unused formatDay() helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"106eb2c458ed26b21323500eb83d0fadc3239943","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/106eb2c458ed26b21323500eb83d0fadc3239943"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/a97d6b606755257688af3e47933f931e4c455e9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/a97d6b606755257688af3e47933f931e4c455e9d","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGE5N2Q2YjYwNjc1NTI1NzY4OGFmM2U0NzkzM2Y5MzFlNGM0NTVlOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/90474078656efb54a1fb1ce13077530e54ac7591","sha":"90474078656efb54a1fb1ce13077530e54ac7591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/90474078656efb54a1fb1ce13077530e54ac7591"}],"sha":"a97d6b606755257688af3e47933f931e4c455e9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/a97d6b606755257688af3e47933f931e4c455e9d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/90474078656efb54a1fb1ce13077530e54ac7591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T07:11:44Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T07:11:44Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Add device-linking anti-buddy-punching check and simplify the app UI\n\nRebuilds the buddy-punching prevention feature on top of the gateway/VPS\narchitecture: an HttpOnly rizurf_device_id cookie claims a device for the\nfirst intern who clocks in from it, and a device_links table blocks any\nother intern''s clock-in from that same device (409). Adds a DEV_MOCK_INTERNS\nflag, gated behind DEV_ALLOW_NO_AUTH, so the flow can be built and tested\nagainst local MySQL without live VPS/Intern-Database/gateway credentials.\n\nAlso trims the PWA down to what''s actually used: drops the Holidays tab,\nthe dead intermediate Profile page, the estimated-payout and internship-\ntimeline cards, MC/Leave, and the PDF export button, and relabels the\nnotification toggle to \"Clock in/out reminder\".\n\nFixes router.php''s local dev server: it told PHP''s built-in server to serve\ndist/ files directly via `return false`, but the docroot is the project\nroot, not dist/, so every JS/CSS request 404''d. Defers to api/index.php''s\nown static-file fallback instead, which already handles this correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b6279bc375453f142114176004922b083f8786e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/1b6279bc375453f142114176004922b083f8786e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/90474078656efb54a1fb1ce13077530e54ac7591","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/90474078656efb54a1fb1ce13077530e54ac7591","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDkwNDc0MDc4NjU2ZWZiNTRhMWZiMWNlMTMwNzc1MzBlNTRhYzc1OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/83980c356031f24f275f179a712f184b5fa31518","sha":"83980c356031f24f275f179a712f184b5fa31518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/83980c356031f24f275f179a712f184b5fa31518"}],"sha":"90474078656efb54a1fb1ce13077530e54ac7591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/90474078656efb54a1fb1ce13077530e54ac7591"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/2865f682c279dbc4e8ccdd858df5182f1d749a7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:34:30Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:34:30Z","email":"lohendraa1202@gmail.com","name":"LOHENDRAA"},"message":"Add multi-employee identity, device-based buddy-punching prevention, and remove breaks\n\n- New employees table + \"who''s clocking in?\" picker (no passwords -- the\n  actual security boundary is the device check below, not a login screen)\n- Device linking: a device claims whichever employee first uses it and is\n  refused for any other employee afterward. The device id lives in a\n  server-issued HttpOnly cookie (not client-side localStorage), so it can''t\n  be reset with a console command to dodge the check. Settings > My Device\n  shows link status explicitly and lets you link a new device yourself\n  (e.g. after a hardware change) with no admin step needed\n- attendance.php, leave.php, subscribe.php, send-reminders.php all resolve\n  identity per-request now instead of a single hardcoded employee\n- Fixed .env path resolution, server timezone (was Europe/Berlin instead of\n  the office''s Asia/Kuala_Lumpur, silently skewing on-time/late and\n  reminder timing), and a \"via undefined\" display bug in the attendance\n  mode text\n- Removed the break/lunch feature entirely (frontend, backend, and the\n  break_* columns on attendance_records) per request\n- Corrected Northstar -> Rizurf Realty branding in index.html and the PWA\n  manifest; service worker now only registers in production builds\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd9c7675a22455e44198043a4c6dfb54ab54eb7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/dd9c7675a22455e44198043a4c6dfb54ab54eb7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/2865f682c279dbc4e8ccdd858df5182f1d749a7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184071616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA","id":184071616,"login":"LOHENDRAA","node_id":"U_kgDOCvi1wA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LOHENDRAA/repos"