"https://api.github.com/users/Tauedea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tauedea","id":309695658,"login":"Tauedea","node_id":"U_kgDOEnWUqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tauedea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tauedea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tauedea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tauedea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tauedea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tauedea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/83980c356031f24f275f179a712f184b5fa31518/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T01:42:39Z","email":"tauedea@intern.crevascale.com","name":"Taux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T01:42:39Z","email":"tauedea@intern.crevascale.com","name":"Taux"},"message":"Intern DB failures degrade gracefully + say why (no more blanket 502)\n\ninternDbToken/internDbGet/httpJson now throw (InternDbException carrying a safe detail string) instead of respond()+exit, so resolveInternId can catch them and return reason:lookup_failed + detail. /api/me and GET /api/attendance|/api/leave stay 200 with linked:false when the Intern Database is unreachable - the SPA renders the person from their session and shows a ''could not reach the Intern Database (<detail>)'' banner instead of a 502. Writes (POST) return a clean 502 ''unavailable, try again''. detail example: ''gateway /oauth/token returned 401 (UNAUTHORIZED)'' - which is what a wrong INTERN_DB_CLIENT_ID/SECRET on the deploy produces.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b7e2db8babe96b69f5e1284e5b9434c26e12a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/9b7e2db8babe96b69f5e1284e5b9434c26e12a66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizu