L_DIRECT scheme (postgresql:// or mysql://) and SET time_zone on MySQL - switching engines is an env change. Postgres path regression-tested against live Supabase (health ok, attendance returns rows); MySQL DDL validated with sqlglot''s MySQL parser.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58114333b7c116f94a30e706304f61723a034602","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/58114333b7c116f94a30e706304f61723a034602"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/477bca761435782d19f6ab28c7c14a38f48e7516","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266114720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tauxhd","id":266114720,"login":"tauxhd","node_id":"U_kgDOD9yWoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/477bca761435782d19f6ab28c7c14a38f48e7516","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKDQ3N2JjYTc2MTQzNTc4MmQxOWY2YWIyOGM3YzE0YTM4ZjQ4ZTc1MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/d79646fac979c5a1442af5a532e331fba1c711a8","sha":"d79646fac979c5a1442af5a532e331fba1c711a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/d79646fac979c5a1442af5a532e331fba1c711a8"}],"sha":"477bca761435782d19f6ab28c7c14a38f48e7516","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/477bca761435782d19f6ab28c7c14a38f48e7516"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266114720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tauxhd","id":266114720,"login":"tauxhd","node_id":"U_kgDOD9yWoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/d79646fac979c5a1442af5a532e331fba1c711a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:37:29Z","email":"gabitautau@gmail.com","name":"Tauedea"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:37:29Z","email":"gabitautau@gmail.com","name":"Tauedea"},"message":"Declare x-rizurf on the /health and /openapi.json operations too (SS-27)\n\nConformance flagged ''every operation declares x-rizurf'' - the checker wants it on every operation, not just the /api ones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfdb518125ea2a2ac590669375a951e086201c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/cfdb518125ea2a2ac590669375a951e086201c8c"},"ur