lowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tauxhd","id":266114720,"login":"tauxhd","node_id":"U_kgDOD9yWoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/ca618c5be34f6f6153b691a553b999beb4fafa83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:34:26Z","email":"gabitautau@gmail.com","name":"Tauedea"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:34:26Z","email":"gabitautau@gmail.com","name":"Tauedea"},"message":"Fix HTML error leak on Vercel (TZ=:UTC notice broke JSON)\n\nRoot cause: Vercel sets TZ=:UTC, which date_default_timezone_set() rejects with a Notice; display_errors was on in vercel-php, so the Notice + ''headers already sent'' cascade printed HTML before the JSON body. Fixes: http.php forces display_errors=0 / log_errors=1; config.php strips the leading colon and validates TZ against timezone_identifiers_list() with an Asia/Kuala_Lumpur fallback; envOrFail() now throws (caught by the checks / exception handler) instead of respond()+exit; /health always returns 200 per SS-2 with status carrying ok/degraded/down. Verified locally with TZ=:UTC and no .env: /health 200 valid JSON, /openapi.json 200, 404/405/401 envelopes intact; with env present, /health -> status ok, all checks pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b73d59d3f39d93e0a2a23693dd9fc46743f6fbd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/b73d59d3f39d93e0a2a23693dd9fc46743f6fbd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/ca618c5be34f6f6153b691a553b999beb4fafa83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266114720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tauxhd","id":266114720,"login":"tauxhd","node_id":"U_kgDOD9yWoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/ca618c5be34f6f6153b691a553b999beb4fafa83","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGNhNjE4YzViZTM0ZjZmNjE1M2I2OTFhNTUzYjk5OWJlYjRmYWZhODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/dabedfbcdd07908536361312eb0858b8308f59c8","sha":"dabedfbcdd07908536361312eb0858b8308f59c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/dabedfbcdd07908536361312eb0858b8308f59c8"}],"sha":"ca618c5be34f6f6153b691a553b999beb4fafa83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/ca618c5be34f6f6153b691a553b999beb4fafa83"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266114720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tauxhd","id":266114720,"login":"tauxhd","node_id":"U_kgDOD9yWoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/dabedfbcdd07908536361312eb0858b8308f59c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:26:22Z","email":"gabitautau@gmail.com","name":"Tauedea"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:26:22Z","email":"gabitautau@gmail.com","name":"Tauedea"},"message":"Add gateway-conformant service layer (health, openapi, auth) + Vercel PHP\n\nFront controller api/index.php: X-Correlation-ID on every response, SS-5 error envelope for unrouted paths / wrong method / auth failures, no-store headers. GET /health (SS-2) with database + gateway + intern_database checks. GET /openapi.json (SS-3/SS-23/SS-27) with full x-rizurf catalogue metadata. /api/attendance and /api/leave now require a verified gateway bearer token (RS256 against the gateway JWKS, iss/aud/exp/token_use enforced - api/gateway.php) or, with DEV_ALLOW_NO_AUTH, a dev pass; missing scope is 403. vercel.json runs vercel-php and routes all non-static paths to the front controller; router.php mirrors it for local php -S. Tested locally: health/openapi shape, 404/405 envelopes, 401 (no token / forged header / bad token), aud+tamper+token_use rejection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b1f0e17ee18f0463c02de014cb312b0a12e2679","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/trees/5b1f0e17ee18f0463c02de014cb312b0a12e2679"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/git/commits/dabedfbcdd07908536361312eb0858b8308f59c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266114720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tauxhd","id":266114720,"login":"tauxhd","node_id":"U_kgDOD9yWoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/dabedfbcdd07908536361312eb0858b8308f59c8","node_id":"C_kwDOUTCO_NoAKGRhYmVkZmJjZGQwNzkwODUzNjM2MTMxMmViMDg1OGI4MzA4ZjU5Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commit/8b1c04c8a1b8a8afeb56b08d71093f92e8d44f8d","sha":"8b1c04c8a1b8a8afeb56b08d71093f92e8d44f8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/8b1c04c8a1b8a8afeb56b08d71093f92e8d44f8d"}],"sha":"dabedfbcdd07908536361312eb0858b8308f59c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/dabedfbcdd07908536361312eb0858b8308f59c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266114720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tauxhd","id":266114720,"login":"tauxhd","node_id":"U_kgDOD9yWoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tauxhd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LOHENDRAA/rizurf-attendance-app/commits/8b1c04c8a1b8a8afeb56b08d71093f92e8d44f8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:05:32Z","email":"gabitautau@gmail.com","name":"Tauedea"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:05:32Z","email":"gabitautau@gmail.com","name":"Tauedea"},"message":"Move attendance API to Supabase Postgres + live Intern DB\n\nSchema: app_identities, attendance_records, leave_requests + attendance_feed view; no interns table (owned by the Intern Database service, resolved live via its API); no password column (gateway auth, SS-24). API: MySQL -> Postgres via pdo_pgsql; config.php resolves interns from intern-database.vercel.app with a client_credentials token; currentInternId() is the auth seam the gateway sign-in will replace; response shapes unchanged. Adds .env.example, gitignores .env, adds MICROAPP_AUTH.md / RIZURF_API_TEMPLATE.md / database/AUTH-MODEL.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tr