usercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/611becf9b6902448a3aa6384c1550e8eea14cb7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:45:17Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:45:17Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(dashboard): 詳情面板改顯示累積題數，區分窗口統計與歷史累積\n\n問題（Why）：\n\n  AnalyticsService 效能優化後（commit 1f2a3b4），getStudentDetail 只撈\n  最近 100 筆 attempts 以降低讀取量（從 ~1500 筆降到 ~110 筆，↓90%）。\n  但這造成一個副作用：\n\n    學生詳情面板的「共 X 題」變成「最近 100 筆內的題數」，\n    而不是「該學生的歷史累積練習量」。\n\n  對老師而言，「累積題數」才有意義：\n    - 可以用來鼓勵學生（「你已經練了 1074 題！」）\n    - 與左側學生列表顯示的題數一致（列表走 classStats 累積）\n\n  讓詳情面板顯示「共 100 題」對老師毫無意義——那只是工程上的\n  trade-off，不是學生的真實練習量。\n\n修正（How）：\n\n  採用「雙軌資料來源」策略，讓 UI 按語意選用合適的資料：\n\n  1. TeacherDashboard.tsx\n     - 新增 useMemo：從現有的 students 陣列（來自 classStats 累積）\n       找出當前選中的學生，取得 cumulativeTotalAttempts 與\n       cumulativeCorrectCount\n     - 傳入 StudentDetailPanel 作為新的 optional props\n\n  2. StudentDetailPanel.tsx\n     - Props interface 新增兩個 optional 欄位：\n       cumulativeTotalAttempts, cumulativeCorrectCount\n     - 顯示時：優先使用累積值，fallback 到 analytics 的窗口值\n     - 加上「（累積）」或「（最近 100 筆）」標籤，明確標示語意\n     - 「尚無練習紀錄」的判斷改用累積值（否則今天沒練習的學生會被\n       誤判為「從未練習」）\n\n  設計原則：\n    - 累積數字（總題數、答對數）→ 從 classStats 讀（歷史真相）\n    - 診斷圖表（錯誤分佈、反應時間、弱點單字）→ 從 attempts 讀\n      （近期行為，本就該反映「現在」，不是「歷史累積」）\n    - 成長曲線 → 從 dailySnapshots 讀（長期趨勢）\n\n  三者語意不同、資料來源不同、但都是有意識的選擇，而非巧合。\n\n影響（What）：\n\n  部署後，教師打開學生詳情面板會看到：\n\n    修正前：共 100 題，答對 90 題（僅最近 100 筆窗口）\n    修正後：共 1074 題，答對 883 題（累積）（與列表一致）\n\n  圖表與診斷分析不受影響，仍為最近 100 筆的統計。\n  若 classStats 無法取得（fallback 情境），自動退回窗口值並標示\n  「（最近 100 筆）」，零破壞性。\n\n  改動範圍：僅兩個 UI 檔案、約 25 行，不觸及資料層與讀取路徑。\n\nRefs: AnalyticsService 有界查詢優化的配套 UI 調整","tree":{"sha":"8c1b7903a9c3d8cd203fe2a77c588d2924d2c347","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/8c1b7903a9c3d8cd203fe2a77c588d2924d2c347"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/611becf9b6902448a3aa6384c1550e8eea14cb7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/star