d17ecb4ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T08:50:32Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T08:50:32Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"docs(readme): 更新 DDA 門檻修正、新診斷腳本與測試數量\n\n- scripts/ 樹狀圖新增 5 個 .mjs 診斷／修復腳本\n- 新增設計決策：等級門檻必須低於滑動視窗，否則升級數學上不可達\n- 測試數量 126 → 131\n- 補充 Adaptive difficulty / 適應性分級 的門檻細節","tree":{"sha":"5e64e6bc90881bbe5ab56b96d3a19134a9657459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/5e64e6bc90881bbe5ab56b96d3a19134a9657459"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/8a963f9eb829bb84fad6c28ec4b8d97d17ecb4ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/8a963f9eb829bb84fad6c28ec4b8d97d17ecb4ba","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDhhOTYzZjllYjgyOWJiODRmYWQ2YzI4ZWM0YjhkOTdkMTdlY2I0YmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/27ca1961b4a4b917da9af5c0a0935ccdfe0cefcf","sha":"27ca1961b4a4b917da9af5c0a0935ccdfe0cefcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/27ca1961b4a4b917da9af5c0a0935ccdfe0cefcf"}],"sha":"8a963f9eb829bb84fad6c28ec4b8d97d17ecb4ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/8a963f9eb829bb84fad6c28ec4b8d97d17ecb4ba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/27ca1961b4a4b917da9af5c0a0935ccdfe0cefcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T08:32:04Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T08:32:04Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"fix(progression): 修正升級門檻與 attemptsInCurrentLevel 計算\n\n問題：劉展成（L1）連續 6 天正確率 76%～98%，卻從未被升級。\n\n根因有二：\n\n1. PROMOTE_MIN_ATTEMPTS_IN_LEVEL = 30，但 PerformanceTracker 的滑動\n   窗口只有 30 筆，且選題策略固定混入 ~10% probe（更高難度單字），\n   導致「當前 L1 的答題數」最多只能達到 27，數學上永遠無法通過。\n\n2. PROMOTE_MAX_AVG_TIME_MS = 5000 過嚴。在 8 秒題限下，學生的平均\n   作答時間（含寫字、辨識、思考）普遍落在 5～7 秒，導致高正確率的\n   學生被時間門檻擋住。\n\n修正：\n\n- RuleBasedStrategy：放寬 PROMOTE_MAX_AVG_TIME_MS 至 7000，\n  PROMOTE_MIN_ATTEMPTS_IN_LEVEL 降至 20，DEMOTE_MIN_ATTEMPTS_IN_LEVEL\n  降至 15；並將 THRESHOLDS 匯出為 RULE_BASED_THRESHOLDS，讓測試\n  可相對引用，避免調參時測試與實作耦合。\n\n- PerformanceTracker：attemptsInCurrentLevel 由「=== currentLevel」\n  改為「<= currentLevel」（查不到 level 時保守計入）。理由：對 L1\n  學生而言，probe 的 L2 單字屬超綱挑戰，不應計入「當前難度的表現」；\n  反之，被降級的學生也不應被過去的更高難度作答懲罰。\n\n- progression.test.ts：新增 4 個邊界測試（attemptsInCurrentLevel\n  的 =門檻 / 正確率 = 門檻 / 反應時間 = 門檻 / 反應時間 = 門檻 - 1），\n  全部改為相對 RULE_BASED_THRESHOLDS 讀取。\n\n驗證：\n\n- npm test：131/131 通過\n- simulateEvaluation 劉展成（L1）：舊門檻 hold → 新門檻 promote\n- simulateEvaluation 李芷柔（L2）：新舊門檻皆 hold（正確率 43.3% < 85%，\n  符合預期）\n\n影響：劉展成下次登入答滿 10 題後，DDA 評估將觸發並升級至 L2。\n\nRefs: DDA 升級門檻設計缺陷","tree":{"sha":"18a5f5f16090fb83ff485c0aeabd017c386c85ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/18a5f5f16090fb83ff485c0aeabd017c386c85ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/27ca1961b4a4b917da9af5c0a0935ccdfe0cefcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/27ca1961b4a4b917da9af5c0a0935ccdfe0cefcf","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDI3Y2ExOTYxYjRhNGI5MTdkYTlhZjVjMGEwOTM1Y2NkZmUwY2VmY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/877db321cbfb64bbe6d75ce8dcb8573f434ccd5c","sha":"877db321cbfb64bbe6d75ce8dcb8573f434ccd5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/877db321cbfb64bbe6d75ce8dcb8573f434ccd5c"}],"sha":"27ca1961b4a4b917da9af5c0a0935ccdfe0cefcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/27ca1961b4a4b917da9af5c0a0935ccdfe0cefcf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/877db321cbfb64bbe6d75ce8dcb8573f434ccd5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:49:29Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:49:29Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(dashboard): 弱點單字改為最近 7 天，快取加 TTL + 手動重新整理\n\nWhy：1) 弱點單字原本統計全部歷史，學生幾週前的錯誤會長期占據 Top 5，掩蓋當前真正需要解決的問題。形成性評估需要「及時、可操作的介入」，7 天是學術與工業推薦窗口。2) useStudentDetail 快取無 TTL，老師看到的是早上載入的資料。3) 缺少「最後更新」時間提示，老師無法判斷資料新鮮度。\n\nHow：1) studentAnalyzer 加 AnalyzeStudentOptions.weakWordsWindowDays，只影響 Top 5 統計範圍。新增 filterByTimeWindow 純函式。2) AnalyticsService 呼叫兩次 analyzeStudent（preAnalysis + 最終）都傳入 7 天窗口，確保 wordIds 一致。3) useStudentDetail 快取改為 { data, timestamp } 結構，CACHE_TTL_MS = 5min，實作 Stale-While-Revalidate。回傳 lastFetchedAt。4) TeacherDashboard 解構並傳遞 lastFetchedAt + refetch 給 Panel。5) StudentDetailPanel 加「🕐 最後更新」+「🔄 重新整理」按鈕。\n\n設計依據：Stale-While-Revalidate 是 Netflix、Vercel、SWR 等工業標準快取策略。TTL 5 分鐘是教育儀表板常見設定。\n\n不影響：正確率、錯誤分佈、成長曲線、雷達圖、每日快照仍為全部歷史。只改 Top 5 的統計範圍。\n\n驗證：npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤。npm test 126 個測試全綠。","tree":{"sha":"5f870c984a970052fd0e8902a377b26af0c49113","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/5f870c984a970052fd0e8902a377b26af0c49113"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/877db321cbfb64bbe6d75ce8dcb8573f434ccd5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/877db321cbfb64bbe6d75ce8dcb8573f434ccd5c","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDg3N2RiMzIxY2JmYjY0YmJlNmQ3NWNlOGRjYjg1NzNmNDM0Y2NkNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/d2d62e79322a040204ee9d1d5f22c0fbd99dc6bd","sha":"d2d62e79322a040204ee9d1d5f22c0fbd99dc6bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/d2d62e79322a040204ee9d1d5f22c0fbd99dc6bd"}],"sha":"877db321cbfb64bbe6d75ce8dcb8573f434ccd5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/877db321cbfb64bbe6d75ce8dcb8573f434ccd5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/d2d62e79322a040204ee9d1d5f22c0fbd99dc6bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:19:38Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:19:38Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"fix(assignment): 修正「清空 targetLevel 改回自動」不會真的生效\n\nWhy：老師把作業的 targetLevel 從 L2 改回「不指定」時，表單送出的 payload 是 targetLevel: undefined。removeUndefined 把它過濾掉，導致 Firestore 的 updateDoc 收到空物件、舊值 L2 保留。老師以為改了，但系統沒改。\n\nHow：在 updateAssignment 中把 undefined 轉成 Firestore 的 deleteField()，讓「清空」變成「真的刪除該欄位」。createAssignment 不變（新建時 undefined 欄位本來就不該存在）。\n\n影響範圍：所有 optional 欄位（targetLevel、speechRate、speechFloorRate、quotaExceededBehavior、timeLimitMs、reviewFocus）都受益。目前這些欄位在 FormState 都有預設值，只有 targetLevel 會是 undefined。\n\n驗證：npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤。編輯作業把 targetLevel 改回「不指定」後，Firestore 的 targetLevel 欄位應該被刪除。","tree":{"sha":"d605e76d1f569bfa2112272085162f9a21d3c828","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/d605e76d1f569bfa2112272085162f9a21d3c828"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/d2d62e79322a040204ee9d1d5f22c0fbd99dc6bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/d2d62e79322a040204ee9d1d5f22c0fbd99dc6bd","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGQyZDYyZTc5MzIyYTA0MDIwNGVlOWQxZDVmMjJjMGZiZDk5ZGM2YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/1fec9ba64fd1ac242ab297327d93b96c81343e3f","sha":"1fec9ba64fd1ac242ab297327d93b96c81343e3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/1fec9ba64fd1ac242ab297327d93b96c81343e3f"}],"sha":"d2d62e79322a040204ee9d1d5f22c0fbd99dc6bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/d2d62e79322a040204ee9d1d5f22c0fbd99dc6bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/1fec9ba64fd1ac242ab297327d93b96c81343e3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:10:12Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:10:12Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"fix(progression): 加下界保護，防止連續答錯把 L1 降到 L0\n\nWhy：原本的下界保護只在「正確率 < 50%」時生效。若學生 L1 且正確率 ≥ 50%，但連續答錯 5 題，會走 canDemoteByStreak 分支 → demote(1 - 1 = 0) → 變成 L0。而單字庫沒有 L0，學生實際上看到的是 L1 的題目，造成顯示與行為不一致。\n\nHow：1) 移除原本只在「正確率 < 50%」時擋的下界檢查。2) 在降級分支（canDemoteByRate || canDemoteByStreak）前加入 currentLevel <= minLevel 的檢查，若已達最低等級則 hold。3) 加 2 個測試驗證 L1 無論何種降級條件都無法降到 L0。\n\n實際案例：林家萱（802_25）被系統降到 L0，實際出題是 L1。修正後不會再發生。\n\n驗證：npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤。npm test 全綠（progression 從 12 個測試增為 14 個）。","tree":{"sha":"6d39e435bf8539c671157b4d46b50e5a021639c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/6d39e435bf8539c671157b4d46b50e5a021639c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/1fec9ba64fd1ac242ab297327d93b96c81343e3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/1fec9ba64fd1ac242ab297327d93b96c81343e3f","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDFmZWM5YmE2NGZkMWFjMjQyYWIyOTczMjdkOTNiOTZjODEzNDNlM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/15da652ed1351d9e4164f94b251e1ed4f2377a41","sha":"15da652ed1351d9e4164f94b251e1ed4f2377a41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/15da652ed1351d9e4164f94b251e1ed4f2377a41"}],"sha":"1fec9ba64fd1ac242ab297327d93b96c81343e3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/1fec9ba64fd1ac242ab297327d93b96c81343e3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/15da652ed1351d9e4164f94b251e1ed4f2377a41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:20:47Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:20:47Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"chore(scripts): 新增 fixStudentStates 補上遺漏的評估相關欄位\n\nWhy：Placement 的 fallback 路徑（markPlacementDone）只寫入 currentLevel、placementDone、placementHistory 三個欄位，導致 totalAttempts、levelLockedUntilTotalAttempts、lastEvaluatedAtTotalAttempts、levelHistory 遺漏。\n\n為什麼這會讓自動降級失效：checkEvaluationGuard 計算 attemptsSinceLastEval = totalAttempts - lastEvaluatedAtTotalAttempts。當兩者都缺 → fallback 到 0 → 0 - 0 = 0 < 10 → 永遠跳過評估。\n\nHow：掃描所有 studentStates 文件，缺欄位就補：totalAttempts 從實際 attempts 數量計算（Admin SDK count 查詢），levelLockedUntilTotalAttempts 和 lastEvaluatedAtTotalAttempts 補 0，levelHistory 補一筆手動修補紀錄。\n\n使用方式：node scripts/fixStudentStates.mjs 為預覽模式（不寫入）；--apply 為實際寫入。\n\n已執行結果：7 筆 studentStates 全部補上缺欄位。搭配正確的 Firestore 複合索引（studentDisplayId + timestamp），自動降級機制應恢復運作。\n\n驗證：學生答滿 10 題後，Console 應出現「🎯 [LevelProgression] RuleBased-v1 決策」，不再出現「requires an index」錯誤。","tree":{"sha":"5a6209750dcbbc4fed88ee070baa65ab3a12e012","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/5a6209750dcbbc4fed88ee070baa65ab3a12e012"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/15da652ed1351d9e4164f94b251e1ed4f2377a41","verification