wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/bb06424d73ba60bed55d59c6193af515787532dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:29:36Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:29:36Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"chore(scripts): deleteStudentData 擴充刪除 studentStates 與 classStats，並統計對錯數量\n\nWhy：原本腳本只刪 attempts 和 students，導致 studentStates（含 words、dailySnapshots 子集合）和 classStats 的學生條目殘留，資料不一致。\n\nHow：1) 新增 deleteCollectionDocs helper 批次刪除子集合。2) processStudentStates 刪主文件 + words + dailySnapshots。3) processClassStats 從 students[displayId] 移除並重算 totalAttempts/totalCorrect。4) processAttempts 統計 isCorrect true/false 數量。\n\n已知限制：classStats 的 wordErrors 無法按學生回退，因為該結構是按單字聚合、沒有按學生拆分貢獻。若班級只有一個學生可直接手動清空；多學生時只能接受失真。\n\n驗證：node scripts/deleteStudentData.mjs 預覽模式應顯示四個區塊（attempts / students / studentStates / classStats），且 attempts 區塊顯示對錯數量。","tree":{"sha":"ab852c93ab86ca86e732e557020d5d7af2ae4e4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/ab852c93ab86ca86e732e557020d5d7af2ae4e4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/re