hub.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/18cebd35efb5320fd869b4ec52712ad420f40b85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T05:47:40Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T05:47:40Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"fix(quiz): 每日快照改用跨 session 累計的今日統計\n\nWhy：原本的每日快照只在當天第一次答題時建立，讀取 session 級的 dailyAnsweredCount（從 0 開始）。結果快照永遠反映「第一題」的數據，正確率大部分顯示 0%，與學生實際表現（例如 748 題 40.8%）完全脫節。\n\nHow：1) 新增 DailyStatsTracker（localStorage 持久化），以 displayId + date 為 key 記錄當天累計。2) QuizOrchestrator init() 從 tracker 載入今日統計（取代原本的快照存在性檢查）。3) submitAnswer() 透過 tracker 累計，每次答題都更新快照（反映當日累計而非只記錄第一題）。\n\n副作用（正向）：每日配額不再被刷新繞過，現在是真正的「每日 30 題」。\n\n已知限制：學生清除 localStorage 後，當天累計歸零（極端邊緣情況，可接受）。\n\n驗證：npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤。npm test 126 個測試全綠。答 10 題後刷新，Console 顯示「今日累計：10 題」。","tree":{"sha":"2004b0f614247315c5e5b3fe345dfc07decdbae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/2004b0f614247315c5e5b3fe345dfc07decdbae5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/18cebd35efb5320fd869b4ec52712ad420f40b85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/18cebd35efb5320fd869b4ec52712ad420f40b85","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDE4Y2ViZDM1ZWZiNTMyMGZkODY5YjRlYzUyNzEyYWQ0MjBmNDBiODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/498d9347572b983b68816adac5fca55d89922122","sha":"498d9347572b983b68816adac5fca55d89922122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/498d9347572b983b68816adac5fca55d89922122"}],"sha":"18cebd35efb5320fd869b4ec52712ad420f40b85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/18cebd35efb5320fd869b4ec52712ad420f40b85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/498d9347572b983b68816adac5fca55d89922122/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T07:14:53Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T07:14:53Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(quiz): 普通模式答錯時阻塞，等學生看完正確答案再繼續\n\nWhy：學生反映答錯時自動跳太快，來不及看清楚正確拼字。\n\nHow：1) 新增 waitingForNext state，追蹤是否需要學生手動繼續。2) handleSubmit 依「答對/答錯 + normal/placement」決定：答對一律自動跳、答錯時普通模式阻塞（顯示「下一題」按鈕）、Placement 維持自動跳（模擬考試節奏）。3) loadNext 開頭重置 waitingForNext。4) 新增 handleNextAfterWrong 方法。\n\n設計決策：1) 只支援點按鈕，不支援鍵盤（iPad 上按鈕最直覺）。2) 判斷模式用現有的 getDisplayInfo().mode，不新增參數。3) 1200ms 抽成常數 AUTO_ADVANCE_DELAY_MS。\n\n驗證：npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤。npm test 126 個測試全綠。答對 1.2 秒自動跳（不變）。普通模式答錯出現「下一題」按鈕，點擊才跳。Placement 模式答錯仍自動跳。","tree":{"sha":"047ed4c08b6bdff07f1515dc3daabfe61080d343","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/047ed4c08b6bdff07f1515dc3daabfe61080d343"},"url":"https://api.github.com/re