ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/6d5634b4298a10d64a68744c9012f048c882c3fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:58:40Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:58:40Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"chore(scripts): 新增刪除指定學生資料的腳本\n\n用途：一次刪除指定 displayId 的 attempts 與 students 資料，用於清理測試帳號累積的髒資料。\n\n功能：1) 支援 --apply 參數切換預覽與實際刪除。2) 兩個集合獨立處理，各自顯示筆數與前 10 筆預覽。3) 批次刪除（每批 500 筆）。4) 執行完顯示總結。\n\n使用方式：node scripts/deleteStudentData.mjs 為預覽模式，不刪除任何資料。node scripts/deleteStudentData.mjs --apply 為實際刪除。\n\n注意：腳本只刪 attempts 與 students，不動 studentStates（學習進度、等級、歸檔狀態都保留）。\n\n使用情境：匿名登入每次 refresh 產生新 uid，students 集合累積重複 profile。搭配先前建立的 cleanupAnonymousProfiles.mjs，此腳本用於一次性清理特定學生的所有測試資料。","tree":{"sha":"0fc28c6df1cf1fe33f86d4806a8810aa568dfd44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/0fc28c6df1cf1fe33f86d4806a8810aa568dfd44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/6d5634b4298a10d64a68744c9012f048c882c3fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https: