ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/77f8228a3657cfd575889ce3572d7576f440c4ce","sha":"77f8228a3657cfd575889ce3572d7576f440c4ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/77f8228a3657cfd575889ce3572d7576f440c4ce"}],"sha":"56bec6d7bb1ad48572c359a355d438bfa3083782","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/56bec6d7bb1ad48572c359a355d438bfa3083782"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/77f8228a3657cfd575889ce3572d7576f440c4ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:04:47Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:04:47Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(string,quiz): 用 Porter Stemmer 遮罩例句中的答案單字\n\nWhy: 嚴格匹配會漏掉屈折變化，例如目標 recite 但例句是 recited，或目標 apple 但例句是 apples。學生仍可從例句看到答案線索，變成抄答案而非背單字。\n\nHow: 1) 新增 porterStemmer.ts，完整實作 Martin Porter 1980 年論文 Step 1a 到 5b，純函式無外部依賴。2) 改寫 maskWord.ts，目標詞與候選詞都做詞幹提取後比較，加長度安全網避免 art 與 artist 誤判。3) QuizScreen 依 status 決定遮罩或揭露，status 是揭露狀態的真實來源，不引入第二個 state。4) 新增 maskWord.test.ts，分兩層測試：stem 演算法 + maskWordInSentence。\n\n為什麼不用簡單正則後綴去除？簡單正則無法處理 running 變成 run 的重複子音、studied 變成 study 的 y 變化、boxes 變成 box 的 -es 規則。Porter 有完整的 m 值與 cvc 判斷，避免這類錯誤。\n\n設計決策：詞幹演算法與遮罩邏輯分離（SRP）。不使用 lemmatization，因為需要詞典依賴，對前端過重。測試分層：stem 測演算法，maskWordInSentence 測整合。不引入 UI 層的新 state，避免兩處同步的耦合。\n\n邊界行為：屈折變化 -s / -ed / -ing 遮罩；大小寫不同遮罩；派生詞 art 與 artist 不遮罩；短詞少於 3 字元不處理；空字串回傳原文；標點與空白保留。\n\n已知 Porter 行為：會合併部分派生詞，如 nation 與 nationality 都變成 nation。這是正確行為，學生看到派生詞確實能猜到原形，應該遮罩。測試中記錄此行為，避免未來被誤判為 bug。\n\n驗證：npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤。npm test 全綠。例句 The child recited a poem. 加目標 recite，作答中顯示 The child _______ a poem.，提交後顯示 The child recited a poem.。","tree":{"sha":"e7978c6db721099182856083ab586a8b31d27265","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/e7978c6db721099182856083ab586a8b31d27265"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/77f8228a3657cfd575889ce3572d7576f440c4ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/77f8228a3657cfd575889ce3572d7576f440c4ce","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDc3ZjgyMjhhMzY1N2NmZDU3NTg4OWNlMzU3MmQ3NTc2ZjQ0MGM0Y2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/e79e3d2717c161a764d5f94b69a8dd1ae2886698","sha":"e79e3d2717c161a764d5f94b69a8dd1ae2886698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/e79e3d2717c161a764d5f94b69a8dd1ae2886698"}],"sha":"77f8228a3657cfd575889ce3572d7576f440c4ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/77f8228a3657cfd575889ce3572d7576f440c4ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/e79e3d2717c161a764d5f94b69a8dd1ae2886698/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:30:56Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:30:56Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"refactor(quiz): 收斂配額判斷至單一真實來源，移除課後加強的配額 hack\n\n## Why\n重構前有兩層獨立的配額判斷：\n  1. SessionQuotaPolicy.shouldContinue()（Orchestrator 呼叫）\n  2. pickNextWordId 內部的 dailyAnsweredCount >= dailyMaxQuota\n\n這導致「課後加強」模式需要傳 Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER 的 hack\n去欺騙第二層。任何未來的配額相關功能（每週配額、依等級動態配額、\n特殊生個別配額）都會重複踩坑。\n\n## How\n把「能不能出下一題」統一收斂到 SessionQuotaPolicy。\npickNextWordId 只負責「選誰」，不再知道「配額」是什麼。\n\n### 型別瘦身\nDailyQuota 從 3 欄位 → 1 欄位（只留 dailyNewQuotaRemaining）\n- dailyAnsweredCount / dailyMaxQuota 移除\n- dailyNewQuotaRemaining 語意調整為「選題偏好」而非「配額上限」\n\n### 邏輯簡化\n- questionSelector.ts：\n  - 移除 if (dailyAnsweredCount >= dailyMaxQuota) return null\n  - 移除相關參數\n- QuizOrchestrator.nextQuestion()：\n  - 移除 isContinueMode 判斷\n  - 移除 effectiveMaxQuota hack\n  - 只呼叫 quotaPolicy.shouldContinue() 一次 + pickNextWordId 一次\n\n### 測試更新\n- 刪除「已達每日總配額 → null」測試（該邏輯已移至 policy）\n- 保留其餘測試，移除已廢棄的參數\n- 新增 2 個邊界測試（dueWords 少於 5 時從新字挑、只有新字且配額 0 時仍出新字）\n\n## 設計理由\n「選誰」和「能不能選」是兩個獨立問題：\n- 前者是演算法（依優先權加權隨機）\n- 後者是業務規則（配額 / 課後加強 / 特殊生）\n混在一起就會有「多處同步」的耦合。\n收斂到單一真實來源後，未來任何配額相關功能都只動一個地方。\n\n## 行為變更\n無。重構不改變對外行為。\n唯一差異是「配額檢查」從兩處減為一處，語意更清晰。\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- npm test 全綠（questionSelector 8 個測試）\n- 課後加強模式：按「繼續練習」→ 繼續出題（不再回 done 頁）\n- 普通練習：達配額 → session 結束（行為不變）\n- Placement：不受影響（沒走 pickNextWordId）\n\n## 已知邊界行為（測試記錄）\nMIN_DUE_POOL = 5 的 fallback 優先於「新字配額用完」：\n當複習池 < 5 時，即使新字配額為 0 仍會出新字。\n這是刻意設計（避免學生重複看同幾個舊字），測試有記錄。","tree":{"sha":"70ca4705ef9ebbbdc464ee9fcbc66e6f5250597c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/70ca4705ef9ebbbdc464ee9fcbc66e6f5250597c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/e79e3d2717c161a764d5f94b69a8dd1ae2886698","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/e79e3d2717c161a764d5f94b69a8dd1ae2886698","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGU3OWUzZDI3MTdjMTYxYTc2NGQ1Zjk0YjY5YThkZDFhZTI4ODY2OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/40e9fb8e9280ecd5d4bbfae32edc56650dc5a769","sha":"40e9fb8e9280ecd5d4bbfae32edc56650dc5a769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/40e9fb8e9280ecd5d4bbfae32edc56650dc5a769"}],"sha":"e79e3d2717c161a764d5f94b69a8dd1ae2886698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/e79e3d2717c161a764d5f94b69a8dd1ae2886698"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/40e9fb8e9280ecd5d4bbfae32edc56650dc5a769/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:28:04Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:28:04Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"refactor(quiz): 收斂配額判斷至單一真實來源，移除課後加強的配額 hack\n\n## Why\n重構前有兩層獨立的配額判斷：\n  1. SessionQuotaPolicy.shouldContinue()（Orchestrator 呼叫）\n  2. pickNextWordId 內部的 dailyAnsweredCount >= dailyMaxQuota\n\n這導致「課後加強」模式需要傳 Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER 的 hack\n去欺騙第二層。任何未來的配額相關功能（每週配額、依等級動態配額）\n都會重複踩坑。\n\n## How\n把「能不能出下一題」統一收斂到 SessionQuotaPolicy。\npickNextWordId 只負責「選誰」，不再知道「配額」是什麼。\n\n### 型別瘦身\nDailyQuota 從 3 欄位 → 1 欄位（只留 dailyNewQuotaRemaining）\n- dailyAnsweredCount / dailyMaxQuota 移除\n- dailyNewQuotaRemaining 語意調整為「選題偏好」而非「配額上限」\n\n### 邏輯簡化\n- questionSelector.ts：\n  - 移除 if (dailyAnsweredCount >= dailyMaxQuota) return null\n  - 移除相關參數\n- QuizOrchestrator.nextQuestion()：\n  - 移除 isContinueMode 判斷\n  - 移除 effectiveMaxQuota hack\n  - 只呼叫 quotaPolicy.shouldContinue() 一次 + pickNextWordId 一次\n\n### 測試更新\n- 刪除「已達每日總配額 → null」測試（該邏輯已移至 policy）\n- 保留其餘測試，移除已廢棄的參數\n- 新增 2 個邊界測試（dueWords 少於 5、只有新字且配額 0）\n\n## 設計理由\n「選誰」和「能不能選」是兩個獨立問題：\n- 前者是演算法（依優先權加權隨機）\n- 後者是業務規則（配額 / 課後加強 / 特殊生）\n混在一起就會有「多處同步」的耦合。\n收斂到單一真實來源後，未來任何配額相關功能都只動一個地方。\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- npm test 全綠（questionSelector 8 個測試）\n- 課後加強模式：按「繼續練習」→ 繼續出題（不再回 done 頁）\n- 普通練習：達配額 → session 結束（行為不變）\n- Placement：不受影響（沒走 pickNextWordId）","tree":{"sha":"a4e6e8cd5870be9402395182e7bf654db23ae93c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/a4e6e8cd5870be9402395182e7bf654db23ae93c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/40e9fb8e9280ecd5d4bbfae32edc56650dc5a769","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/40e9fb8e9280ecd5d4bbfae32edc56650dc5a769","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDQwZTlmYjhlOTI4MGVjZDVkNGJiZmFlMzJlZGM1NjY1MGRjNWE3Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/9fbb81fac28ea00686a41e829ee5ec506b725553","sha":"9fbb81fac28ea00686a41e829ee5ec506b725553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/9fbb81fac28ea00686a41e829ee5ec506b725553"}],"sha":"40e9fb8e9280ecd5d4bbfae32edc56650dc5a769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/40e9fb8e9280ecd5d4bbfae32edc56650dc5a769"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/9fbb81fac28ea00686a41e829ee5ec506b725553/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:16:47Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:16:47Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"fix(quiz): 修正「課後加強」被 pickNextWordId 的配額檢查擋住\n\n## Why\n學生按下「繼續練習」後，SessionQuotaPolicy 已放行，\n但 nextQuestion() 呼叫 pickNextWordId() 時傳入原始配額：\n  dailyAnsweredCount: 30, dailyMaxQuota: 30\npickNextWordId 內部 30 >= 30 直接 return null，\nnextQuestion 回傳 null → 進 done 頁 → canOfferContinue 已為 false\n→ 只剩「返回登入」按鈕，學生感覺「又回到登入」。\n\n## How\n在 Orchestrator 層依 isContinueMode 傳入「放寬的配額」：\n- dailyMaxQuota: Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER\n- dailyNewQuotaRemaining: Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER\n\n設計理由：\n- pickNextWordId 是純函式，職責是「依每日配額選題」，\n  不該知道「課後加強」這種產品概念。\n- 由 Orchestrator 決定「這次要不要放寬配額」，\n  讓純函式保持單純。\n\n## 診斷增強\n- 課後加強模式啟動時印 log（answered / pool 大小）\n- 若仍無候選，印 warn 方便除錯\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- 按「繼續練習」→ Console 顯示「放寬配額」→ 繼續出題\n- 標題顯示「xxx · 課後加強」","tree":{"sha":"82d8e9dadde559adb3a126348dc37598cf9b6b0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/82d8e9dadde559adb3a126348dc37598cf9b6b0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/9fbb81fac28ea00686a41e829ee5ec506b725553","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/9fbb81fac28ea00686a41e829ee5ec506b725553","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDlmYmI4MWZhYzI4ZWEwMDY4NmE0MWU4MjllZTVlYzUwNmI3MjU1NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/cb13728c0421bcb2569b817450bfd7e575014422","sha":"cb13728c0421bcb2569b817450bfd7e575014422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/cb13728c0421bcb2569b817450bfd7e575014422"}],"sha":"9fbb81fac28ea00686a41e829ee5ec506b725553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/9fbb81fac28ea00686a41e829ee5ec506b725553"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/cb13728c0421bcb2569b817450bfd7e575014422/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T06:55:13Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T06:55:13Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"fix(scheduler,quiz): ReviewState 補齊 everWrong / correctStreak 並防禦 legacy undefined\n\n## Why\nReviewState 改為全必填後，mergeSM2ResultWithState 漏回傳這兩個欄位，\nTypeScript 報錯。同時發現 legacy 資料（沒寫過 everWrong 的舊文件）\n讀出來會是 undefined，經過 AnswerProcessor 的邏輯會把 undefined\n寫回 Firestore，撞到 Unsupported field value: undefined。\n\n## How\n1. mergeSM2ResultWithState\n   - 補回傳 everWrong / correctStreak（沿用 currentState）\n   - coercion：everWrong === true（undefined → false）、\n              correctStreak ?? 0（undefined → 0）\n2. AnswerProcessor\n   - 先存成 prevEverWrong / prevStreak 變數\n   - 所有邏輯用這兩個變數，不再直接碰 currentState 的欄位\n   - 確保輸出的 nextState 永遠是乾淨的 ReviewState\n\n## 設計理由\n- 兩層 coercion（mapper + processor）各自獨立防護\n- 未來任何一個函式被單獨重用都不會出錯\n- legacy 資料在下次答題時自動被修好\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- 學生答舊單字 → Firestore 自動補上 everWrong: false\n- 學生答新單字 → everWrong: false、correctStreak: 1\n- 答錯 1 次 → everWrong: true\n- 連續答對 5 次 → Console 顯示「移出複習池」","tree":{"sha":"4cade12ed1ce817fb2ac22b81ed3c6b5a159b5c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/4cade12ed1ce817fb2ac22b81ed3c6b5a159b5c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/cb13728c0421bcb2569b817450bfd7e575014422","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/cb13728c0421bcb2569b817450bfd7e575014422","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGNiMTM3MjhjMDQyMWJjYjI1NjliODE3NDUwYmZkN2U1NzUwMTQ0MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/c578fcebb233819ec7529944c1c71d9f8a9815ef","sha":"c578fcebb233819ec7529944c1c71d9f8a9815ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/c578fcebb233819ec7529944c1c71d9f8a9815ef"}],"sha":"cb13728c0421bcb2569b817450bfd7e575014422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/cb13728c0421bcb2569b817450bfd7e575014422"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/c578fcebb233819ec7529944c1c71d9f8a9815ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T06:13:56Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T06:13:56Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(quiz,assignment): 支援可調每題作答時限 + 抽出 removeUndefined\n\n## Why\n1. 老師反映剛接觸的學生 8 秒不夠，希望可依作業手動調整\n2. Firestore 拒絕 undefined 值，之前每次都要在各 Service 手動過濾\n\n## How\n1. 抽出 removeUndefined 到 domain/firestore/\n   - 供全專案共用\n   - 保留 null、0、false、空字串（只過濾 undefined）\n2. 新增 QuizTimingPolicy（domain/quiz/）\n   - 三層優先序：學生個人 > 作業設定 > 系統預設（8000ms）\n   - 邊界：3 秒 ~ 30 秒，超出自動 clamp\n   - 預設選項：5 / 8 / 10 / 15 / 20 秒\n3. Assignment 新增 timeLimitMs 欄位\n4. QuizOrchestrator 整合 Policy\n   - init 時依作業設定解析時限\n   - nextQuestion 回傳解析值\n   - submitAnswer 傳給 AnswerProcessor 用正確閾值評分\n5. AssignmentManager 加下拉與列表欄位\n   - 秒為單位（UI 友善），儲存時轉毫秒\n   - 舊作業 fallback 到 8 秒（向後相容）\n6. studentAnalyzer 加入已知限制註解\n\n## 已知限制\nstudentAnalyzer 的超時分類仍用硬編碼 8000ms。\n若作業設 15 秒，學生答錯且用時 10 秒會被分類為「超時」。\n需要 AttemptRecord 記錄當下時限才能解，留待比賽後處理。\n\n## 順便修正\nQuizOrchestrator.submitAnswer 回傳值的錯字：\n  schedule → scheduling（與 SubmitAnswerResult 介面一致）\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- 建立作業不選目標等級 → 成功建立（removeUndefined 生效）\n- 預設作業：8 秒（行為不變）\n- 新作業設 15 秒：學生倒數顯示 15 秒\n- 舊作業編輯：fallback 到 8 秒","tree":{"sha":"6014da23d60509d86f75a8b3dd3abb9414b34910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/6014da23d60509d86f75a8b3dd3abb9414b34910"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/c578fcebb233819ec7529944c1c71d9f8a9815ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/c578fcebb233819ec7529944c1c71d9f8a9815ef","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGM1NzhmY2ViYjIzMzgxOWVjNzUyOTk0NGMxYzcxZDlmOGE5ODE1ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/34613260c113a941d86409c1af6db2e35c37c90c","sha":"34613260c113a941d86409c1af6db2e35c37c90c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/34613260c113a941d86409c1af6db2e35c37c90c"}],"sha":"c578fcebb233819ec7529944c1c71d9f8a9815ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/c578fcebb233819ec7529944c1c71d9f8a9815ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/34613260c113a941d86409c1af6db2e35c37c90c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T05:56:48Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T05:56:48Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"fix(assignment): 過濾 undefined 欄位避免 Firestore 拒絕寫入\n\n## Why\nFirestore 的 addDoc / updateDoc 不接受 undefined 值。\n老師建立作業時若「目標等級」留空（undefined），\naddDoc 會直接報錯：\n  Unsupported field value: undefined (found in field targetLevel)\n\n## How\n在 AssignmentService 加入 removeUndefined 純函式，\ncreateAssignment 和 updateAssignment 寫入前先過濾。\n這樣所有呼叫端都受益，不需各自處理。\n\n## 順便修正\nQuizOrchestrator.submitAnswer 回傳值的錯字：\n  schedule → scheduling（與 SubmitAnswerResult 介面一致）\n\n## 已知限制\n「編輯時清空目標等級」目前不會生效（因為 undefined 被過濾）。\n若未來需要，改用 Firestore 的 deleteField()。\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- 建立作業時不選目標等級 → 成功建立\n- 建立作業時選 L4 → 成功建立且 Firestore 有 targetLevel: 4","tree":{"sha":"c4f4a131a8c165f8a06584499bcc176c8aa51ca7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/c4f4a131a8c165f8a06584499bcc176c8aa51ca7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/34613260c113a941d86409c1af6db2e35c37c90c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/34613260c113a941d86409c1af6db2e35c37c90c","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDM0NjEzMjYwYzExM2E5NDFkODY0MDljMWFmNmRiMmUzNWMzN2M5MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/03e33ba8bb7360e96c89efecfd45793cdd0352e6","sha":"03e33ba8bb7360e96c89efecfd45793cdd0352e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/03e33ba8bb7360e96c89efecfd45793cdd0352e6"}],"sha":"34613260c113a941d86409c1af6db2e35c37c90c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/34613260c113a941d86409c1af6db2e35c37c90c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/03e33ba8bb7360e96c89efecfd45793cdd0352e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T05:28:23Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T05:28:23Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(profile): 學生登入時自動清理舊 uid profile（本地判斷）\n\n## Why\n匿名登入每次 refresh 產生新 uid，students 集合累積重複 profile。\n先前方案需每次登入 query Firestore 找舊 profile，增加讀取成本。\n改用 localStorage 記錄「每個 displayId 用過的 uid」，零 Firestore 查詢。\n\n## How\n1. 新增 ProfileCleanupTracker\n   - 管理 localStorage[__vocab_known_uids_]\n   - registerCurrentUid 回傳需清理的舊 uid 清單\n   - 不碰 Firestore，純 localStorage 讀寫\n2. ProfileService.saveProfile 加入清理步驟\n   - 讀 tracker 的舊 uid 清單\n   - Promise.all 批次刪除\n   - try-catch 保護，失敗不影響登入\n3. 保留 getDoc 判斷 create/update（不變）\n\n## 行為變更\n- 每次登入：零 Firestore 查詢（vs 方案 C 的 +1 query）\n- 每次登入：N 次 delete（N = 舊 uid 數，正常情況 ≤ 2）\n- 極端情況（換裝置、清快取）：舊 uid 無法清理，靠腳本兜底\n\n## 設計依據\n- displayId 穩定、uid 易變 → 用 localStorage 追蹤 uid 歷史\n- 清理是「維護性副作用」，不應阻塞登入流程\n- 不為了清理而放寬 Firestore 規則，安全性不變\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- 學生登入 → Console 顯示清理訊息\n- Firebase Console students 集合保持 1 筆/學生","tree":{"sha":"328355f5f2579c2d1b7d87ea4afa2d254cb33553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/328355f5f2579c2d1b7d87ea4afa2d254cb33553"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/03e33ba8bb7360e96c89efecfd45793cdd0352e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/03e33ba8bb7360e96c89efecfd45793cdd0352e6","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDAzZTMzYmE4YmI3MzYwZTk2Yzg5ZWZlY2ZkNDU3OTNjZGQwMzUyZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/13f396afedf6f5df41149068c7b6cbbd9cac294c","sha":"13f396afedf6f5df41149068c7b6cbbd9cac294c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/13f396afedf6f5df41149068c7b6cbbd9cac294c"}],"sha":"03e33ba8bb7360e96c89efecfd45793cdd0352e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/03e33ba8bb7360e96c89efecfd45793cdd0352e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/13f396afedf6f5df41149068c7b6cbbd9cac294c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T03:57:46Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T03:57:46Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"fix(analytics): getAllStudentsStats 改用 displayId 合併多筆 UID profile\n\n## Why\n匿名登入每次 refresh 產生新 UID，students 集合會累積多筆 profile。\ngetAllStudentsStats 原本用 s.id (UID) 當 key，導致同一學生顯示多行。\n（例如：refresh 三次 → 教師儀表板顯示三個「林佑綸」）\n\n## How\n1. 用 displayId 當 key 合併多筆 profile\n   - 沒有 displayId 的舊資料 fallback 到 uid（向後相容）\n   - 同一 displayId 多筆時，保留 updatedAt 最新的\n2. attempts 統計改用 studentDisplayId 匹配\n   - 優先：a.studentDisplayId\n   - Fallback：用 uid 反查是哪個 displayId 的\n3. StudentStat.id 現在是 displayId，與 getStudentDetail 的參數一致\n   （修正了「點擊學生後查不到資料」的連鎖 bug）\n\n## 行為變更\n- 同一學生的多筆 UID profile → UI 合併成一筆\n- 點擊學生 → selectedStudentId 是 displayId → getStudentDetail 正確查詢\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- 教師後台只顯示一行「林佑綸」\n- 點擊學生後右側面板正確載入","tree":{"sha":"b3b7e9659cdf2f6882e9d9e5aa78b4f077b4dfd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/b3b7e9659cdf2f6882e9d9e5aa78b4f077b4dfd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/13f396afedf6f5df41149068c7b6cbbd9cac294c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/13f396afedf6f5df41149068c7b6cbbd9cac294c","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDEzZjM5NmFmZWRmNmY1ZGY0MTE0OTA2OGM3YjZjYmJkOWNhYzI5NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/d987063d3b98003a8a97242cd34d9316fce05cb4","sha":"d987063d3b98003a8a97242cd34d9316fce05cb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/d987063d3b98003a8a97242cd34d9316fce05cb4"}],"sha":"13f396afedf6f5df41149068c7b6cbbd9cac294c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/13f396afedf6f5df41149068c7b6cbbd9cac294c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/d987063d3b98003a8a97242cd34d9316fce05cb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T03:48:56Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T03:48:56Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(quiz): 語音結束後才開始倒數 8 秒\n\n## Why\n模擬真實比賽現場：外籍老師唸完單字與例句後才計時 8 秒。\n原實作在掛載 Countdown 時就立刻倒數，學生的作答時間被語音播放時間侵蝕，\n平均實際只剩 5~6 秒可寫。\n\n## How\n1. Countdown 新增 started prop\n   - false：靜止顯示完整時間（灰色，不建立 interval）\n   - true：開始倒數（依剩餘時間變色）\n2. QuizScreen 新增 countdownStarted state\n   - 語音 utterance.onend 觸發 → setCountdownStarted(true)\n   - 語音 utterance.onerror（非 interrupted）→ 也啟動倒數\n3. 語音保險機制（8 秒）\n   - 若 onend/onerror 都未觸發，強制啟動倒數，避免學生卡死\n4. 重聽不影響倒數\n   - speakWord 的 onEnd 參數為選填\n   - handleReplaySlow 不傳 onEnd，避免重聽重置倒數\n5. elapsedMs 起點改為「語音開始前」\n   - 語音播放時間計入 elapsedMs（模擬現場）\n   - 提前提交時，elapsedMs = 語音開始到提交的時間\n\n## What\n- 修改 src/features/quiz/Countdown.tsx\n  - 新增 started prop\n  - started === false 時不建立 interval，靜止顯示\n  - started === false 時顏色為灰色（#adb5bd）\n- 修改 src/features/quiz/QuizScreen.tsx\n  - 新增 countdownStarted state 與 countdownStartedRef（冪等守衛）\n  - 新增 startCountdown() 方法（多次呼叫只生效一次）\n  - speakWord 新增 onEnd 回調參數\n  - utterance.onend / onerror（非 interrupted）觸發 onEnd\n  - 新增 speechFallbackTimerRef（8 秒保險計時器）\n  - cancelSpeech 一併清除保險計時器\n  - loadNext 重置倒數狀態，並在 speakWord 時傳入 onEnd\n  - handleReplaySlow 不傳 onEnd（重聽不重啟倒數）\n  - <Countdown started={countdownStarted} />\n\n## 行為變更\n- 語音播放中：⏱️ 8s（灰色靜止），學生可提前提交\n- 語音結束：⏱️ 8s 開始倒數（黑色，剩 3 秒轉紅）\n- 重聽：語音重新播放，倒數不受影響\n- 語音無法播放：立即啟動倒數（不讓學生卡死）\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- 語音正常：Console 依序顯示「播放 → 語音結束 → 倒數啟動」\n- 重聽：倒數不重置\n- 8 秒保險：手動 cancel 語音不觸發 onEnd，但保險計時器仍會啟動倒數","tree":{"sha":"a18fe5de9e1e3c1b168b8e3cab04b6d270d84886","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/a18fe5de9e1e3c1b168b8e3cab04b6d270d84886"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/d987063d3b98003a8a97242cd34d9316fce05cb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":