arner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:52:41Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"chore: 加入 ESLint\n## ESLint 設定\n- 新增 .eslintrc.json（@typescript-eslint/recommended）\n- package.json devDependencies 加入 eslint 相關套件\n\n## 已知限制（記錄於 README）\n- Firestore 規則對 studentStates 的寫入依賴 displayId 不易猜測，\n  正式大規模部署前需改為 custom claims 綁定（需 Blaze 方案）\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- npm test 101 個測試全過","tree":{"sha":"9ea82e4ad17d33ebaf2aa78ed6f2af16a1367d3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/9ea82e4ad17d33ebaf2aa78ed6f2af16a1367d3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/c92fc5542642916713b1b75b95650195476b6115","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/c92fc5542642916713b1b75b95650195476b6115","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGM5MmZjNTU0MjY0MjkxNjcxM2IxYjc1Yjk1NjUwMTk1NDc2YjYxMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/ed1281bd7d65159256965682d0ed077264159851","sha":"ed1281bd7d65159256965682d0ed077264159851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/ed1281bd7d65159256965682d0ed077264159851"}],"sha":"c92fc5542642916713b1b75b95650195476b6115","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/c92fc5542642916713b1b75b95650195476b6115"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/ed1281bd7d65159256965682d0ed077264159851/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:47:22Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:47:22Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(sm2): everWrong 連續答對 5 次後自動清除\n\n## Why\n原本 everWrong 一旦設為 true 就永不清除，依賴 SM-2 的間隔成長\n讓已掌握的字自然淡出。但這會讓複習池的候選集比實際需要的大，\n且已掌握的字仍可能被 supplementPool 抽到。\n\n## How\n在 AnswerProcessor 維護獨立的 correctStreak 計數器：\n  - 與 sm2.ts 的 consecutiveCorrect 不同（後者在答對 3 次後歸零）\n  - correctStreak 只在答錯時歸零，可累積到 5\n\n更新規則：\n  - 答錯 → everWrong=true, correctStreak=0\n  - 答對 + everWrong=true + correctStreak >= 5 → everWrong=false, correctStreak=0\n  - 其他 → 保持不變\n\n## What\n- 修改 src/types/word.ts\n  - ReviewState 新增 correctStreak?: number\n  - createInitialReviewState 初始化 correctStreak=0\n- 修改 src/features/quiz/AnswerProcessor.ts\n  - 新增常數 EVER_WRONG_CLEAR_THRESHOLD = 5\n  - 獨立維護 correctStreak\n  - 達到門檻時清除 everWrong 並印 log\n- 新增 src/features/quiz/AnswerProcessor.test.ts\n  - 12 個測試涵蓋完整生命週期與基本評分行為\n\n## 向後相容\n舊資料沒有 correctStreak 欄位，用 ?? 0 處理，不需清理。\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- npm test 101 個測試全過","tree":{"sha":"7c461fe6e5c768439533eeead0048368baa55587","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/7c461fe6e5c768439533eeead0048368baa55587"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/ed1281bd7d65159256965682d0ed077264159851","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u