om/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/cd0ad79fd6e320b45fc82cfc3d141488ea9fba47","sha":"cd0ad79fd6e320b45fc82cfc3d141488ea9fba47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/cd0ad79fd6e320b45fc82cfc3d141488ea9fba47"}],"sha":"0e012a6488956eb92ba69eff10a0e629359e1a5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/0e012a6488956eb92ba69eff10a0e629359e1a5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/cd0ad79fd6e320b45fc82cfc3d141488ea9fba47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T02:53:05Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T02:53:05Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"test(assignment,progression): 抽出作業優先序與評估守衛為純函式並補 25 個測試\n\n## Why\n兩個核心邏輯埋在 class 內，無法獨立測試，改一行就可能壞一片：\n  1. AssignmentService 的「個人 → 班級 → 全校」優先序查找\n  2. LevelProgressionService 的「鎖定 + 距上次評估」守衛判斷\n\n另外發現：同一對象存在多個生效中作業時，原本用 find() 取\nFirestore 回傳的第一個（不確定是哪個），老師也看不到重複。\n\n## How\n1. 抽出 selectActiveAssignment 純函式\n   - 位置：src/domain/assignment/selectAssignment.ts\n   - 行為變更：同類型多個時改取 createdAt 最新\n2. 抽出 checkEvaluationGuard 純函式\n   - 位置：src/domain/progression/evaluationGuard.ts\n3. AssignmentService / LevelProgressionService 改為呼叫純函式\n4. AssignmentManager 加入重複偵測與警告徽章\n\n## What\n- 新增 src/domain/assignment/selectAssignment.ts\n  - selectActiveAssignment() 純函式\n- 新增 src/domain/assignment/selectAssignment.test.ts\n  - 16 個測試：優先序、空/停用/過期、同類型多個取最新、邊界\n- 新增 src/domain/progression/evaluationGuard.ts\n  - checkEvaluationGuard() 純函式\n- 新增 src/domain/progression/evaluationGuard.test.ts\n  - 9 個測試：鎖定期、距上次評估、首次評估、邊界\n- 修改 src/services/assignment/AssignmentService.ts\n  - getActiveAssignment 改用純函式，同類型多個取最新\n- 修改 src/services/progression/LevelProgressionService.ts\n  - evaluate 的守衛區塊改用純函式\n- 修改 src/features/dashboard/AssignmentManager.tsx\n  - 加入 duplicateAssignmentIds 偵測（useMemo）\n  - 列表名稱欄位顯示「⚠️ 同對象多個」徽章\n\n## 行為變更\n- 同類型多個作業時：從「find() 取第一個」改為「取 createdAt 最新」\n  理由：老師改作業時舊的自動失效，符合直覺\n- 老師可在作業列表看到重複警告，主動清理\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- npm test 89 個測試全過（64 原有 + 16 + 9 新增）","tree":{"sha":"dff397b5a596e348a6834316ac933679fdcc3812","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/dff397b5a596e348a6834316ac933679fdcc3812"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/cd0ad79fd6e320b45fc82cfc3d141488ea9fba47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/cd0ad79fd6e320b45fc82cfc3d141488ea9fba47","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGNkMGFkNzlmZDZlMzIwYjQ1ZmM4MmNmYzNkMTQxNDg4ZWE5ZmJhNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/cd090f201eeeb17a5db3b5ced34bf3f962aecfbd","sha":"cd090f201eeeb17a5db3b5ced34bf3f962aecfbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/cd090f201eeeb17a5db3b5ced34bf3f962aecfbd"}],"sha":"cd0ad79fd6e320b45fc82cfc3d141488ea9fba47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/cd0ad79fd6e320b45fc82cfc3d141488ea9fba47"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/cd090f201eeeb17a5db3b5ced34bf3f962aecfbd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T02:38:10Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T02:38:10Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"test(placement): 抽出階梯決策為純函式並補 13 個單元測試\n\n## Why\nPlacementOrchestrator 的階梯決策（L3 起始、對 2 升、對 0~1 降）是\n每個新學生的第一次體驗，一旦壞了所有學生都會被分錯級。但這段邏輯\n埋在 class 內，無法獨立測試，只能靠手動跑完整流程驗證。\n\n## How\n1. 把決策邏輯從 class 抽成純函式 decidePlacementStep()\n   - 位置：src/domain/placement/placementDecision.ts\n   - 回傳 { newLevel, isFinal, action }，action 用於記錄 placementSteps\n2. PlacementOrchestrator 改為呼叫純函式\n   - advanceToNextLevel() 用 decidePlacementStep\n   - 刪除原本的 decideNextStep() 私有方法\n   - 移除檔頂的 PROMOTE_THRESHOLD 常數（改由純函式模組管理）\n3. 補 13 個單元測試覆蓋所有邊界\n\n## What\n- 新增 src/domain/placement/placementDecision.ts\n  - decidePlacementStep(currentLevel, correct) 純函式\n  - 常數：PLACEMENT_MIN_LEVEL / MAX_LEVEL / PROMOTE_THRESHOLD\n- 新增 src/domain/placement/placementDecision.test.ts\n  - 13 個測試覆蓋：升級、降級、L6 天花板、L1 地板、純函式性質\n- 修改 src/features/placement/PlacementOrchestrator.ts\n  - 改用純函式，刪除重複邏輯\n\n## 測試覆蓋的邊界\n- L1 對 0~1 題 → 停 L1（不能降 L0）\n- L1 對 2+ 題 → 升 L2（不是停）\n- L6 對 2+ 題 → 停 L6（不能升 L7）\n- L6 對 0~1 題 → 降 L5（不是停）\n- 對 2 題（門檻）→ 升級\n- 對 1 題 → 降級\n- 相同輸入必定相同輸出\n\n## 驗證\n- npx tsc --noEmit 零錯誤\n- npm test 64 個測試全過（51 原有 + 13 新增）","tree":{"sha":"9bae543170e415dd526beb4f5a667828b62acbbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/9bae543170e415dd526beb4f5a667828b62acbbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/cd090f201eeeb17a5db3b5ced34bf3f962aecfbd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/cd090f201eeeb17a5db3b5ced34bf3f962aecfbd","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGNkMDkwZjIwMWVlZWIxN2E1ZGIzYjVjZWQzNGJmM2Y5NjJhZWNmYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/56ebf394af01b4cb3df3a9169a6d87d80308374a","sha":"56ebf394af01b4cb3df3a9169a6d87d80308374a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/56ebf394af01b4cb3df3a9169a6d87d80308374a"}],"sha":"cd090f201eeeb17a5db3b5ced34bf3f962aecfbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/cd090f201eeeb17a5db3b5ced34bf3f962aecfbd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https:/