/api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/29f73500ae2c34afb3fc27993997a748a34a47f0","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDI5ZjczNTAwYWUyYzM0YWZiM2ZjMjc5OTM5OTdhNzQ4YTM0YTQ3ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/fee48a83919200b43ce8f2e6715c3f1b6e35d551","sha":"fee48a83919200b43ce8f2e6715c3f1b6e35d551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/fee48a83919200b43ce8f2e6715c3f1b6e35d551"}],"sha":"29f73500ae2c34afb3fc27993997a748a34a47f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/29f73500ae2c34afb3fc27993997a748a34a47f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/fee48a83919200b43ce8f2e6715c3f1b6e35d551/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T02:05:11Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T02:05:11Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(speech): 新增可調整語速與慢速重聽功能\n\n## Why\n老師反應需要為學生調整語音速度：\n  1. 標準英語語速（1.0x）為訓練目標，不應被學生任意調慢\n  2. 但特殊需求學生需要更慢的語速才能聽清楚\n  3. 學生若能自由調整會偷懶，違背競賽訓練精神\n\n設計決策（結合學術研究與業界實踐）：\n  - 首次播放固定 1.0x（訓練真實英聽）\n  - 提供「🐢 重聽一次（慢速）」按鈕（給第二次機會）\n  - 下限由老師設定，避免學生濫用\n  - 個別學生可單獨覆蓋下限（特殊生）\n\n## How\n三層優先序的語速機制：\n  1. 學生個人 customSpeechFloor（最高優先）\n  2. 作業 speechFloorRate\n  3. 系統預設 0.85\n\n資料結構：\n  - Assignment 新增 speechRate（預設播放速度）與 speechFloorRate（全班下限）\n  - StudentLearningState 新增 customSpeechFloor（個人覆蓋）\n\n介面設計：\n  - 老師端：AssignmentManager 加兩個下拉選單\n  - 老師端：StudentDetailPanel 加個人語速下限設定\n  - 學生端：QuizScreen 加「🐢 重聽一次」按鈕（鑑定模式不顯示）\n\n鑑定模式（PlacementOrchestrator）：\n  - getSpeechRate() 固定 1.0\n  - getSpeechFloorRate() 回傳 null（不提供重聽）\n  - 理由：鑑定要測真實反應，不能重聽\n\n## What\n- src/types/progression.ts\n  - StudentLearningState 新增 customSpeechFloor\n- src/types/analytics.ts\n  - StudentAnalytics 新增 customSpeechFloor\n- src/services/assignment/AssignmentService.ts\n  - Assignment 新增 speechRate / speechFloorRate\n  - 新增常數 DEFAULT_SPEECH_RATE / DEFAULT_SPEECH_FLOOR_RATE\n- src/services/progression/StudentStateService.ts\n  - 新增 updateCustomSpeechFloor()\n  - getState 帶出 customSpeechFloor\n- src/services/analytics/AnalyticsService.ts\n  - getStudentDetail 讀取 customSpeechFloor\n- src/features/quiz/QuizSessionApi.ts\n  - 新增 getSpeechRate() / getSpeechFloorRate()\n- src/features/quiz/QuizOrchestrator.ts\n  - 實作上述兩個方法，含三層優先序邏輯\n  - init 時讀取 customSpeechFloor\n- src/features/placement/PlacementOrchestrator.ts\n  - 實作 getSpeechRate=1.0, getSpeechFloorRate=null\n- src/features/quiz/QuizScreen.tsx\n  - speakWord 接受 rate 參數\n  - 新增「🐢 重聽一次（慢速）」按鈕\n  - 首次播放用 getSpeechRate()\n- src/features/dashboard/AssignmentManager.tsx\n  - 表單新增預設語速、全班最低速度\n  - 列表顯示語速設定\n- src/features/dashboard/components/StudentDetailPanel.tsx\n  - 新增個人語速下限設定區塊","tree":{"sha":"0ee37f587e3f9d184739ae2a838518ac1dc4af93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/0ee37f587e3f9d184739ae2a838518ac1dc4af93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/fee48a83919200b43ce8f2e6715c3f1b6e35d551","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/fee48a83919200b43ce8f2e6715c3f1b6e35d551","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGZlZTQ4YTgzOTE5MjAwYjQzY2U4ZjJlNjcxNWMzZjFiNmUzNWQ1NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/bf615ad890ea3123585f78c65c69d4e9a81ae048","sha":"bf615ad890ea3123585f78c65c69d4e9a81ae048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/bf615ad890ea3123585f78c65c69d4e9a81ae048"}],"sha":"fee48a83919200b43ce8f2e6715c3f1b6e35d551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/fee48a83919200b43ce8f2e6715c3f1b6e35d551"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/bf615ad890ea3123585f78c65c69d4e9a81ae048/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T01:26:14Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T01:26:14Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"fix(speech): 修正 iPad 語音無聲問題並加入 iOS 靜音提示\n\n## Why\niPad 上不論 Safari 或 Chrome 都聽不到語音，但電腦版正常。\n根因是 iOS 對 Web Speech API 的嚴格限制：\n  1. iOS 要求「在 user gesture 內呼叫 speak()」才算真正解鎖音訊通道\n  2. 單純呼叫 getVoices() 在桌機有效，但 iOS 不買帳\n  3. iPad 側邊靜音開關會強制靜音 Web Speech API，\n     這是程式碼無法解決的，需要使用者自行關閉\n\n## How\n1. StudentLogin 的 unlockSpeech 改為：\n   - 先 getVoices() 觸發引擎載入\n   - 再 speak() 一個無聲、極短的 utterance（volume=0, rate=10）\n   - 不呼叫 cancel()，讓它自然播完（避免競態殘留）\n   這個呼叫發生在「開始練習」按鈕的 user gesture 內，\n   能真正解鎖 iOS 的音訊通道。\n\n2. QuizScreen 加入 iOS 靜音開關提示：\n   - 用 userAgent 偵測 iOS 裝置\n   - 在頁面頂部顯示黃色橫幅，提醒使用者確認靜音開關\n   - 只在 iOS 顯示，不影響桌機與 Android\n\n## What\n- 修改 src/features/login/StudentLogin.tsx\n  - unlockSpeech 從 getVoices-only 改為 getVoices + speak 靜音 utterance\n- 修改 src/features/quiz/QuizScreen.tsx\n  - 加入 iOS 靜音開關提示橫幅\n\n## 驗證\n- 電腦版語音行為不變\n- iPad 首次點擊「開始練習」後，QuizScreen 能正常播放語音\n- iPad 若靜音開關開啟，會看到提示橫幅","tree":{"sha":"2dbe251d2f226de2a9beca75cb41fe5c6404cfd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/2dbe251d2f226de2a9beca75cb41fe5c6404cfd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/bf615ad890ea3123585f78c65c69d4e9a81ae048","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/bf615ad890ea3123585f78c65c69d4e9a81ae048","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGJmNjE1YWQ4OTBlYTMxMjM1ODVmNzhjNjVjNjlkNGU5YTgxYWUwNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/dba258d0a1105ee6b870b7f9922b7c3c19df9342","sha":"dba258d0a1105ee6b870b7f9922b7c3c19df9342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/dba258d0a1105ee6b870b7f9922b7c3c19df9342"}],"sha":"bf615ad890ea3123585f78c65c69d4e9a81ae048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/bf615ad890ea3123585f78c65c69d4e9a81ae048"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/dba258d0a1105ee6b870b7f9922b7c3c19df9342/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:23:00Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:23:00Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"fix(quiz): 修正語音殘留與幽靈語音問題\n\n問題現象：\n  第一題會先聽到一個無關的語音，然後才播當前題目。\n  例如顯示「jacket」但先聽到「leg」。\n\n根因：\n  1. React 18 StrictMode 在 dev 模式觸發 useEffect 兩次，\n     導致 loadNext() 被呼叫兩次，兩次都執行 speakWord。\n  2. StudentLogin 的 unlockSpeech() 用 speak('' '') 排入一個\n     空格 utterance，cancel() 非同步來不及清空，殘留在 queue。\n\n修復：\n  1. QuizScreen 加入 hasInitializedRef 防止 StrictMode 雙重觸發\n  2. QuizScreen 加入 speechIdRef 作為保險：\n     過期的 speakWord 呼叫會被跳過\n  3. speakWord 改成純英文格式（en-US），去掉中文標點\n  4. StudentLogin 的 unlockSpeech 改用 getVoices() 熱身，\n     不產生任何 utterance\n\n保留 debug log：\n  - 🔊 [speakWord] 播放：xxx\n  - 🔇 [speakWord] 跳過過期語音：xxx\n  - ⚠️ [QuizScreen] useEffect 被觸發第二次，跳過\n  方便未來 trace 語音相關問題。\n\n驗證：\n  - 第一題只有一個語音\n  - Console 只看到一次 🔊 播放","tree":{"sha":"569b507f5d9b3668e4e5907f2d9d803ed3e79ff1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/569b507f5d9b3668e4e5907f2d9d803ed3e79ff1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/dba258d0a1105ee6b870b7f9922b7c3c19df9342","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/dba258d0a1105ee6b870b7f9922b7c3c19df9342","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGRiYTI1OGQwYTExMDVlZTZiODcwYjdmOTkyMmI3YzNjMTlkZjkzNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/ac651de94c15927eb613570ee4a7a1be68bcd03f","sha":"ac651de94c15927eb613570ee4a7a1be68bcd03f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/ac651de94c15927eb613570ee4a7a1be68bcd03f"}],"sha":"dba258d0a1105ee6b870b7f9922b7c3c19df9342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/dba258d0a1105ee6b870b7f9922b7c3c19df9342"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/ac651de94c15927eb613570ee4a7a1be68bcd03f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:00:40Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:00:40Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(vocabulary): 隨機抽題改用 random 欄位，修正每次抽樣重複問題\n\n問題：\n  getNewWordsByLevels 使用 orderBy(''word'') 查詢，\n  每次都從字母序最前面抓，導致 Placement 與日常練習\n  的「新詞候選」每次都抽到同一批單字。\n\n解法（隨機範圍查詢）：\n  1. Word 型別新增 random?: number 欄位\n  2. AdminPanel 上傳時為每個單字生成 Math.random()\n  3. getNewWordsByLevels 改用雙段隨機查詢：\n     - 第一段：where(''random'', ''>='', randomStart)\n     - 第二段：where(''random'', ''<'', randomStart) 補齊\n     - 兩段都做分頁，直到湊足 limitCount\n\n資料變更：\n  - Firestore 複合索引新增：words 的 level + random\n  - 舊索引 words 的 level + word 保留（無程式碼依賴，備份用）\n\n影響：\n  - Placement 每次抽題不再重複\n  - 日常練習的新詞候選也隨機化\n  - 複習候選（getWordsByIds）不受影響（走 documentId 查詢）\n\n驗證：\n  - randomStart 每次登入都不同\n  - 重複測試 5 次，12 題不重複\n  - tsc --noEmit 零錯誤","tree":{"sha":"99c3eaf1a3b274cfa1484ed25677c6e8bf88d24f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/99c3eaf1a3b274cfa1484ed25677c6e8bf88d24f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/ac651de94c15927eb613570ee4a7a1be68bcd03f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/ac651de94c15927eb613570ee4a7a1be68bcd03f","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGFjNjUxZGU5NGMxNTkyN2ViNjEzNTcwZWU0YTdhMWJlNjhiY2QwM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/cd011e61c2b5474dd4de06dbfa5f38b807835c3c","sha":"cd011e61c2b5474dd4de06dbfa5f38b807835c3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/cd011e61c2b5474dd4de06dbfa5f38b807835c3c"}],"sha":"ac651de94c15927eb613570ee4a7a1be68bcd03f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/ac651de94c15927eb613570ee4a7a1be68bcd03f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://