0fa6fd806db329e656"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commits/9229b31d0e784f364f417122dbbbd55793d702e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T06:52:03Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T06:52:03Z","email":"husenior11123@gmail.com","name":"ylin3-learner"},"message":"feat(assignment): 作業指派支援個人與班級，並加入目標等級加權出題\n\nAssignmentService\n- 移除 wordScope 死欄位（從未影響出題邏輯）\n- 新增 targetLevel?: number（1~6，選填）\n- 新增 getAllClasses()：從 classStats 取得班級列表\n- 新增 getStudentsByClass()：用 documentId 範圍查詢取得學生列表\n- getActiveAssignment 支援個人作業優先查找（個人 > 班級 > 全校）\n\nAssignmentManager\n- 指派對象改為「全班 / 個人」Tab 切換\n- 班級下拉：從 classStats 動態載入\n- 學生下拉：選班級後從 studentStates 動態載入，按座號排序\n- 作業名稱改為選填，未填時自動生成（709 · L4 · 09-13）\n- 列表新增「目標等級」欄位與「個人」徽章\n\nQuizOrchestrator\n- buildWordPool 拆為三個方法：主流程 / 加權出題 / 預設出題\n- 新增 buildWeightedNewWords：作業指定 targetLevel 時啟用\n- 加權策略：60% target + 30% current + 10% 探針\n- 護欄機制：|target - current| >= 3 時調整為 30% / 60% / 10%\n- init 呼叫 getActiveAssignment 時傳入 displayId 以支援個人作業\n\n設計理念：\n  作業不是「覆蓋」DDA，而是「加速」DDA 收斂。\n  老師的指派 = 強制探索某個 arm，比 DDA 自己探索快得多。\n  DDA 仍照常運作，學生表現持續流入 PerformanceTracker。","tree":{"sha":"e050ed8d76253ef35082ef280f0dcaac627bf5f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/e050ed8d76253ef35082ef280f0dcaac627bf5f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/9229b31d0e784f364f417122dbbbd55793d702e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/9229b31d0e784f364f417122dbbbd55793d702e6","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDkyMjliMzFkMGU3ODRmMzY0ZjQxNzEyMmRiYmJkNTU3OTNkNzAyZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/4e9136946bca4e624a8dec91bd07e7d31a7ad72d","sha":"4e9136946bca4e624a