splayId 查）\n  - dailySnapshots 路徑改為 studentStates/{displayId}/dailySnapshots\n\n問題根因：\n  上一輪重構改了 StudentStateService 的儲存路徑，\n  但 PerformanceTracker 與 AnalyticsService 仍指向舊路徑，\n  導致等級評估與教師儀表板的資料讀不到。\n\n影響：\n  - 等級升級評估能正確撈到 attempts\n  - 教師後台能看到正確的等級徽章與成長曲線","tree":{"sha":"e69f4421c6250484a495348ceddd3f64c2eaf453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/e69f4421c6250484a495348ceddd3f64c2eaf453"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/4e9136946bca4e624a8dec91bd07e7d31a7ad72d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/4e9136946bca4e624a8dec91bd07e7d31a7ad72d","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKDRlOTEzNjk0NmJjYTRlNjI0YThkZWM5MWJkMDdlN2QzMWE3YWQ3MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/df182e252259512f93ee06a489709