otalAttempts 的欄位讀寫\n- 修正：studentStates 是跨 UID 追蹤的關鍵，key 為 displayId\n\n問題根因：\n  之前只改了參數名稱（studentId → displayId），\n  但漏改 doc 路徑與 dot notation 欄位前綴，\n  導致學生登入時讀寫 students/{displayId} 被規則拒絕。","tree":{"sha":"cf865928911fc19e709f9c0bd080626c79d5dbea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/cf865928911fc19e709f9c0bd080626c79d5dbea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/df182e252259512f93ee06a489709fb5b43c1ce3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/df182e252259512f93ee06a489709fb5b43c1ce3","node_id":"C_kwDOUTJaddoAKGRmMTgyZTI1MjI1OTUxMmY5M2VlMDZhNDg5NzA5ZmI1YjQzYzFjZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/commit/bf773bf0fcfaa3e05737ea1bd09916897dc74a17","sha":"bf773bf0fcfaa3e05737ea1bd09916897dc74a17","url"