學習與管理端批次上傳優化\n\n- 自適應學習\n  - 新增 progression 型別、metricsCalculator、RuleBasedStrategy\n  - 新增 PerformanceTracker、StudentStateService、LevelProgressionService\n  - QuizOrchestrator 整合 learningState，依 currentLevel 出題，每 10 題評估等級\n  - WordRepository 新增 getNewWordsByLevels，支援依 level 批次取新詞\n  - StudentLogin 初始化 learningState\n\n- Firestore 安全規則\n  - attempts 允許學生讀取自己的紀錄，修正等級評估權限錯誤\n  - 其他規則維持教師/管理員權限\n\n- 管理端單字庫上傳\n  - AdminPanel 改為批次刪除/寫入，每批 400 筆，批次間延遲 1 秒\n  - 加入進度顯示與錯誤中斷，避免 Quota exceeded\n\n- 資料清理\n  - 新增 sanitizeFirestoreId，處理 wordId 含 / 等非法字元\n  - FirestoreProgressStore、ClassStatsService 套用 sanitize\n  - 新增 scripts/simplifyVocabByUsage.ts 清理單字變體與代詞\n\n- 其他\n  - 學生分析、PDF 匯出、歸檔功能、Recharts 圖表等","tree":{"sha":"65d08f2fed31d46f90b9fe08c9b82724b90615d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/trees/65d08f2fed31d46f90b9fe08c9b82724b90615d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ylin3-learner/vocab-handwriting-trainer/git/commits/bebbaee979d08b1caad32c4605afea22a787d9f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116593085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ylin3-learner","id":116593085,"login":"ylin3-learner","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMRvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylin3-learner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/y