ncx/commits/78f84190ddd92a7dc41fd6f719d5e01a2ce5d0a5"}],"sha":"73ebc97838e8ed6e203cd158a7f6b14de85e13f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/73ebc97838e8ed6e203cd158a7f6b14de85e13f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/78f84190ddd92a7dc41fd6f719d5e01a2ce5d0a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:47:59Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:47:59Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"fix(security): seal anon/non-participant bypass on cancel and cost-addition RPCs\n\nThe cost-addition and client-cancellation RPCs were reachable and executable\nby unauthenticated callers, and their authorization checks failed open rather\nthan closed. Two independent defects combined:\n\n- No REVOKE from PUBLIC/anon, so Postgres'' default PUBLIC execute grant left\n  cancel_request, create_cost_addition, approve_cost_addition and\n  decline_cost_addition callable over PostgREST with only the anon key.\n- NULL-propagating guards. `if <null> then raise` never raises, so\n  request_participant_role() returning NULL for a non-participant, and\n  `technician_id = auth.uid()` being NULL on an unassigned request, both\n  skipped the exception and fell through to the mutation. The second case let\n  any signed-in account cancel any unassigned pending request.\n\nBoth were confirmed by probing a local reset, and re-confirmed closed after\nthe fix (anon -> permission denied; unrelated authenticated caller ->\nnot_authorized_to_cancel; legitimate client and assigned technician\nunaffected).\n\nFixed by moving the SECURITY DEFINER bodies into `private` behind thin\nSECURITY INVOKER wrappers -- the same shape 20260913000002 already applied to\naccept_request -- and making the guards null-safe (IS DISTINCT FROM, and\ncoalesce on the hand-rolled boolean). Also renames a duplicate 20260914000001\nmigration version that made `db push` and `db reset` abort on the\nschema_migrations primary key, removes a dead variable that failed\n`db lint --fail-on warning`, standardises search_path to '''', and regenerates\ndatabase.ts for the nullable users.phone and requests.cancellation_reason.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca942178907b83dec4308fe6f9bdee2df5022958","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/ca942178907b83dec4308fe6f9bdee2df5022958"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/78f84190ddd92a7dc41fd6f719d5e01a2ce5d0a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://ap