l":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/23080a65fd7f5d0c4b42572288726ddfa1f3d1ce","node_id":"C_kwDOUTTEItoAKDIzMDgwYTY1ZmQ3ZjVkMGM0YjQyNTcyMjg4NzI2ZGRmYTFmM2QxY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/8d2ee530fba2b3e8a837f99960dd3c9ddcf0e4a8","sha":"8d2ee530fba2b3e8a837f99960dd3c9ddcf0e4a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/8d2ee530fba2b3e8a837f99960dd3c9ddcf0e4a8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/fea6ddf848a9baac6bb26381a385cff182363a16","sha":"fea6ddf848a9baac6bb26381a385cff182363a16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/fea6ddf848a9baac6bb26381a385cff182363a16"}],"sha":"23080a65fd7f5d0c4b42572288726ddfa1f3d1ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/23080a65fd7f5d0c4b42572288726ddfa1f3d1ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/fea6ddf848a9baac6bb26381a385cff182363a16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:07:58Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:07:58Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"ci(supabase): retry migration replay to survive Kong''s post-reset 502\n\nRoot cause, verified against this pipeline rather than assumed: the given\ndiagnosis (runner RAM/CPU exhaustion from starting the full container suite)\ndoesn''t hold here — `Start local Supabase` already excludes studio, imgproxy,\nedge-runtime, logflare, vector, mailpit and supavisor, so it''s already the\nlean set. Reproduced the real failure locally instead: `supabase db reset`\nrestarts postgrest/realtime itself once every migration and the seed have\napplied, then immediately checks the API back through Kong — that check can\nlose the race even though the reset fully succeeded, and the CLI aborts with\nexactly \"Error status 502: An invalid response was received from the\nupstream server\". A `docker restart` on Kong clears it.\n\n- Replay all migrations and seed from scratch: retries up to 3 times on\n  failure, restarting Kong (by the project_id already used the same way in\n  the SECURITY DEFINER step below it) between attempts. The command is\n  idempotent, so a retry is safe.\n- timeout-minutes: 25 -> 30, for the added retry headroom.\n\nNot applied from the brief, and why:\n- `docker system prune --force --all --volumes` before start: a fresh\n  ubuntu-latest runner has nothing to prune, and it would strip any pulled\n  image cache for no benefit.\n- Re-excluding the same containers already excluded: no-op.\n- `supabase inspect db lint`: not a real command on this CLI —\n  `supabase inspect db` only has bloat/blocking/calls/db-stats/index-stats/\n  locks/etc (verified against --help); `db lint` (kept, unchanged) is the\n  actual lint command, under a different subcommand tree entirely. Applying\n  this would have replaced a working step with one that fails outright.\n- Collapsing lint/advisors/definer-exposure/performance-advisors/types-diff\n  into fewer steps would have dropped real coverage this pipeline currently\n  passes; kept every one of them, unchanged.\n\nVerified: full local rehearsal of the job (reset, db lint, security\nadvisors, SECURITY DEFINER exposure script, performance advisors, generated\ntypes) all exit 0, types diff still 0 lines. YAML validated with\naction-validator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3948bfa4a6f0c6c1ce37b0ff172033211b50a464","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/3948bfa4a6f0c6c1ce37b0ff172033211b50a464"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/fea6ddf848a9baac6bb26381a385cff182363a16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/fea6ddf848a9baac6bb26381a385cff182363a16","node_id":"C_kwDOUTTEItoAKGZlYTZkZGY4NDhhOWJhYWM2YmIyNjM4MWEzODVjZmYxODIzNjNhMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/9ba041e5c1aeb61d67569ca975d7537afee5fc02","sha":"9ba041e5c1aeb61d67569ca975d7537afee5fc02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/9ba041e5c1aeb61d67569ca975d7537afee5fc02"}],"sha":"fea6ddf848a9baac6bb26381a385cff182363a16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/fea6ddf848a9baac6bb26381a385cff182363a16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/9ba041e5c1aeb61d67569ca975d7537afee5fc02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:34:57Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:34:57Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"feat: enhance booking and technician history management with new hooks and improved data handling","tree":{"sha":"0ebbcb86bec0ead532fb5cd07f35724dee4e7fee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/0ebbcb86bec0ead532fb5cd07f35724dee4e7fee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/9ba041e5c1aeb61d67569ca975d7537afee5fc02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/9ba041e5c1aeb61d67569ca975d7537afee5fc02","node_id":"C_kwDOUTTEItoAKDliYTA0MWU1YzFhZWI2MWQ2NzU2OWNhOTc1ZDc1MzdhZmVlNWZjMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/8239c5725c61cb2daaa18a5efea297b9839b2350","sha":"8239c5725c61cb2daaa18a5efea297b9839b2350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/8239c5725c61cb2daaa18a5efea297b9839b2350"}],"sha":"9ba041e5c1aeb61d67569ca975d7537afee5fc02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/9ba041e5c1aeb61d67569ca975d7537afee5fc02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/8239c5725c61cb2daaa18a5efea297b9839b2350/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:28:55Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:28:55Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"fix(db): restore optional RPC params, add trigger-filled column defaults for type parity\n\nCI''s \"Generated types match migrations\" step does a literal diff between a\nfresh `supabase gen types` and the committed database.ts. Checked every real\ninsert call site (FamilySOS, SOSConfirmation, ClientSignUpModal) before\ntouching anything: most of the previous hand-loosened Insert types were\nunneeded drift, not a real requirement, so this fixes the two genuine gaps\ninstead of re-loosening the generated file.\n\n- 20260913000016: requests.contact_name/contact_phone get a `default ''''`.\n  Both request-creation call sites correctly never set them — they''re always\n  overwritten by the BEFORE INSERT trigger snapshot_request_contact — so a\n  default lets the generator mark them Insert-optional, honestly.\n- Restores public.register_technician_profile''s p_lat/p_lng `default null`,\n  dropped in 20260913000014''s private/public split (a real regression, not a\n  tightening) — same trailing position, no reordering, so no new overload.\n- TechnicianSignUpModal: p_vehicle_registration has no default (matches the\n  original 000009 contract) and this CLI''s generator never emits `| null`\n  for RPC Args, so the `|| null` fallback no longer type-checks; passes the\n  trimmed string instead. private.register_technician_profile normalises ''''\n  to NULL before the insert, so the stored value is unchanged.\n- src/types/database.ts and packages/shared/src/types/database.ts are now\n  the exact `supabase gen types` output — verified with a clean\n  `supabase db reset --local --yes` + `gen types` producing a 0-line diff,\n  the same check CI runs.\n- TechDashboard.tsx: invoices has no technician_id column of its own\n  (docs/DATABASE.md §5); fixed the earnings query to reach it through\n  requests.technician_id via an embedded filter instead of failing to\n  type-check against the honest generated types.\n\nVerified: pnpm type-check (0 errors), pnpm build / build:technician (exit 0,\nCSS hashes unchanged), supabase db lint + security advisors + the\nSECURITY DEFINER exposure script (all clean), and the full technician API\nsuite (17/17 transitions, 22/22 dismissals/linter, 10/10 sign-up phone).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c305970fe17d650ce196bf81326ec2d35e229a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/3c305970fe17d650ce196bf81326ec2d35e229a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/8239c5725c61cb2daaa18a5efea297b9839b2350","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/8239c5725c61cb2daaa18a5efea297b9839b2350","node_id":"C_kwDOUTTEItoAKDgyMzljNTcyNWM2MWNiMmRhYWExOGE1ZWZlYTI5N2I5ODM5YjIzNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/3feeffecc3b2992a79a584a896261674dee3e7c0","sha":"3feeffecc3b2992a79a584a896261674dee3e7c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/3feeffecc3b2992a79a584a896261674dee3e7c0"}],"sha":"8239c5725c61cb2daaa18a5efea297b9839b2350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/8239c5725c61cb2daaa18a5efea297b9839b2350"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/3feeffecc3b2992a79a584a896261674dee3e7c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:53:29Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:53:29Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"fix(technician): unblock CI install, fix auth trigger phone 500, and align demo coordinates\n\n- pnpm-lock.yaml: add the apps/admin, apps/client and packages/shared\n  importers (6 specifiers in packages/shared were missing), so\n  `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` passes and \"Lint and type-check\" runs.\n  Regenerated with the CI-pinned pnpm 10.34.3; no resolution changes.\n- Dockerfile: copy every workspace manifest (apps/clients no longer exists)\n  and scripts/patch-vite.cjs, which the root postinstall runs, before install.\n- 20260913000015: handle_new_auth_user defers the profile when the identity\n  has no usable phone (000003''s contract, lost in 000009), so email-only\n  sign-up no longer returns 500; profile-sync errors are logged as warnings\n  instead of aborting sign-up. complete_profile gets an explicit enum cast\n  (supabase db lint 42804). Already applied to the hosted project.\n- TechnicianSignUpModal: default locality and fallback coordinates are Gaur\n  City (28.6105, 77.4320), matching useTechnicianBroadcaster''s dev start.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9730a454eb51ceb178f7295b83b2b4e218cb35a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/9730a454eb51ceb178f7295b83b2b4e218cb35a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/3feeffecc3b2992a79a584a896261674dee3e7c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/3feeffecc3b2992a79a584a896261674de