2dc780443dc6548664cfc16344836cee0"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/184727172c80f264c8e36b10d2523bc89c51fe95","sha":"184727172c80f264c8e36b10d2523bc89c51fe95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/184727172c80f264c8e36b10d2523bc89c51fe95"}],"sha":"bbf1fd2526b248dd2c35f013b3c0b3343730a66a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/bbf1fd2526b248dd2c35f013b3c0b3343730a66a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/698b8ee096de1dc87f50485feaf13c1083e09efe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:54:29Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:54:29Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"build(devops): container image, Redis service, and CI pipeline\n\n- Multi-stage Dockerfile: node:22-alpine type-checks and bundles with pnpm\n  (frozen lockfile, VITE_* build args); nginx:1.31-alpine serves dist with\n  SPA history fallback, gzip, security headers, immutable hashed assets and\n  404 for missing chunks.\n- docker-compose.yml: web (8080:80, healthcheck, waits for healthy Redis)\n  and standalone redis:7-alpine with AOF, password, loopback-only port and\n  a persistent volume. Supabase stays under the CLI; containers reach it\n  via host.docker.internal.\n- src/lib/redis.ts (server-only): ioredis client configured from REDIS_URL\n  or REDIS_HOST/PORT/PASSWORD, degrading to null/false/''unavailable'' with\n  throttled warnings when Redis is down. Helpers: technician location cache\n  (90 s TTL) and owner-token locks with compare-and-delete release.\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: lint + type-check; build, container smoke test;\n  Supabase start, full migration replay, db lint, security advisors,\n  vendored splinter lints 0028/0029, and generated-types drift check.\n  Supabase CLI pinned to 2.84.2.\n- .env.example with Supabase, Redis and compose keys; un-ignored in .gitignore.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26438890d10eac321075c6042150986e5fe2431b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/26438890d10eac321075c6042150986e5fe2431b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/698b8ee096de1dc87f50485feaf13c1083e09efe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/698b8ee096de1dc87f50485feaf13c1083e09efe","node_id":"C_kwDOUTTEItoAKDY5OGI4ZWUwOTZkZTFkYzg3ZjUwNDg1ZmVhZjEzYzEwODNlMDllZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/184727172c80f264c8e36b10d2523bc89c51fe95","sha":"184727172c80f264c8e36b10d2523bc89c51fe95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/184727172c80f264c8e36b10d2523bc89c51fe95"}],"sha":"698b8ee096de1dc87f50485feaf13c1083e09efe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/698b8ee096de1dc87f50485feaf13c1083e09efe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/184727172c80f264c8e36b10d2523bc89c51fe95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:19:54Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:19:54Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"fix(db): resolve Supabase security linter findings (0028, 0029, 0008)\n\n- Trigger functions: EXECUTE revoked from PUBLIC, anon, authenticated\n  (firing is unaffected; direct RPC calls are refused)\n- accept_request, advance_request_status, complete_profile,\n  report_technician_location: privileged bodies moved to the private\n  schema; public keeps SECURITY INVOKER entry points with identical\n  signatures that assert authentication (UNAUTHORIZED: Authentication\n  required) and delegate. accept_request also rejects impersonation.\n  service_role keeps the system path on accept/advance.\n- RLS policies for service_categories, service_offerings, users,\n  saved_addresses, family_members, technician_profiles,\n  technician_categories and disputes, with column privileges so role,\n  phone, verification, reputation and dispute outcome fields are not\n  participant-writable\n- Ping partitions in private: partition-level RLS disabled (access only\n  via the RLS-protected parent; no API privileges on partitions)\n- config.toml: minimum_password_length 8, lower/upper/digit/symbol\n  requirement; leaked-password protection documented as a hosted Auth\n  setting (no config.toml key in CLI 2.84)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e0e07c8701f0febf8fc86b48443ebc7c313a174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/5e0e07c8701f0febf8fc86b48443ebc7c313a174"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/184727172c80f264c8e36b10d2523bc89c51fe95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avat