aeb2678c8a259e8614953a37ee1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T03:51:50Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T03:51:50Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"feat(db): Greater Noida demo seed, evidence attachments, live-loop script\n\n- Migration 20260913000001: request_attachments (DATABASE §5.4), private\n  sos-media bucket with path-keyed storage policy (§13), and participant\n  SELECT policies for status events, cost additions, invoices, payments,\n  reviews and attachments (§12)\n- supabase/seed.sql: client Abdullah (Gaur City 2) and verified technicians\n  Amit Singh, Rahul Kumar, Vikram Sharma with password logins; Scenario A\n  pending plumbing SOS, B AC job en_route with Rahul, C completed plumbing\n  job with ₹648 settlement, approved ₹50 addition, invoice, UPI payment,\n  5-star review and before/after photos. Pauses the dispatch sweep on the\n  local demo database.\n- supabase/config.toml: seeds the demo photos into sos-media on db reset\n- scripts/demo-live-loop.mjs: runs the client → technician loop against the\n  local stack (auth, PostgREST, Realtime, Storage) as each persona\n- Regenerated src/types/database.ts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"687a3b7b12797b3420a2f39384baa17bf9b10ea5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/687a3b7b12797b3420a2f39384baa17bf9b10ea5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/e38f8a6244fbaaeb2678c8a259e8614953a37ee1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/e38f8a6244fbaaeb2678c8a259e8614953a37ee1","node_id":"C_kwDOUTTEItoAKGUzOGY4YTYyNDRmYmFhZWIyNjc4YzhhMjU5ZTg2MTQ5NTNhMzdlZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/327dd19c901a3be9e9aaf9d6b28b0d058e0569f1","sha":"327dd19c901a3be9e9aaf9d6b28b0d058e0569f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/327dd19c901a3be9e9aaf9d6b28b0d058e0569f1"}],"sha":"e38f8a6244fbaaeb2678c8a259e8614953a37ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/e38f8a6244fbaaeb2678c8a259e8614953a37ee1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/327dd19c901a3be9e9aaf9d6b28b0d058e0569f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T03:20:08Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T03:20:08Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"feat(db): realtime RLS, dispatch lifecycle, mandatory phone, radius sweep\n\nPhone policy\n- users.phone NOT NULL (canonical E.164); common Indian input formats are\n  normalised by private.normalize_phone()\n- Sign-up creates a profile only when the identity carries a valid phone;\n  email/OAuth identities onboard via complete_profile(p_name, p_phone)\n- Request creation raises CLIENT_PHONE_REQUIRED without a client profile;\n  delegated requests fall back to the client''s phone when the beneficiary\n  has none\n\nDispatch lifecycle\n- Acceptance snapshots the technician position into\n  requests.technician_location_at_dispatch\n- technician_locations.request_id tracks the trip in progress (set on\n  accept/en_route, cleared on any terminal state), trigger-maintained so all\n  writers are covered; pointer writes no longer refresh position freshness\n- technician_location_pings: monthly RANGE partitions (kept in the private\n  schema, off the API surface) with daily pg_cron maintenance\n- report_technician_location(): single write path, upsert + append\n\nRadius sweep\n- private.run_dispatch_sweep(): 10→30 km in 5 km steps every 120 s, then\n  unfulfilled; scheduled bookings unfulfilled 30 min before the slot.\n  FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED plus per-row exception isolation; pg_cron every 30 s\n\nRLS (also Realtime visibility)\n- requests: client own rows; assigned technician; eligible technician\n  (pending, unassigned, category, online, within search radius)\n- technician_locations: technician self; client while their assigned\n  technician is en_route or arrived\n- Policy predicates via SECURITY DEFINER helpers in the private schema\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37f241d0882efe8b9dd0511e24ab2bd351265815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/37f241d0882efe8b9dd0511e24ab2bd351265815"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/327dd19c901a3be9e9aaf9d6b28b0d058e0569f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/327dd19c901a3be9e9aaf9d6b28b0d058e0569f1","node_id":"C_kwDOUTTEItoAKDMyN2RkMTljOTAxYTNiZTllOWFhZjlkNmIyOGIwZDA1OGUwNTY5ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/d9bc08faddaa3baa88ddfbf3f35fa1f76f361976","sha":"d9bc08faddaa3baa88ddfbf3f35fa1f76f361976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/d9bc08faddaa3baa88ddfbf3f35fa1f76f361976"}],"sha":"327dd19c901a3be9e9aaf9d6b28b0d058e0569f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/327dd19c901a3be9e9aaf9d6b28b0d058e0569f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/d9bc08faddaa3baa88ddfbf3f35fa1f76f361976/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:04:39Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:04:39Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"feat(db): realtime publication, technician position cache, nearby matching RPC\n\n- technician_locations (DATABASE §5.5): one row per technician, GiST index\n  idx_technicians_last_geo, updated_at trigger, lowered autovacuum thresholds,\n  RLS enabled deny-by-default\n- supabase_realtime publishes requests, request_cost_additions and\n  technician_locations (DATABASE §10); guarded against re-adding\n- get_nearby_matching_technicians(p_request_id, p_radius_meters): phase-1\n  dispatch eligibility — category match, online with a position under 90 s\n  old, no overlapping non-terminal commitment, ST_DWithin; nearest first.\n  Radius 1–30000 m, NULL uses the request''s search_radius_km.\n  service_role only, since it exposes technician positions.\n- No second index on requests: service_location is already GiST-indexed\n- Regenerated src/types/database.ts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dcd490fed19e9cc319c0f3e75c66464815c5d047","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/dcd490fed19e9cc319c0f3e75c66464815c5d047"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/d9bc08faddaa3baa88ddfbf3f35fa1f76f361976","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/d9bc08faddaa3baa88ddfbf3f35fa1f76f361976","node_id":"C_kwDOUTTEItoAKGQ5YmMwOGZhZGRhYTNiYWE4OGRkZmJmM2YzNWZhMWY3NmYzNjE5NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commit/e32a98deb8618244d3d9a05dd2a0721a310152d3","sha":"e32a98deb8618244d3d9a05dd2a0721a310152d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/e32a98deb8618244d3d9a05dd2a0721a310152d3"}],"sha":"d9bc08faddaa3baa88ddfbf3f35fa1f76f361976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/d9bc08faddaa3baa88ddfbf3f35fa1f76f361976"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/commits/e32a98deb8618244d3d9a05dd2a0721a310152d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T18:18:51Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T18:18:51Z","email":"rnyharena25@gmail.com","name":"nyharena25"},"message":"feat(db): core schema — request spine, concurrency invariants, lifecycle RPCs\n\nFirst Supabase migration, following docs/DATABASE.md and docs/WORKFLOWS.md.\n\n- 9-state request_status enum (includes `unfulfilled`, WORKFLOWS §1.1)\n- Identity, catalogue, addressing, requests, status events, cost additions,\n  invoices, payments, reviews, disputes\n- 3-category cap via technician_categories + locking constraint trigger\n  (FOR NO KEY UPDATE, so it cannot deadlock with the FK''s KEY SHARE lock)\n- GiST EXCLUDE on (technician_id, execution_window) for single active\n  emergency and calendar non-overlap; idx_technician_single_active_job\n  kept as an emergency-scoped backstop\n- accept_request(p_request_id, p_technician_id): row-locked, caller must\n  be p_technician_id (or service_role)\n- advance_request_status(p_request_id, p_next_status): actor-aware\n  transition matrix; completion blocked by pending cost additions\n- Status guard trigger enforces the matrix and terminal immutability for\n  all writers; status events trigger-written\n- RLS enabled on every table with no policies (deny-by-default)\n- Generated src/types/database.ts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5af73d8648255cb481cca5a3f0ec3273502fbf0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/trees/5af73d8648255cb481cca5a3f0ec3273502fbf0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/azhanxsheikh/SewaSyncx/git/commits/e32a98deb8618244d3d9a05dd2a0721a310152d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224937004?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nyharena25","id":224937004,"login":"nyharena25","node_id":"U_kgDODWhELA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyharena25/orgs","received_events_url":"https:/