gic.\n\nAdd the /analytics frontend page (yearly total stat, monthly trend bar\nchart, category donut reused from the dashboard, most-expensive list)\nand a nav bar in the app layout now that there are two pages.","tree":{"sha":"94d0128af55bc4e357f6518cd111750ff4c49b81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/git/trees/94d0128af55bc4e357f6518cd111750ff4c49b81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/git/commits/ccc057f314e293e92d5d6dc897ef1f95455c957d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73241973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam","id":73241973,"login":"mehedipriam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjQxOTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commit/ccc057f314e293e92d5d6dc897ef1f95455c957d","node_id":"C_kwDOUTXZ1doAKGNjYzA1N2YzMTRlMjkzZTkyZDVkNmRjODk3ZWYxZjk1NDU1Yzk1N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commit/526de700b3893e23ff8c47aa35578a3851f47f8b","sha":"526de700b3893e23ff8c47aa35578a3851f47f8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/526de700b3893e23ff8c47aa35578a3851f47f8b"}],"sha":"ccc057f314e293e92d5d6dc897ef1f95455c957d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/ccc057f314e293e92d5d6dc897ef1f95455c957d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73241973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam","id":73241973,"login":"mehedipriam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjQxOTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/526de700b3893e23ff8c47aa35578a3851f47f8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T19:30:40Z","email":"mehedipriam@gmail.com","name":"Mehedi Hasan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T19:30:40Z","email":"mehedipriam@gmail.com","name":"Mehedi Hasan"},"message":"cost normalization service and dashboard\n\nAdd CostNormalizationService converting subscription price + billing\ncycle into normalized monthly/yearly figures (BigDecimal, HALF_UP,\nscale 2), unit-tested across all four billing cycles plus rounding\nbehavior. Add GET /api/v1/dashboard/summary returning spend totals,\nactive count, renewals-due-soon count, upcoming payments (30-day\nwindow), category breakdown with percentages, and a merged recent-\nactivity feed — all handling the zero-subscription case gracefully.\n\nAdd the first real frontend beyond the Phase 1 health check: minimal\nlogin/register pages, a token store + API client with silent\nrefresh-on-401, an AuthContext restoring sessions from the stored\nrefresh token, a protected app layout, and the dashboard page itself\n(summary cards, upcoming payments widget, category donut chart via\nrecharts, recent activity feed, empty state for new users).","tree":{"sha":"7779161b437315a13160b4fa0a8c15e3104f7418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/git/trees/7779161b437315a13160b4fa0a8c15e3104f7418"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/git/commits/526de700b3893e23ff8c47aa35578a3851f47f8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73241973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam","id":73241973,"login":"mehedipriam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjQxOTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commit/526de700b3893e23ff8c47aa35578a3851f47f8b","node_id":"C_kwDOUTXZ1doAKDUyNmRlNzAwYjM4OTNlMjNmZjhjNDdhYTM1NTc4YTM4NTFmNDdmOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commit/b87d89622d7e4ced6bab4211456d01ba08833b2a","sha":"b87d89622d7e4ced6bab4211456d01ba08833b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/b87d89622d7e4ced6bab4211456d01ba08833b2a"}],"sha":"526de700b3893e23ff8c47aa35578a3851f47f8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/526de700b3893e23ff8c47aa35578a3851f47f8b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73241973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam","id":73241973,"login":"mehedipriam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjQxOTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/b87d89622d7e4ced6bab4211456d01ba08833b2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T19:05:06Z","email":"mehedipriam@gmail.com","name":"Mehedi Hasan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T19:05:06Z","email":"mehedipriam@gmail.com","name":"Mehedi Hasan"},"message":" payment history\n\nAdd manual payment entry and per-subscription payment history:\nlist (newest first), create, and soft-delete, nested under\n/subscriptions/{id}/payments. Status defaults to SUCCESS and currency\ndefaults to the parent subscription''s currency when not supplied.\nOwnership is enforced through the parent subscription, so payment\noperations on another user''s subscription 404 the same way\nsubscriptions and categories already do.","tree":{"sha":"d5441c30e22d1b6b221a329311403e1546fc1582","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/git/trees/d5441c30e22d1b6b221a329311403e1546fc1582"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/git/commits/b87d89622d7e4ced6bab4211456d01ba08833b2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73241973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam","id":73241973,"login":"mehedipriam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjQxOTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commit/b87d89622d7e4ced6bab4211456d01ba08833b2a","node_id":"C_kwDOUTXZ1doAKGI4N2Q4OTYyMmQ3ZTRjZWQ2YmFiNDIxMTQ1NmQwMWJhMDg4MzNiMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commit/c0b00537ee91096742ab5a9048beba176e8895e2","sha":"c0b00537ee91096742ab5a9048beba176e8895e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/c0b00537ee91096742ab5a9048beba176e8895e2"}],"sha":"b87d89622d7e4ced6bab4211456d01ba08833b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/b87d89622d7e4ced6bab4211456d01ba08833b2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73241973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam","id":73241973,"login":"mehedipriam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjQxOTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/c0b00537ee91096742ab5a9048beba176e8895e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T18:33:59Z","email":"mehedipriam@gmail.com","name":"Mehedi Hasan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T18:33:59Z","email":"mehedipriam@gmail.com","name":"Mehedi Hasan"},"message":" subscription CRUD, categories, ownership checks\n\nAdd full subscription CRUD (create/list/get/update/soft-delete) and\ncategory management (list defaults + custom, create, delete) with\nownership enforced on every read/write — cross-user access returns 404\nrather than leaking existence. Seed 10 default categories on first\nstartup. Auto-compute nextBillingDate from startDate + billingCycle\nwhen not supplied. Block deleting a category still in use (409).\n\nAlso fixes three bugs surfaced while testing against the live stack:\nJackson 3 rejecting a missing primitive boolean in record\ndeserialization, a LazyInitializationException on list/get caused by\nopen-in-view:false, and a FK constraint violation when deleting a\ncategory only referenced by a soft-deleted subscription.","tree":{"sha":"641393c353620c21eaaa379b56e30bcde2731fb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/git/trees/641393c353620c21eaaa379b56e30bcde2731fb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/git/commits/c0b00537ee91096742ab5a9048beba176e8895e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73241973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam","id":73241973,"login":"mehedipriam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjQxOTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commit/c0b00537ee91096742ab5a9048beba176e8895e2","node_id":"C_kwDOUTXZ1doAKGMwYjAwNTM3ZWU5MTA5Njc0MmFiNWE5MDQ4YmViYTE3NmU4ODk1ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commit/c9cda0336a9357f79dc1643ebc809559c99e9ada","sha":"c9cda0336a9357f79dc1643ebc809559c99e9ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/c9cda0336a9357f79dc1643ebc809559c99e9ada"}],"sha":"c0b00537ee91096742ab5a9048beba176e8895e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/c0b00537ee91096742ab5a9048beba176e8895e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73241973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam","id":73241973,"login":"mehedipriam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjQxOTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/c9cda0336a9357f79dc1643ebc809559c99e9ada/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T10:50:34Z","email":"mehedipriam@gmail.com","name":"Mehedi Hasan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T10:50:34Z","email":"mehedipriam@gmail.com","name":"Mehedi Hasan"},"message":" JWT authentication with refresh tokens\n\nAdd register/login/logout, BCrypt password hashing, short-lived JWT\naccess tokens paired with opaque SHA-256-hashed refresh tokens\n(rotated on use, revoked on password change), a current-user endpoint,\nchange-password, and a token-based forgot/reset-password flow (reset\nlink is logged rather than emailed since no mail server is wired up).\nLock down all routes by default via Spring Security, add a JSON auth\nentry point for clean 401s, a GlobalExceptionHandler for consistent\nerror responses, and a basic in-memory rate limiter on\nlogin/register/forgot-password to blunt brute-force attempts.\n\nAlso fixes a latent Phase 1 bug: the frontend Docker healthcheck used\n, which Alpine resolves to ::1 first: since\nNext''s standalone server only binds IPv4, the healthcheck was silently\nfailing. Switched both frontend and backend healthchecks to 127.0.0.1.\n\nVerified end-to-end against the live dockerized stack: register,\nduplicate-email rejection, validation errors, login, wrong-password\nrejection, protected-route 401s, refresh rotation and revocation,\nchange-password (+ session invalidation), forgot/reset-password\n(including single-use enforcement and no user-enumeration leak), and\nrate-limit trip/reset.","tree":{"sha":"ead6f06b7cc17048a5419081a20c3ef1b9ec2ee8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/git/trees/ead6f06b7cc17048a5419081a20c3ef1b9ec2ee8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/git/commits/c9cda0336a9357f79dc1643ebc809559c99e9ada","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73241973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam","id":73241973,"login":"mehedipriam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjQxOTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commit/c9cda0336a9357f79dc1643ebc809559c99e9ada","node_id":"C_kwDOUTXZ1doAKGM5Y2RhMDMzNmE5MzU3Zjc5ZGMxNjQzZWJjODA5NTU5Yzk5ZTlhZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commit/f41986c2059a6951b1328136951a5d8c82676198","sha":"f41986c2059a6951b1328136951a5d8c82676198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/f41986c2059a6951b1328136951a5d8c82676198"}],"sha":"c9cda0336a9357f79dc1643ebc809559c99e9ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mehedipriam/subscription-manager/commits/c9cda0336a9357f79dc1643ebc809559c99e9ada"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73241973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehedipriam","id":73241973,"login":"mehedipriam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjQxOTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehedipriam/r