er key in ProductsIntegrationOptions\n\nLeadService''s catalogue key pairs with ProductsService''s Internal__CatalogApiKey,\nnot Internal__ApiKey (the approval-replay key). Following the old comment would\nhand a read-only caller the write key.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2cc46f3266d397d7c58eb74d150a8c05f66f107f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uday246r/OmniConnectt/git/trees/2cc46f3266d397d7c58eb74d150a8c05f66f107f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uday246r/OmniConnectt/git/commits/2a6893e09535b2531ac2aa65368f2e5a6565d354","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169604595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ashok-2004","id":169604595,"login":"Ashok-2004","node_id":"U_kgDOChv18w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uday246r/OmniConnectt/commit/2a6893e09535b2531ac2aa65368f2e5a6565d354","node_id":"C_kwDOUTfOFNoAKDJhNjg5M2UwOTUzNWIyNTMxYWMyYWE2NTM2OGYyZTVhNjU2NWQzNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uday246r/OmniConnectt/commit/3338a3561b124be3652230703320887a043c9d4c","sha":"3338a3561b124be3652230703320887a043c9d4c