onnectt/commits/e8c9e30468d1f8757363287fbe88c06aaa7a23eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:36:57Z","email":"manishmishra8970@gmail.com","name":"Ashok-2004"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:36:57Z","email":"manishmishra8970@gmail.com","name":"Ashok-2004"},"message":"Document Google SSO and email invites, and correct the no-SMTP story\n\nAdds docs/SSO-AND-EMAIL.md: how sign-in, AuthProvider and the invite flow\nactually work, with code references.\n\nCorrects two stale claims now that the temp-password handoff is gone:\n\n- Creating a Google user is not yet possible from the Create User form, so\n  SETUP.md points at POST /api/users directly and records the gap.\n- Without SMTP, account creation still succeeds but the account cannot be\n  signed into until mail works and an admin resends the invite. The old text\n  said the maker collects a temporary password from My Requests, which no\n  longer exists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f499147084d7f3c2ba55b3695afd186bbfcaa7aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uday246r/OmniConnectt/git/trees/f499147084d7f3c2ba55b3695afd186bbfcaa7aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uday246r/OmniConnectt/git/commits/e8c9e30468d1f8757363287fbe88c06aaa7a23eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169604595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ashok-2004","id":169604595,"login":"Ashok-2004","node_id":"U_kgDOChv18w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashok-2004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github