46r/OmniConnectt/commits/a081e65800090ba5eb7131644626e7f1fc9189ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173535270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uday246r","id":173535270,"login":"uday246r","node_id":"U_kgDOClfwJg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uday246r/OmniConnectt/commits/6348b909fde457da136ca0bf64b4581b8f3d08ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:51:21Z","email":"udaychauhan246r@gmail.com","name":"Uday246r"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:51:21Z","email":"udaychauhan246r@gmail.com","name":"Uday246r"},"message":"Merge origin/main; replace temp-password handoff with resendable invites\n\nThe remote branch brought the Products & Marketplace remote app, the\napproval test suite, and replay-failure audit logging. Local work had\nremoved the one-time temporary password that a Create-User approval used\nto mint for the maker to collect by hand. Both are kept: the remote''s new\nwork lands intact, and the credential handoff stays gone.\n\nResolving that left the temp-password machinery with no callers, so it is\nremoved outright - the reveal endpoint and its My Requests UI, the\nciphertext columns (with a migration to drop them), and SecretProtector,\nwhose only purpose was encrypting that password. Security__TempPasswordKey\nis no longer a required secret.\n\nBecause an emailed link is now the only way an account becomes usable, a\nfailed or expired invite used to leave an account nobody could ever sign\ninto. Administrators can now resend one from Users. It refuses an account\nthat already has a password, a disabled or Google-backed account, and a\nsecond click inside a one-minute cooldown - issuing revokes the previous\nlink, so an eager retry would kill the mail already in flight.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5e7c4a125f2fbc1e07b0c4751aa2d1dd21ebf9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uday246r/OmniConnectt/git/trees/b5e7c4a125f2fbc1e07b0c4751aa2d1dd21ebf9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uday246r/OmniConnectt/git/commits/6348b909fde457da136ca0bf64b4581b8f3d08ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173535270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uday246r","id":173535270,"login":"uday246r","node_id":"U_kgDOClfwJg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uday246r","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uday246r/OmniConnectt/commit/634