do catálogo -> some da estante também","tree":{"sha":"4a6231c6d93b66387b52dad9bcb2bfb6d5409555","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/trees/4a6231c6d93b66387b52dad9bcb2bfb6d5409555"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/commits/26805fb0b914d182801cf96264fb66a569928892","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142241684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza","id":142241684,"login":"itsjrsouza","node_id":"U_kgDOCHpvlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commit/26805fb0b914d182801cf96264fb66a569928892","node_id":"C_kwDOUUR4n9oAKDI2ODA1ZmIwYjkxNGQxODI4MDFjZjk2MjY0ZmI2NmE1Njk5Mjg4OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commit/6316be26b847b03b3970c439ad98baffc7ce3815","sha":"6316be26b847b03b3970c439ad98baffc7ce3815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/6316be26b847b03b3970c439ad98baffc7ce3815"}],"sha":"26805fb0b914d182801cf96264fb66a569928892","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/26805fb0b914d182801cf96264fb66a569928892"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142241684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza","id":142241684,"login":"itsjrsouza","node_id":"U_kgDOCHpvlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/6316be26b847b03b3970c439ad98baffc7ce3815/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:29:48Z","email":"nelson.junior@outlook.com","name":"Nelson Junior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:29:48Z","email":"nelson.junior@outlook.com","name":"Nelson Junior"},"message":"Corrige deploy do CI/CD: substitui amondnet/vercel-action por vercel CLI direto\n\namondnet/vercel-action@v25 instala uma versão fixa do Vercel CLI\n(25.1.0) que a API da Vercel não aceita mais: \"Your Vercel CLI version\nis outdated. This endpoint requires version 47.2.2 or later.\"\n\nTroca para o fluxo que a própria Vercel documenta para CI: instala\nvercel@latest via npm a cada execução (sempre atual, sem depender de\numa action de terceiros desatualizada), e usa vercel pull + vercel\nbuild + vercel deploy --prebuilt.","tree":{"sha":"1be8b739659c86961709bae28dde2ca0b342151d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/trees/1be8b739659c86961709bae28dde2ca0b342151d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/commits/6316be26b847b03b3970c439ad98baffc7ce3815","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142241684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza","id":142241684,"login":"itsjrsouza","node_id":"U_kgDOCHpvlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commit/6316be26b847b03b3970c439ad98baffc7ce3815","node_id":"C_kwDOUUR4n9oAKDYzMTZiZTI2Yjg0N2IwM2IzOTcwYzQzOWFkOThiYWZmYzdjZTM4MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commit/8de3b932b9a34fa42b717f7723d951d8017bbac1","sha":"8de3b932b9a34fa42b717f7723d951d8017bbac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/8de3b932b9a34fa42b717f7723d951d8017bbac1"}],"sha":"6316be26b847b03b3970c439ad98baffc7ce3815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/6316be26b847b03b3970c439ad98baffc7ce3815"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142241684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza","id":142241684,"login":"itsjrsouza","node_id":"U_kgDOCHpvlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/8de3b932b9a34fa42b717f7723d951d8017bbac1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:21:11Z","email":"nelson.junior@outlook.com","name":"Nelson Junior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:21:11Z","email":"nelson.junior@outlook.com","name":"Nelson Junior"},"message":"Adiciona retry e logs de debug ao proxy do crudcrud\n\nDiagnóstico real do 502 anterior: não era bug no parse do body nem no\nenvio da resposta — bati direto no crudcrud.com (sem passar pela nossa\nfunção) e reproduzi um 502 vindo do próprio nginx deles; testei de novo\nsegundos depois e voltou a funcionar (201). É instabilidade conhecida de\num serviço gratuito de sandbox, não um bug de código.\n\n- Extrai lógica compartilhada para api/_lib/crudcrud.js (pasta com \"_\"\n  não vira rota na Vercel)\n- fetchWithRetry: até 3 tentativas com backoff curto quando o upstream\n  responde 5xx ou falha de rede — absorve exatamente esse tipo de falha\n  transitória\n- console.log/console.error antes e depois de cada chamada ao crudcrud,\n  visíveis nos Runtime Logs da Vercel\n- parseResponseBody trata resposta não-JSON (ex: HTML de um 502 do nginx\n  do crudcrud) sem estourar exceção sem contexto\n- Testado com um mock que falha na 1ª tentativa e sucede na 2ª: o retry\n  absorve a falha e o cliente recebe o 201 final normalmente","tree":{"sha":"717f5afe56cac7ef412b0bb0d2fdf13dbfa0fbf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/trees/717f5afe56cac7ef412b0bb0d2fdf13dbfa0fbf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/commits/8de3b932b9a34fa42b717f7723d951d8017bbac1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142241684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza","id":142241684,"login":"itsjrsouza","node_id":"U_kgDOCHpvlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commit/8de3b932b9a34fa42b717f7723d951d8017bbac1","node_id":"C_kwDOUUR4n9oAKDhkZTNiOTMyYjlhMzRmYTQyYjcxN2Y3NzIzZDk1MWQ4MDE3YmJhYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commit/0c9eed3c1cd21ea31ee1eb19fe158576b29026c5","sha":"0c9eed3c1cd21ea31ee1eb19fe158576b29026c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/0c9eed3c1cd21ea31ee1eb19fe158576b29026c5"}],"sha":"8de3b932b9a34fa42b717f7723d951d8017bbac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/8de3b932b9a34fa42b717f7723d951d8017bbac1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142241684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza","id":142241684,"login":"itsjrsouza","node_id":"U_kgDOCHpvlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/0c9eed3c1cd21ea31ee1eb19fe158576b29026c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:16:43Z","email":"nelson.junior@outlook.com","name":"Nelson Junior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:16:43Z","email":"nelson.junior@outlook.com","name":"Nelson Junior"},"message":"Corrige provável causa do 502 no proxy /api/livros\n\n- Reescreve as duas funções em CommonJS puro (module.exports), não ESM\n  (export default): o package.json do micro-catalogo não declara\n  \"type\": \"module\", então export default pode falhar a carregar como\n  função serverless dependendo do runtime — quebrando ANTES do\n  try/catch rodar, o que bate com um 502 sem corpo de erro nenhum.\n- try/catch agora envolve a função inteira, não só a chamada fetch.\n- Body parseado defensivamente (aceita objeto já parseado ou string JSON).\n- CRUDCRUD_URL tem barras finais removidas antes de concatenar um id,\n  evitando \"//livros/:id\".\n- Usa upstream.text() + JSON.parse condicional em vez de upstream.json()\n  direto, evitando exceção não descritiva em respostas vazias/não-JSON.\n- Testado (CommonJS via require, não import) contra um mock do crudcrud:\n  GET/POST (body objeto e string)/PUT/DELETE, e o caminho de erro\n  (URL inválida) retornando 502 com mensagem clara em vez de travar.","tree":{"sha":"26d5abcd2a2c6ece143781879099a76d2cb46230","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/trees/26d5abcd2a2c6ece143781879099a76d2cb46230"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/commits/0c9eed3c1cd21ea31ee1eb19fe158576b29026c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142241684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza","id":142241684,"login":"itsjrsouza","node_id":"U_kgDOCHpvlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commit/0c9eed3c1cd21ea31ee1eb19fe158576b29026c5","node_id":"C_kwDOUUR4n9oAKDBjOWVlZDNjMWNkMjFlYTMxZWUxZWIxOWZlMTU4NTc2YjI5MDI2YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commit/fafca867758c79cd4276768a9f9d89ed4a165570","sha":"fafca867758c79cd4276768a9f9d89ed4a165570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/fafca867758c79cd4276768a9f9d89ed4a165570"}],"sha":"0c9eed3c1cd21ea31ee1eb19fe158576b29026c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/0c9eed3c1cd21ea31ee1eb19fe158576b29026c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142241684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza","id":142241684,"login":"itsjrsouza","node_id":"U_kgDOCHpvlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/fafca867758c79cd4276768a9f9d89ed4a165570/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:09:25Z","email":"nelson.junior@outlook.com","name":"Nelson Junior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:09:25Z","email":"nelson.junior@outlook.com","name":"Nelson Junior"},"message":"Adiciona proxy serverless para o crudcrud e usa loadEnv no vite.config do shell\n\n- shell/vite.config.ts: troca leitura direta de process.env por loadEnv (mode)\n- micro-catalogo/vercel.json e micro-estante/vercel.json: CORS mais completo\n- Novo proxy Serverless (api/livros/index.js e api/livros/[id].js) no\n  micro-catalogo: em produção, o client chama /api/livros em vez de bater\n  direto no crudcrud, escondendo a URL do endpoint do bundle público\n- api.js escolhe automaticamente: dev usa CRUDCRUD_URL direto, build de\n  produção com PUBLIC_URL definido usa o proxy\n- Testado: lógica de seleção de URL (dev/prod) e os handlers do proxy\n  (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE) validados contra um mock do crudcrud","tree":{"sha":"76545c9ae66144117ae13889ab117c421b6f4a51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/trees/76545c9ae66144117ae13889ab117c421b6f4a51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/commits/fafca867758c79cd4276768a9f9d89ed4a165570","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142241684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza","id":142241684,"login":"itsjrsouza","node_id":"U_kgDOCHpvlA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commit/fafca867758c79cd4276768a9f9d89ed4a165570","node_id":"C_kwDOUUR4n9oAKGZhZmNhODY3NzU4Yzc5Y2Q0Mjc2NzY4YTlmOWQ4OWVkNGExNjU1NzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/itsjrsouza/bookhub/c