,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/commits/266d7ff4e30ce1b256b13fdb31c1a3431ab0a13a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T03:08:25Z","email":"nelson.junior@outlook.com","name":"Nelson Junior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T03:08:25Z","email":"nelson.junior@outlook.com","name":"Nelson Junior"},"message":"BookHub: plataforma de leitura única (catálogo, estante, diário, micro frontends, CI/CD e performance)\n\n- apps/shell: container React+TS+Vite+Tailwind, dark mode, consome os micros via Module Federation\n- apps/micro-catalogo: catálogo de livros (React+JS+Webpack MF) integrado ao crudcrud.com\n- apps/micro-estante: estante pessoal (React+JS+Webpack MF), sincronizada via evento global + localStorage\n- packages/shared: tipos, constante de evento e estanteStore compartilhados\n- public/diario: PWA \"Diário de Leitura\" (HTML/CSS/JS puro), offline-first e instalável\n- .github/workflows/main.yml: lint → test → build → deploy (Vercel)\n- docs/performance: auditoria Lighthouse antes/depois do próprio BookHub","tree":{"sha":"c42a6c02a78e12b1439d9e2f171656629a8bb158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/trees/c42a6c02a78e12b1439d9e2f171656629a8bb158"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsjrsouza/bookhub/git/commits/266d7ff4e30ce1b256b13fdb31c1a3431ab0a13a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142241684?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsjrsouza/foll