://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RKsaitex","id":315803840,"login":"RKsaitex","node_id":"U_kgDOEtLIwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/ba4e24a6f700a9353754ba8e83b7eaec116761a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:37:25Z","email":"rohithkrishna.radhakrishnan@sai-tex.com","name":"RKsaitex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:37:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add the Techpack regression suite (90 cases) with UAT support (#8)\n\n* Add UAT as a supported test environment\n\nTEST_ENV=uat now resolves UAT_APP_SHELL_URL and gets the same timeout and\nworker cap as dev, since both are shared remote environments. Adds\ntest:techpack:uat / test:sanity:techpack:uat / test:smoke:techpack:uat.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add a shell header page object and a second-user login helper\n\nShellHeaderPage wraps the shell''s language switcher and user menu so any\nmodule can reuse them. loginAsUser() opens a clean, separately\nauthenticated context; secondUserCredentials() reads an optional second\nlogin from <PREFIX>_SECOND_USER_<ENV> / <PREFIX>_SECOND_PASSWORD_<ENV>.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Techpack page objects for AI Mode, Canvas Review and Validation Rules\n\nNew locator/page pairs for the AI Mode copilot, the techpack canvas and\nthe Validation Rules admin screen, wired into techpack.fixtures.ts, plus\nthe list and Classic-form helpers the regression suite needs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add the Techpack regression suite (90 cases) with PDF fixtures\n\nSix specs covering the Techpacks list, Classic and AI Mode creation,\ncanvas review, multi-user presence and Validation Rules. Known bugs and\nopen clarifications link to their ClickUp tickets via allure.tms().\nIncludes the two sample techpack PDFs the AI Mode and Classic flows upload.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Techpack test-case docs\n\nOne doc per screen with every case''s steps, expected result, ClickUp\nlink and latest UAT/dev result.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Wait on Re-extract itself in Canvas Review TC:16\n\nAn AI-created draft''s canvas has no \"Techpack Details\" tab, so the\ngeneric canvas-loaded check never resolved there.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Rohithkrishna R <rk@Rohithkrishnas-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b8ae0df6b7b656b04c93c4305f00d1fb5d490f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/8b8ae0df6b7b656b04c93c4305f00d1fb5d490f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/ba4e24a6f700a9353754ba8e83b7eaec116761a7","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b8ae0df6b7b656b04c93c4305f00d1fb5d490f4\nparent cf748fd454926c6ccc3f3cd8c1d68f6c122a6c2b\nauthor RKsaitex <rohithkrishna.radhakrishnan@sai-tex.com> 1790926645 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790926645 +0530\n\nAdd the Techpack regression suite (90 cases) with UAT support (#8)\n\n* Add UAT as a supported test environment\n\nTEST_ENV=uat now resolves UAT_APP_SHELL_URL and gets the same timeout and\nworker cap as dev, since both are shared remote environments. Adds\ntest:techpack:uat / test:sanity:techpack:uat / test:smoke:techpack:uat.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add a shell header page object and a second-user login helper\n\nShellHeaderPage wraps the shell''s language switcher and user menu so any\nmodule can reuse them. loginAsUser() opens a clean, separately\nauthenticated context; secondUserCredentials() reads an optional second\nlogin from <PREFIX>_SECOND_USER_<ENV> / <PREFIX>_SECOND_PASSWORD_<ENV>.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Techpack page objects for AI Mode, Canvas Review and Validation Rules\n\nNew locator/page pairs for the AI Mode copilot, the techpack canvas and\nthe Validation Rules admin screen, wired into techpack.fixtures.ts, plus\nthe list and Classic-form helpers the regression suite needs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add the Techpack regression suite (90 cases) with PDF fixtures\n\nSix specs covering the Techpacks list, Classic and AI Mode creation,\ncanvas review, multi-user presence and Validation Rules. Known bugs and\nopen clarifications link to their ClickUp tickets via allure.tms().\nIncludes the two sample techpack PDFs the AI Mode and Classic flows upload.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Techpack test-case docs\n\nOne doc per screen with every case''s steps, expected result, ClickUp\nlink and latest UAT/dev result.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Wait on Re-extract itself in Canvas Review TC:16\n\nAn AI-created draft''s canvas has no \"Techpack Details\" tab, so the\ngeneric canvas-loaded check never resolved there.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Rohithkrishna R <rk@Rohithkrishnas-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv181CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoRsQAKR4YtL0nvQWlFQtTo4+qRFI\nsfO9Bgq6Kv+wnfbqdYHP9HufRP/XiZhvbvt9t4KB0EwtEp1SsssKEr4dB1ADTiYy\ndnjQ1ThC4YYNiLXMKOKyr+MBFmlOvLicbGEM12UX70Er13UUoR8pxZq20ypbLfqI\nDfYtGDCj96BZgkzrsuwBnvkxupMpLMxTM2g8sdOeWJteMRuULFYzSthEMCqlFR24\nELpcCFShkzXcGWan2G83U5EUdQbgOXe7qnbeSY4z4eWIpsyThBJ4c0lSoTBQAXFf\nuBULJf+EOxWJqYSzRJw/x5sJD+4/2rIS2mH6mm2CrWqehJKAwZRCN1oMbB3R64Ft\n7RSs7/vaG0th2ADhXh64hSUAVZVs+zmiKX+K3/A6LUVlskLEjM+kN9MsjZamTPGy\nVCALIoR2+RS7XGZbaQ0zKa2UHCt6i7J4I/JHPlYXYT7BJmyrhBWmK21SD33jIgg5\noRlt61IBgmxk3MCI+UJNJwfPfTmVSNiCF5eKpW4M7bjz+mXcMha1ztRbkiYwwwih\nhwgcIJPH9icSLyKPO8YkRpxeE/6ugCYcsBzQQkpP+lpmYCRK0TQgfI3+ZWkDpbYR\nt9LYCOoQGhKzdTy7tQB2pLKF7RSZ6+6mFYfdZZ7GRG/TIhf8XrIpuO8slMyswxY/\nw4m72S7twcqH3mqTSMKH\n=yC5d\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T07:37:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/ba4e24a6f700a9353754ba8e83b7eaec116761a7","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKGJhNGUyNGE2ZjcwMGE5MzUzNzU0YmE4ZTgzYjdlYWVjMTE2NzYxYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/cf748fd454926c6ccc3f3cd8c1d68f6c122a6c2b","sha":"cf748fd454926c6ccc3f3cd8c1d68f6c122a6c2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/cf748fd454926c6ccc3f3cd8c1d68f6c122a6c2b"}],"sha":"ba4e24a6f700a9353754ba8e83b7eaec116761a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/ba4e24a6f700a9353754ba8e83b7eaec116761a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315803840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RKsaitex","id":315803840,"login":"RKsaitex","node_id":"U_kgDOEtLIwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/cf748fd454926c6ccc3f3cd8c1d68f6c122a6c2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:36:56Z","email":"rohithkrishna.radhakrishnan@sai-tex.com","name":"RKsaitex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:36:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update Planning and Master Data smoke tests for the new required fields (#9)\n\nThe app''s create forms changed on dev, so four smoke creates stopped\nsaving:\n- Work Centre: new required \"Centre type\" (picks \"Sewing lines\").\n- Employee: \"Maintained by\" is now required with no default (picks \"By hand\").\n- Site: Country and Timezone are now enforced (picks Vietnam / Ho Chi Minh).\n- Department: the required \"Operates at\" site row became an optional\n  \"Facility\" row (\"Add site\" -> \"Add facility\"); no facility is added now.\n\nCo-authored-by: Rohithkrishna R <rk@Rohithkrishnas-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"290ccf16adcc2c8968aba25350d96b74514b1370","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/290ccf16adcc2c8968aba25350d96b74514b1370"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/cf748fd454926c6ccc3f3cd8c1d68f6c122a6c2b","verification":{"payload":"tree 290ccf16adcc2c8968aba25350d96b74514b1370\nparent ab3ffd956114e4ef56c143d27c367c29ea028ab1\nauthor RKsaitex <rohithkrishna.radhakrishnan@sai-tex.com> 1790926616 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790926616 +0530\n\nUpdate Planning and Master Data smoke tests for the new required fields (#9)\n\nThe app''s create forms changed on dev, so four smoke creates stopped\nsaving:\n- Work Centre: new required \"Centre type\" (picks \"Sewing lines\").\n- Employee: \"Maintained by\" is now required with no default (picks \"By hand\").\n- Site: Country and Timezone are now enforced (picks Vietnam / Ho Chi Minh).\n- Department: the required \"Operates at\" site row became an optional\n  \"Facility\" row (\"Add site\" -> \"Add facility\"); no facility is added now.\n\nCo-authored-by: Rohithkrishna R <rk@Rohithkrishnas-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv18YCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgwAQAEAHC+lwP4fUNXh5Drq1zA4R\nyuyeHlZuB3OcROO/6GNhX4EXP/6kSIwRCWFihnqWzngpcEE