30624a7f02a4060ad63b9343f9da68"}],"sha":"2ff2e9d4384e0909da7a943facce74bf3050fdeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/2ff2e9d4384e0909da7a943facce74bf3050fdeb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315803840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RKsaitex","id":315803840,"login":"RKsaitex","node_id":"U_kgDOEtLIwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/6ebbb6e1ec30624a7f02a4060ad63b9343f9da68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:10:48Z","email":"rohithkrishna.radhakrishnan@sai-tex.com","name":"RKsaitex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:10:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add Techpack Create-Classic smoke test (#7)\n\n* Add Techpack Create-Classic smoke test\n\nPage objects/locators for the Techpack list and Classic create form\n(TechpackPage/CreateTechpackPage), a fixtures.ts scoped to just those\ntwo, and one happy-path smoke test: \"Create Techpack (Classic):\nsuccessful creation with a random identity\". Reuses the same\nfillAllRequiredWithRandomAvailable() / createExpectingResult() /\nexpectCreatedSuccessfully() flow (including retry-on-duplicate-identity)\nalready proven in this codebase''s regression suite. Confirmed with 2\nclean full-suite runs against dev.\n\nAlso fixes MODULES[''techpack''].path, which had regressed to the\nsingular ''/techpack'' (a real, confirmed-live routing bug — gotoAuthenticated()\nsilently lands on the App Launcher home instead of the Techpacks list) —\nneeded for this test to work against a clean checkout.\n\nDeliberately narrow: AI Mode, Canvas Review, and multi-user presence\npage objects/specs, plus the full regression suite and test-case docs,\nare separate, pre-existing work and are not part of this PR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add missing Allure tags to Techpack smoke suite\n\nAddresses review feedback on PR #7: techpack.smoke.spec.ts had zero\nallure.epic()/feature()/owner() calls, same gap already fixed on the\nPlanning smoke suite after its own review. Adds a beforeEach matching\nthat pattern (epic ''Techpack'', feature ''Smoke'', owner ''Techpack QA'').\n\nConfirmed lint and the full smoke suite (3/3) still pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Rohithkrishna R <rk@Rohithkrishnas-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Sathish Nagarajan <sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com>","tree":{"sha":"8769f92a793579e62da43972e44eed8a5b4aa52e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/8769f92a793579e62da43972e44eed8a5b4aa52e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/6ebbb6e1ec30624a7f02a4060ad63b9343f9da68","verification":{"payload":"tree 8769f92a793579e62da43972e44eed8a5b4aa52e\nparent b2f549cce8e31b2f7c49aa50d23455981380ca06\nauthor RKsaitex <rohithkrishna.radhakrishnan@sai-tex.com> 1790590248 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790590248 +0530\n\nAdd Techpack Create-Classic smoke test (#7)\n\n* Add Techpack Create-Classic smoke test\n\nPage objects/locators for the Techpack list and Classic create form\n(TechpackPage/CreateTechpackPage), a fixtures.ts scoped to just those\ntwo, and one happy-path smoke test: \"Create Techpack (Classic):\nsuccessful creation with a random identity\". Reuses the same\nfillAllRequiredWithRandomAvailable() / createExpectingResult() /\nexpectCreatedSuccessfully() flow (including retry-on-duplicate-identity)\nalready proven in this codebase''s regression suite. Confirmed with 2\nclean full-suite runs against dev.\n\nAlso fixes MODULES[''techpack''].path, which had regressed to the\nsingular ''/techpack'' (a real, confirmed-live routing bug — gotoAuthenticated()\nsilently lands on the App Launcher home instead of the Techpacks list) —\nneeded for this test to work against a clean checkout.\n\nDeliberately narrow: AI Mode, Canvas Review, and multi-user presence\npage objects/specs, plus the full regression suite and test-case docs,\nare separate, pre-existing work and are not part of this PR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add missing Allure tags to Techpack smoke suite\n\nAddresses review feedback on PR #7: techpack.smoke.spec.ts had zero\nallure.epic()/feature()/owner() calls, same gap already fixed on the\nPlanning smoke suite after its own review. Adds a beforeEach matching\nthat pattern (epic ''Techpack'', feature ''Smoke'', owner ''Techpack QA'').\n\nConfirmed lint and the full smoke suite (3/3) still pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Rohithkrishna R <rk@Rohithkrishnas-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Sathish Nagarajan <sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquj0oCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqQQQAI8kPTreguALH04BP8Y+334T\n9/DBPOrC1PKKr/XH1U5euAcTa9lXYGqtl2GwsABBFENf3RBVcqRSLENymQ/VvuYy\nOgpqCvBiMc7oi6v6NeaHhIBwlCncoAv5cR/iSIPXSQ6cpqxqKIrhzi7a72aoT2M0\n7MYELYw