/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/b2f549cce8e31b2f7c49aa50d23455981380ca06"}],"sha":"6ebbb6e1ec30624a7f02a4060ad63b9343f9da68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/6ebbb6e1ec30624a7f02a4060ad63b9343f9da68"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315803840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RKsaitex","id":315803840,"login":"RKsaitex","node_id":"U_kgDOEtLIwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RKsaitex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/b2f549cce8e31b2f7c49aa50d23455981380ca06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T10:40:06Z","email":"rohithkrishna.radhakrishnan@sai-tex.com","name":"RKsaitex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T10:40:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add Planning smoke coverage: Calendars, Work Centres, Qualifications, Machines (#6)\n\nOne happy-path smoke test per screen under Planning > Master Data,\nsame pattern as CRM''s smoke suite. Fixtures scoped to exactly what\nthese tests need (Calendars/Work Centres/Qualifications/Machines) —\nActivities and Difficulty Grade are separate, pre-existing work from\nbefore this session and are deliberately not part of this PR.\n\nAlso fixes PlanningPage/PlanningLocators'' landing-view stub (wrong\n<h1> guess; real heading is an <h2> \"Planning\"), confirmed live and\nmatching the identical bug independently found on Master Data''s own\nlanding page the same day.\n\nAddresses review feedback on the prior version of this PR: fixes the\n3 lint errors (all were in the now-removed Activities/Difficulty\nGrade files) and adds the missing Allure epic/feature/owner tags to\nthis suite''s own beforeEach, matching this repo''s other smoke suites.\n\nQualification''s Operator+Task is a real uniqueness key (a repeat pair\nis rejected as a duplicate), so its smoke test picks a random pair\neach run and retries on a genuine 409 conflict by reading the actual\nPOST response status rather than racing toast visibility.\n\nConfirmed live against dev before automating each screen: Work\nCentre''s 21-field form only has 5 fields that actually block save;\nMachine''s create endpoint briefly 500''d and was confirmed fixed\nmid-session before being automated around.\n\nCo-authored-by: Rohithkrishna R <rk@Rohithkrishnas-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6cebb0646a41854a00743ab6e5e478fdf84bb0e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/6cebb0646a41854a00743ab6e5e478fdf84bb0e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/b2f549cce8e31b2f7c49aa50d23455981380ca06","verification":{"payload":"tree 6cebb0646a41854a00743ab6e5e478fdf84bb0e4\nparent 970bebee85c79cbd014f260a1afebd1a625f369e\nauthor RKsaitex <rohithkrishna.radhakrishnan@sai-tex.com> 1790332806 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790332806 +0530\n\nAdd Planning smoke coverage: Calendars, Work Centres, Qualifications, Machines (#6)\n\nOne happy-path smoke test per screen under Planning > Master Data,\nsame pattern as CRM''s smoke suite. Fixtures scoped to exactly what\nthese tests need (Calendars/Work Centres/Qualifications/Machines) —\nActivities and Difficulty Grade are separate, pre-existing work from\nbefore this session and are deliberately not part of this PR.\n\nAlso fixes PlanningPage/PlanningLocators'' landing-view stub (wrong\n<h1> guess; real heading is an <h2> \"Planning\"), confirmed live and\nmatching the identical bug independently found on Master Data''s own\nlanding page the same day.\n\nAddresses review feedback on the prior version of this PR: fixes the\n3 lint errors (all were in the now-removed Activities/Difficulty\nGrade files) and adds the missing Allure epic/feature/owner tags to\nthis suite''s own beforeEach, matching this repo''s other smoke suites.\n\nQualification''s Operator+Task is a real uniqueness key (a repeat pair\nis rejected as a duplicate), so its smoke test picks a random pair\neach run and retries on a genuine 409 conflict by reading the actual\nPOST response status rather than racing toast visibility.\n\nConfirmed live against dev before automating each screen: Work\nCentre''s 21-field form only has 5 fields that actually block save;\nMachine''s create endpoint briefly 500''d and was confirmed fixed\nmid-session before being automated around.\n\nCo-authored-by: Rohithkrishna R <rk@Rohithkrishnas-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtk+GCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlpwQAF7nwzVviG8Uj8kLO4HgrL4Q\n8w0KPzQWmL899mW9KpfWeHToAMr02/xTqlQ+SIdH+lz4U3V6wd/iif6FtDfxANZQ\nK2tv7xwNOS3irkj+26vMpNpdBQKTmgTbmvqzLIeW5LVdXpO1+gHRBxLGWJXtlYEA\n1J9ycmHtFcikWHBZrCJQy91qkqk9rMow1T/2LE5JbzzhN0GSLyp05HRGMEN5I5QC\nsGzkL9A40DltAqLRJInT9nr/NkwaYNWQS5c3r2yzNPWhxCXqx25e6EKvHg+jWUaa\nIZZy+Ewr2BaFNpdPWQ+0Z3SGr2Y9T5LQqEqA35OzyC2L9hBMyBrz4/xCYVoBQ8S6\nYfVmDNV/9qXc9mfApAPqTNniiMA8UhXAEg5iHr923e3yZeHLt6l6HgY2xyA5tQUJ\nWtKS6bK0j86NMpj97vM+QlUEfSVxzOEnfk21uICWI4EXUtYWYz9T684EkgXIRlkD\ny5spOrjo7QpDjTVsdIfnshf5mJTyJ7BIOYkfJKsC9pIrH9LC1JH2buquxHvTVwhq\nNs2KBWD9U2W8QOrhx0xRWza4rL9KcWF