https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jayashri0306","id":318596555,"login":"Jayashri0306","node_id":"U_kgDOEv1lyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/970bebee85c79cbd014f260a1afebd1a625f369e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T10:28:07Z","email":"jayashri.sakthivel@sai-tex.com","name":"Jayashri0306"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T10:28:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add BOM as its own module with a 7-check smoke suite (#4)\n\nBOM is served by app-techpack, but the shell mounts it at its own /bom\nroute, so it gets its own module (own folders, own BOM_* login) rather\nthan living under techpack. Shared-file changes: one MODULES entry,\npackage.json scripts, .env.example vars and CODEOWNERS rows.\n\nSmoke checks (read-only, nothing saved on dev): list loads, status tabs\nfilter to their counts, search by techpack code, New BOM opens with\nCreate disabled and cancels, open detail + Back, Approved BOM is locked,\nReports menu. Shares one tab so the ~35s BOM load happens once.\n\nAlso re-wraps one line in mill/requests.page.ts that failed prettier.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jayashri <jayashri@Jayashris-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@a