ow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/87a3b1e0e32a69c9b21e6e82736bdd3488646546","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKDg3YTNiMWUwZTMyYTY5YzliMjFlNmU4MjczNmJkZDM0ODg2NDY1NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/9b0d3838c2c9ea3692133375a4caaa17938db59b","sha":"9b0d3838c2c9ea3692133375a4caaa17938db59b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/9b0d3838c2c9ea3692133375a4caaa17938db59b"}],"sha":"87a3b1e0e32a69c9b21e6e82736bdd3488646546","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/87a3b1e0e32a69c9b21e6e82736bdd3488646546"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/318596555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jayashri0306","id":318596555,"login":"Jayashri0306","node_id":"U_kgDOEv1lyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jayashri0306","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/9b0d3838c2c9ea3692133375a4caaa17938db59b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:56:55Z","email":"jayashri.sakthivel@sai-tex.com","name":"Jayashri0306"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:56:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add Fabric Mill smoke suite: 14 checks across production screens and goods requests (#3)\n\nCovers the four production screens (Spinning, Preparation, Weaving,\nFinishing) and Goods request & approval, picked from the 31 mill user\nstories tested Sep 18-24. Cotton Intake is left out (not in phase one).\n\nEvery check is read-only or stops at client-side validation, so nothing\nis saved on shared dev. The suite loads the mill remote once (~40s on\ndev) and switches screens through the mill navigation drawer (~3s)\ninstead of a full page load per test: ~1.2 min per run vs ~6 min.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jayashri <jayashri@Jayashris-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98da27d29ce2d87a323c793ec33e33aa4e4f00b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/98da27d29ce2d87a323c793ec33e33aa4e4f00b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/9b0d3838c2c9ea3692133375a4caaa17938db59b","verification":{"payload":"tree 98da27d29ce2d87a323c793ec33e33aa4e4f00b2\nparent 2d7c1a2d40f7cfc52517fa90a65bbec37ad3c696\nauthor Jayashri0306 <jayashri.sakthivel@sai-tex.com> 1790254615 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790254615 +0530\n\nAdd Fabric Mill smoke suite: 14 checks across production screens and goods requests (#3)\n\nCovers the four production screens (Spinning, Preparation, Weaving,\nFinishing) and Goods request & approval, picked from the 31 mill user\nstories tested Sep 18-24. Cotton Intake is left out (not in phase one).\n\nEvery check is read-only or stops at client-side validation, so nothing\nis saved on shared dev. The suite loads the mill remote once (~40s on\ndev) and switches screens through the mill navigation drawer (~3s)\ninstead of a full page load per test: ~1.2 min per run vs ~6 min.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jayashri <jayashri@Jayashris-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtR4XCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAorYQACW15SojvJ6OitdOWJv6OnW1\nsD1+kofrhPQ4+B1Yno3AaPYbprOrGZVE9dm7de3clQsmx6vFxB3zxZe1jWpGygey\nDNpB38koDrlZePBEsDTW74myIDe9MdP4Lvov3QUyXkZsg/x9YIAGkg9Zvhcva2OU\nBCb730B1JzozqSyL+9FJvKUcBQCyT+9asNRgHUgAga1SXH7QeQduTrKd0fwyeDdz\nA5la/R0Pbc4fV2PoGoDxamv6ahy3o86PfdPR5PZXMSJpD16wv3N/5CjfVjY7DLRx\nbnrw7hLqcCNvK0XqOn3Or0yJm3VJ/iBkVGQSJ0MdaYLDtHXo/+xh1Ml2KjH/iiqI\nObtKn9lOW5KM1Z+INPHAOjBItU2/Tbp8QF7DbYsy490mJKtOwi/8e290QTmX4Ddt\naTLuxAIKojsFQANfoylF9Wj6TFngQcpcQsRJ8ZImFa7QHnkVgKXeSCi5c1I1IZ3/\nZWP4chFxMVGPSnz91KpaGBCyj4M/M7maoIXnj4UaOtmcnDxZtCmlksAWfJDq72hM\n7cQlk8sKBl9wQCY4/QQvBHZkKIh2VLmUnYMo+gT/RdW5BkXYbbKZtiVVGPBh/xjf\nZOFeJwvrunBUiQMaS4bwXcLYPX3Bv4BJqT95+zdFWoyQb4g1ku1GR1gE0eqZn3eT\nV6nwoIDzjZLAHfqBn7a3\n=upX+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T12:56:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/we