s{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/0b9b658f19ffa162a144cb79edf5f7c49e00b2a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:51:47Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:51:47Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Add a smoke-suite category alongside sanity and regression, all 8 modules\n\ntests/smoke/<module>/ is the fastest, smallest per-module check --\none happy-path test per CRM regression spec file, and each other\nmodule''s existing module-loads placeholder for now. Wired up as its\nown smoke-<module> Playwright project (reusing the shared <module>-setup\nauth project, same as sanity), with matching npm scripts, CODEOWNERS\nrows, and docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58cb49d9620f80021d1313aaee0e78bf235a311a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/58cb49d9620f80021d1313aaee0e78bf235a311a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/0b9b658f19ffa162a144cb79edf5f7c49e00b2a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_a