shnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/a5a1014b832993fb77773a6a173f3275986fe6a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T15:46:37Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T15:46:37Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Fix silent sign-in gate timeout in gotoAuthenticated(), cap dev workers at 2\n\nUnder worker contention, the sign-in gate could take >15s to render.\ngotoAuthenticated() swallowed that timeout and assumed \"already signed\nin,\" skipping the click and leaving the page stuck pre-auth — later\nlocators (e.g. \"Create Customer\") then failed with a confusing timeout\nfar from the real cause. Now it waits 60s and fails loudly if the gate\nnever appears. Also caps dev to 2 workers (matching CI) to reduce the\nconcurrent load that triggered this, and reverts the dev test timeout\n90s -> 60s now that the actual bug, not headroom, was the problem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tre