"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/105705eeac2d3edfcd7e116320eb2ed8f4b139fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:04:45Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:04:45Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Number CRM spec files to guarantee a fixed run order\n\nRename the 12 CRM spec files with numeric prefixes (01-create-customer\nthrough 12-contact-creation-screen) in the sequence requested: Create\nCustomer -> Customer Creation Screen -> Customer List -> Customer\nDetail -> Activate/Deactivate Customer (+screen variants) -> Contact\nList -> Edit Customer/Contact -> Create Contact -> Contact Creation\nScreen. crm.spec.ts is left unnumbered — it sorts after all of them\n(digits precede letters) and always runs last.\n\nBy default, multiple parallel workers mean file start order isn''t\nguaranteed. Add test:crm:ordered / test:crm:ordered:dev npm scripts\n(--workers=1) so this exact sequence actually holds at runtime, not\njust alphabetically. Verified directly: a single-worker run executed\nthe files in precisely this order, 01 through 12.\n\nThis trades speed for determinism — --workers=1 runs the whole suite\nsingle-threaded, so it''s meant for cases where the order itself\nmatters (e.g. an end-to-end demo run), not everyday development, which\nshould keep using the parallel test:crm / test:crm:dev scripts.\n\nUpdated every \"Automated in\" link across test-cases/crm/*.md and the\nAllure section of README.md to the new filenames, and documented the\nconvention in README.md''s \"Running tests\" section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"897ba9a247f7f7208fc283e6c893a69625e85955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/897ba9a247f7f7208fc283e6c893a69625e85955"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/105705eeac2d3edfcd7e116320eb2ed8f4b139fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/105705eeac2d3edfcd7e116320eb2ed8f4b139fe","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKDEwNTcwNWVlYWMyZDNlZGZjZDdlMTE2MzIwZWIyZWQ4ZjRiMTM5ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/440f9ef29a8c2e4b213f6a536480d7f721ad1269","sha":"440f9ef29a8c2e4b213f6a536480d7f721ad1269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/440f9ef29a8c2e4b213f6a536480d7f721ad1269"}],"sha":"105705eeac2d3edfcd7e116320eb2ed8f4b139fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/105705eeac2d3edfcd7e116320eb2ed8f4b139fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/440f9ef29a8c2e4b213f6a536480d7f721ad1269/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:21:22Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:21:22Z","email":"sathish