":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:17:17Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Document the locators/pages split in README and ONBOARDING\n\nBoth docs still described the old single-file Page Object shape from\nbefore the restructure — update the Structure diagram, module\nisolation list, and the \"add your own test cases\"/\"onboarding a new\nmodule''s QA\" walkthroughs to point at the src/locators/<module>/ +\nsrc/pages/<module>/ pair, with the CRM Create Customer files called\nout as the reference example throughout.\n\nAlso fixes report:allure:open, which pointed at allure-results/ (raw\nresults) instead of allure-report/ (the generated static site) —\nfound while touching the reporting section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d95cb46d53fdb92a7a050469aeed267508f0b0ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/d95cb46d53fdb92a7a050469aeed267508f0b0ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/d60f65ceb7a19cb201b62b7c53a4365228571997","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/d60f65ceb7a19cb201b62b7c53a4365228571997","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKGQ2MGY2NWNlYjdhMTljYjIwMWI2MmI3YzUzYTQzNjUyMjg1NzE5OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/0f814a9858763daa28f8dabd03dac442180044f8","sha":"0f814a9858763daa28f8dabd03dac442180044f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/0f814a9858763daa28f8dabd03dac442180044f8"}],"sha":"d60f65ceb7a19cb201b62b7c53a4365228571997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/d60f65ceb7a19cb201b62b7c53a4365228571997"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/0f814a9858763daa28f8dabd03dac442180044f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:15:15Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:15:15Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Automate the Contact Detail screen (customer-detail.md)\n\nAdd ContactDetailLocators/ContactDetailPage and customer-detail.spec.ts\n— the last of the 11 documented CRM test-case sets, previously\n\"Pending\". Confirmed against dev on 2026-09-16 by creating a real\nCustomer, then a real Contact linked to it via the hand-off route (the\nContact List itself is still zero-seeded).\n\nTwo ClickUp inaccuracies found and documented rather than assumed away:\nTC:3''s \"Contact ID\" locked field doesn''t exist anywhere on the real\nscreen, and TC:6''s Audit/History section doesn''t exist at all (actively\nsearched for, not just unconfirmed) — TC:6 is test.fixme()''d rather\nthan skipped.\n\nAlso confirmed this screen''s inline-edit controls are uniquely named\nper field (\"Edit Designation\", \"Save Email\", \"Cancel editing Phone\",\netc.), unlike CustomerDetailPage''s generic \"Edit\"/\"Save\"/\"Cancel\" —\nContactDetailLocators'' fieldContainer()/editButton()/saveButton()/\ncancelButton() take the field label as a parameter to match.\n\n6 of 7 tests pass against dev; the 7th is the documented test.fixme().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29631dbd623f7716f4d66c01f06f9fced3bee71b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/29631dbd623f7716f4d66c01f06f9fced3bee71b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/0f814a9858763daa28f8dabd03dac442180044f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/0f814a9858763daa28f8dabd03dac442180044f8","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKDBmODE0YTk4NTg3NjNkYWEyOGY4ZGFiZDAzZGFjNDQyMTgwMDQ0Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/34fcd7a741b55e465a1a7ed01654a31a6986cefc","sha":"34fcd7a741b55e465a1a7ed01654a31a6986cefc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/34fcd7a741b55e465a1a7ed01654a31a6986cefc"}],"sha":"0f814a9858763daa28f8dabd03dac442180044f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/0f814a9858763daa28f8dabd03dac442180044f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/34fcd7a741b55e465a1a7ed01654a31a6986cefc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:14:57Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:14:57Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Split page objects into locators + methods layers\n\nRestructure every page object into a three-layer POM: a `<Page>Locators`\nclass holding only raw element references (in src/locators/<module>/),\na `<Page>` class holding flows/actions/assertions built on top of them\n(this.locators.x), and spec files that call page methods rather than\nreaching into locators directly.\n\nRule applied throughout: a fixed named element or a parameterized\n\"find me the element matching this argument\" lookup (e.g.\ncolumnHeader(name), fieldContainer(label)) lives in the Locators class,\nsince both just locate. Anything that actually clicks/fills/waits\n(selectComboboxOption, linkToCustomer) stays in the Page class, since\nit''s a flow, not a pure locator.\n\nApplied to all 5 existing CRM page objects, shell-login, and the 7\nplaceholder module stubs (admin/copilot/costing/master-data/mill/\nplanning/techpack) so the template itself teaches the new convention\nto whichever QA picks up each module next. Updated every spec file''s\ndirect locator access (e.g. createCustomerPage.saveButton) to go\nthrough .locators (createCustomerPage.locators.saveButton).\n\nVerified no behavioral regression: re-ran the full CRM suite against\nlocal and dev — the only local failures trace to the pre-existing\nCountry-reference-data gap documented since early in this project, not\nto anything touched here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"261c4810200182a0a9a61b610070c45a42b8f23b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/261c4810200182a0a9a61b610070c45a42b8f23b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/34fcd7a741b55e465a1a7ed01654a31a6986cefc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/34fcd7a741b55e465a1a7ed01654a31a6986cefc","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKDM0ZmNkN2E3NDFiNTVlNDY1YTFhN2VkMDE2NTRhMzFhNjk4NmNlZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/1ecce22777b6f6fd4fcb88c304c7c2f7d253f79e","sha":"1ecce22777b6f6fd4fcb88c304c7c2f7d253f79e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/1ecce22777b6f6fd4fcb88c304c7c2f7d253f79e"}],"sha":"34fcd7a741b55e465a1a7ed01654a31a6986cefc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/34fcd7a741b55e465a1a7ed01654a31a6986cefc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/1ecce22777b6f6fd4fcb88c304c7c2f7d253f79e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:56:17Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:56:17Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Verify Create/Customer Creation Screen specs against dev, fix real bugs found\n\nThe 4 spec files built earlier from local-only probing (create-contact,\ncontact-creation-screen, customer-creation-screen, customer-list) had\nnever actually been run through the Playwright test runner — only\ntypechecked. Running them against dev (now reachable) surfaced several\nreal issues, all fixed:\n\n- Contact Name is validated \"Alphabets only\" on dev — test data using\n  `Date.now()`-suffixed names for uniqueness was rejected. Switched to\n  fixed names, varying email instead (Customer Name has no such rule).\n- The Customer Name linkage popup in Create Contact isn''t a search\n  combobox at all — it''s a plain paginated listbox with no text input,\n  unlike every other combobox in the app. Rewrote linkToCustomer() to\n  paginate via \"Load 15 more\" and click the option directly.\n- Typing a not-yet-existing Customer name and saving does NOT show the\n  \"create this Customer now?\" prompt ClickUp describes — the Contact\n  silently saves as Unlinked instead. Documented as a spec-vs-app\n  mismatch (test.fixme) rather than forced to a false assertion.\n- A duplicate Contact email is a BLOCKING inline error on dev (\"already\n  used by ... Enter a different email address\"), not the non-blocking\n  modal-with-\"Save anyway\" pattern Customers use. Fixed TC:9 to create\n  a real duplicate and assert the actual behavior.\n- The Customer→Contact and Contact→Customer hand-off routes validate\n  their id query params against real records on dev (a fabricated id\n  was silently ignored, unlike local) — fixed the three affected tests\n  to create a real Customer/Contact first and use its real id.\n- The locked-linkage helper text is \"Customer is fixed by where this\n  form was opened from and cannot be changed.\" — a second sentence seen\n  during local probing didn''t appear on dev, likely hover-only.\n- \"Acme Textiles\" turned out to already be a real seeded Customer/\n  Customer name on dev, so several placeholder-labeled TODOs in\n  create-customer.spec.ts and customer-list.spec.ts were resolved by\n  just removing the stale comment.\n- customer-creation-screen.spec.ts''s TC:6 (Customer Code immutability)\n  and customer-list.spec.ts/create-customer.spec.ts''s TC:10 (linking an\n  existing Contact) were fully unblocked using the newly-available\n  CustomerDetailPage and a real Contact created inline.\n\n65 of 65 runnable tests across every file touched this session now\npass against dev; 13 remain documented test.fixme()''s for reasons\nconfirmed by direct investigation, not silent gaps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bf4d2366a6d46f48620026608257f6f8027d49c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/3bf4d2366a6d46f48620026608257f6f8027d49c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/1ecce22777b6f6fd4fcb88c304c7c2f7d253f79e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/1ecce22777b6f6fd4fcb88c304c7c2f7d253f79e","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKDFlY2NlMjI3NzdiNmY2ZmQ0ZmNiODhjMzA0YzdjMmY3ZDI1M2Y3OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/6d2c0fd9e06273ee0a8fd94258a0c31b5591f966","sha":"6d2c0fd9e06273ee0a8fd94258a0c31b5591f966","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/6d2c0fd9e06273ee0a8fd94258a0c31b5591f966"}],"sha":"1ecce22777b6f6fd4fcb88c304c7c2f7d253f79e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/1ecce22777b6f6fd4fcb88c304c7c2f7d253f79e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/6d2c0fd9e06273ee0a8fd94258a0c31b5591f966/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:55:58Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:55:58Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Automate Activate/Deactivate Customer and Customer/Contact editing\n\nAdd CustomerDetailPage covering the Customer Details screen shared by\nactivate-customer(.md/-screen.md), deactivate-customer(.md/-screen.md),\nand edit-customer-contact.md — all confirmed against a real save on\ndev now that VPN access restored it (local remains blocked: Country\nhas no selectable options there, so no Customer can ever be saved).\n\nConfirmed the real Activation/Deactivation reason lists, the shared\ntwo-step reason-capture -> confirmation dialog shape, per-field inline\nediting (always-visible \"Edit\" buttons swapping to textbox+Save/Cancel),\nand Business Process/Assignee section editing.\n\nFound and fixed two real locator bugs caught only by running against\ndev: \"Activate\" is a case-insensitive substring of \"Deactivate\", so\nboth buttons need exact:true; and the Assignees combobox''s picker\nstays open after selecting (multi-select-capable, unlike Department''s),\nwhich was corrupting later interactions until explicitly closed.\n\nedit-customer-contact.spec.ts TC:6 (clear a department row to 0\nassignees) is left test.fixme() after extensive live investigation\nfound the app''s own save behavior inconsistent — sometimes blocks\ncorrectly, sometimes silently keeps the old assignee, in both headed\nand headless runs, with no test-side timing fix that made it\ndeterministic. Documented as a likely real app defect rather than\nforced to a false pass. TC:6/TC:7 (Master Data/Tech Pack cascade) in\nboth Activate and Deactivate spec files are similarly test.fixme()''d —\nActivate''s are marked fail in ClickUp already, Deactivate''s are simply\nout of scope for the CRM QA''s module ownership.\n\n29 of 36 tests across the five new spec files pass against dev; the\nremaining 7 are documented test.fixme()''s, not silent gaps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"855e87a7c73db4622722a1b9260d09d67595ca70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/855e87a7c73db4622722a1b9260d09d67595ca70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/6d2c0fd9e06273ee0a8fd94258a0c31b5591f966","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/6d2c0fd9e06273ee0a8fd94258a0c31b5591f966","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKDZkMmMwZmQ5ZTA2MjczZWUwYThmZDk0MjU4YTBjMzFiNTU5MWY5NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/b69a69c01d1de9e0ff8995ff78036594d51e8eff","sha":"b69a69c01d1de9e0ff8995ff78036594d51e8eff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/b69a69c01d1de9e0ff8995ff78036594d51e8eff"}],"sha":"6d2c0fd9e06273ee0a8fd94258a0c31b5591f966","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/6d2c0fd9e06273ee0a8fd94258a0c31b5591f966"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/b69a69c01d1de9e0ff8995ff78036594d51e8eff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:27:46Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:27:46Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Automate Create Contact, Contact Creation Screen, Customer Creation Screen, Customer List\n\nAdd CreateContactPage and two specs for the Create Contact story\n(create-contact.spec.ts, contact-creation-screen.spec.ts). Route,\nrequired-field set, format-validation error text, and the hand-off\npre-fill/lock behavior in both directions (Customer<->Contact) are\nconfirmed against a real local `tilt up` run. Everything past that\n(linking to an existing Customer, the new-Customer-name prompt chain,\nduplicate warnings, audit trail) is blocked locally by two data gaps:\nCountry has no options (\"No countries available\"/\"Country list\nunavailable\") and the Customer-linkage popup never resolves past\n\"Loading customers…\" — both written with TODOs against the ClickUp\ntext rather than skipped, so they only need re-running once an\nenvironment has the data.\n\nAlso add customer-creation-screen.spec.ts and customer-list.spec.ts,\nper an explicit decision to build every documented test-case set as\nits own spec file rather than folding or skipping near-duplicates of\ncreate-customer.spec.ts. customer-creation-screen.spec.ts''s 3 new\ncases (hand-off pre-fill, conditional Referred-By validation) are\nconfirmed; the rest mirror create-customer.spec.ts''s existing\npatterns. customer-list.spec.ts mirrors that file''s TC:3-11 bodies\nexactly, each pointed at customer-list.md''s own ClickUp subtasks\n(fetched directly, not assumed) despite the content being identical.\n\nActivate/Deactivate Customer and Customer/Contact Detail editing\nstill need a real saved Customer to reach their screens at all —\nblocked on the same Country gap locally, and dev is currently\nunreachable (VPN down) — so those four spec files aren''t started yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd205aded6e457278f75a108a695c885e5d3fa66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/bd205aded6e457278f75a108a695c885e5d3fa66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/b69a69c01d1de9e0ff8995ff78036594d51e8eff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/b69a69c01d1de9e0ff8995ff78036594d51e8eff","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKGI2OWE2OWMwMWQxZGU5ZTBmZjg5OTVmZjc4MDM2NTk0ZDUxZThlZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/cced1658c42e2846aa741ea2a828c6d3a40e4123","sha":"cced1658c42e2846aa741ea2a828c6d3a40e4123","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/cced1658c42e2846aa741ea2a828c6d3a40e4123"}],"sha":"b69a69c01d1de9e0ff8995ff78036594d51e8eff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/b69a69c01d1de9e0ff8995ff78036594d51e8eff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/cced1658c42e2846aa741ea2a828c6d3a40e4123/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:52:48Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:52:48Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Document remaining 10 CRM test-case sets with real ClickUp content\n\nReplace collapsed placeholder rows with full steps/expected-results for\nActivate/Deactivate Customer (+screen variants), Create Contact (+screen\nvariant), Customer/Contact Detail, and Edit Customer/Contact. Flags two\nClickUp mislabelings (customer-detail.md is actually Contact-side content)\nand confirms customer-creation-screen.md/customer-list.md overlap with the\nalready-automated create-customer.spec.ts, with an itemized breakdown of\nwhich subtasks are genuinely new vs already covered.\n\nNo page objects or spec files yet — documentation-only checkpoint before\nlive-probing the app for the four remaining new screens.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b320cff36877b1b2311782f2831cfed4b5aefc9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/b320cff36877b1b2311782f2831cfed4b5aefc9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/cced1658c42e2846aa741ea2a828c6d3a40e4123","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/cced1658c42e2846aa741ea2a828c6d3a40e4123","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKGNjZWQxNjU4YzQyZTI4NDZhYTc0MWVhMmE4MjhjNmQzYTQwZTQxMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/47e43e0dff38b657a805328200b3a50c3289d0ac","sha":"47e43e0dff38b657a805328200b3a50c3289d0ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/47e43e0dff38b657a805328200b3a50c3289d0ac"}],"sha":"cced1658c42e2846aa741ea2a828c6d3a40e4123","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/cced1658c42e2846aa741ea2a828c6d3a40e4123"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/47e43e0dff38b657a805328200b3a50c3289d0ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:22:23Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:22:23Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Automate CRM Contact List (TC:1-12); add 10 pending test-case docs\n\nContact List (test-cases/crm/contact-list.md) was the one fully-detailed\nnew test-case set -- automated all 12 cases in tests/crm/contact-list.spec.ts\nagainst a new ContactListPage, confirmed against the real running screen\n(route /crm/contacts).\n\nResult: 10 passed, 2 failed, 1 skipped.\n- TC:9, TC:10 fail on a real, documented blocker: both local and dev\n  currently have zero contacts, so row-click and linked-Customer\n  navigation have nothing to click. Same as TC:2/TC:3 (search), written\n  best-effort against the real DOM but unverified against actual results.\n- TC:11 (inline editing) is skipped -- needs a Contact Details page\n  object, which doesn''t exist yet.\n- Two things confirmed non-obvious along the way: the layout switcher''s\n  real labels are \"No split\"/\"Vertical split\"/\"Horizontal split\" (not\n  \"Table/Split/Stacked\" per the loose ClickUp wording), and the sort\n  column has no aria-sort attribute at all (TC:6 verifies the control is\n  clickable, not actual sort-order persistence).\n\nAlso added the other 10 test-case docs (activate/deactivate Customer x2\neach, edit customer/contact, create contact, contact/customer creation\nscreens, customer detail, customer list) -- these are still collapsed\nClickUp placeholders pending subtask expansion, not yet automated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c10311f7a6af94a8bf9217f13f6f324a6253346a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-