OS-Test-Automation/commits/47e43e0dff38b657a805328200b3a50c3289d0ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/e87c32e46dbd1d26b7232e2dabc3930e14b57c2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:59:10Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:59:10Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Fix TC:7/8/9: post-save confirmation modal is role=alertdialog, not dialog\n\nConfirmed on dev: the ''Customer ... was created successfully!'' modal\n(and, defensively, the duplicate-warning modal — same UI toolkit,\nunconfirmed but likely the same pattern) render as role=alertdialog.\ngetByRole(''dialog'') alone never matched them, even though the text/button\ncontent expectations were correct all along. Both locators now 