 in a\nBusiness Process row are comboboxes (same selectComboboxOption()\npattern as Country/CRM Stage/etc) — the previous .fill() call resolved\nto the row''s ''Remove department'' button instead (its aria-label also\nmatched the loose /department/i regex) and could never work.\n\nAlso swapped the test''s department name from the fictional ''Sourcing''\nto ''Cutting'' — a real option confirmed in dev''s Department dropdown\n(along with Cleaning 2, Sewing, Quality, Finishing & Packing, etc.;\nSourcing isn''t one of them).\n\nTC:4 now passes end-to-end against dev.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9224b02abf3c566c0381152a5535d3fee5103aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/9224b02abf3c566c0381152a5535d3fee5103aa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/966d99209a649af90e61a984fcdff051dd73a210","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/966d99209a649af90e61a984fcdff051dd73a210","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKDk2NmQ5OTIwOWE2NDlhZjkwZTYxYTk4NGZjZGZmMDUxZGQ3M2EyMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/0937edc6c9190b102512eb7f3b1b0c6581f73bd8","sha":"0937edc6c9190b102512eb7f3b1b0c6581f73bd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/0937edc6c9190b102512eb7f3b1b0c6581f73bd8"}],"sha":"966d99209a649af90e61a984fcdff051dd73a210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/966d99209a649af90e61a984fcdff051dd73a210"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/0937edc6c9190b102512eb7f3b1b0c6581f73bd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:06:24Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:06:24Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Add Origin/Buyer/Referred By handling; fix CRM Stage combobox selection\n\nPer direct observation of the running app: Country/CRM Stage/Origin\nType/Origin/Buyer now have real seed data (previous ''nothing seeded''\nfinding is stale). Two changes:\n\n- selectComboboxOption() previously assumed every combobox''s popup is a\n  search-combobox inside a dialog (confirmed true for Country only) —\n  CRM Stage opens a plain dropdown that doesn''t match that shape and\n  silently failed to select. Now tries both via Locator.or().\n- fillProfile()/CustomerProfileDetails gains a referredBy field (only\n  rendered once Origin Type is ''Referral'', per the user story''s\n  conditional-field acceptance criteria) and TC:4-10 now pass\n  origin/buyer/referredBy, since Origin and Buyer are mandatory fields\n  that were previously never set.\n\nValues (Internal Referral / Fabric / Jordan Smith) match what was\nobserved directly in the running app — flag in test-cases doc to\nre-verify if your seed data differs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"869efa4b30b45cab14d5cdbf63ad14b769526d12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/869efa4b30b45cab14d5cdbf63ad14b769526d12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/0937edc6c9190b102512eb7f3b1b0c6581f73bd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/0937edc6c9190b102512eb7f3b1b0c6581f73bd8","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKDA5MzdlZGM2YzkxOTBiMTAyNTEyZWI3ZjNiMWIwYzY1ODFmNzNiZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/b727e6772482b39762637ba5d9419c39ef954ab4","sha":"b727e6772482b39762637ba5d9419c39ef954ab4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/b727e6772482b39762637ba5d9419c39ef954ab4"}],"sha":"0937edc6c9190b102512eb7f3b1b0c6581f73bd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/0937edc6c9190b102512eb7f3b1b0c6581f73bd8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commits/b727e6772482b39762637ba5d9419c39ef954ab4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T15:48:39Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T15:48:39Z","email":"sathish.nagarajan@sai-tex.com","name":"Sathish Nagarajan"},"message":"Fix two dev-environment timing issues found by running CRM against real dev\n\nBoth confirmed by repeated headed runs against dev.flooros.app over VPN,\nisolated from parallelism (failed identically with --workers=1):\n\n- base.page.ts: gotoAuthenticated()''s pre-auth-gate detection window was\n  5s, tuned against local''s near-instant response. Too tight for a real\n  remote server; the gate could still be there but go undetected,\n  silently skipping the SSO-reuse click. Widened to 15s.\n- playwright.config.ts: the global 30s test timeout doesn''t give dev''s\n  federated module bundles (e.g. the CRM remote) enough time to load\n  over a real network — ''Loading CRM…'' alone could outlast 30s, every\n  run, with zero contention. Dev now gets 60s; local stays at 30s for\n  fast feedback.\n\nVerified: CRM''s create-customer.spec.ts now passes identically on dev\nand local (5/12 — TC:1/2/3/11 + setup — with the same known missing\nreference-data gap blocking TC:4-10 on both).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56567ed6cd71ea2fccc23cc2068e970ec245a702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/trees/56567ed6cd71ea2fccc23cc2068e970ec245a702"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/git/commits/b727e6772482b39762637ba5d9419c39ef954ab4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321365753?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sathishnagarajanQAlead","id":321365753,"login":"sathishnagarajanQAlead","node_id":"U_kgDOEyem-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sathishnagarajanQAlead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/b727e6772482b39762637ba5d9419c39ef954ab4","node_id":"C_kwDOUUduBdoAKGI3MjdlNjc3MjQ4MmIzOTc2MjYzN2JhNWQ5NDE5YzM5ZWY5NTRhYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saitex-ai/Floor-OS-Test-Automation/commit/5afdc88c38b6dddb52caa0142286275b512ce76e","sha":"5afdc88c38b6dddb52