 all laptops)\n- Add ShopsTab component (vendor shop directory)\n- Update App.jsx routing\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add docs/README.md as documentation index\n- Add docs/TESTING.md with test documentation\n- Add docs/EVALUATION.md with AI evaluation results\n- Add docs/FAQ.md with common questions\n- Update docs/DEMO.md with viva demo script\n- Update docs/thesis-chapter4-17-19.md\n\nThesis Chapters:\n- Add chapter1-introduction.md\n- Add chapter2-literature-review.md\n- Add chapter3-system-design.md\n- Add chapter4-implementation.md\n- Add chapter5-testing-results.md\n- Add chapter6-conclusion.md\n- Add references.md, figures.md, tables.md, appendices.md\n\nScreenshots for Thesis:\n- Add 22 screenshots covering all pages and features\n- Add figure-4-19-docker-ps.txt, figure-4-22-health-check.txt, figure-4-22-integration-tests.txt\n\nScripts:\n- Update scripts/health.sh with more verbose output\n- Update scripts/reset.sh with safer cleanup\n- Update scripts/ensure-schema.sh with vendor backfill\n- Add scripts/screenshot-helper.sh for guided capture\n\nResults:\n- Update results/summary.md with final metrics\n- Update results/k6-summary.md\n- Update results/zap/zap-summary.md\n\nDocs:\n- Update README.md with quick start\n- Update CONTRIBUTING.md with current conventions\n- Update CHANGELOG.md","tree":{"sha":"2a6799960cfd26984c2e7f0b2f385f7157a9f028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m0hammad-ali/FYPLaptopMarketplace/git/trees/2a6799960cfd26984c2e7f0b2f385f7157a9f028"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m0hammad-ali/FYPLaptopMarketplace/git/commits/e8ba5a293a48ba4faecec0de6703cc6ae089c265","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133556679?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m0hammad-ali/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m0hammad-ali/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m0hammad