date":"2026-09-23T04:19:58Z","email":"muhammad098ali.1@gmail.com","name":"m0hammad-ali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:19:58Z","email":"muhammad098ali.1@gmail.com","name":"m0hammad-ali"},"message":"feat(ui,fix): migrate to Tailwind CSS 3.4 + Lucide and fix auth loop\n\nUI Migration (5 frontends):\n- Install Tailwind CSS 3.4, PostCSS, autoprefixer, tailwindcss-animate\n- Convert postcss.config.js to postcss.config.cjs (CommonJS for Node)\n- Add tailwind.config.js with Shadcn design tokens\n- Redesign home page: sticky header, deep footer, hero, features, map\n- Redesign customer app: 3-mode UI (Easy, Simple, Pro) with Tailwind\n- Redesign vendor dashboard: tabs, cards, and modern table\n- Redesign admin panel: dark header, stat cards, verify table\n- Add Lucide icons across all apps\n\nAuth Flow Fix:\n- Remove auto-redirect from auth app (was causing loop with customer)\n- Add session banner with Continue / Switch Account options\n- Add token expiration check in ProtectedRoute of all 3 apps\n- Clear all auth keys on 401 in every axios interceptor\n\nAuth Service Fix:\n- Simplify Dockerfile: install deps at build time\n- Add /app/node_modules anonymous volume (was missing - masked image deps)\n- Add AUTH_RATE_LIMIT env var (500 for dev, 20 for prod)\n- Add healthcheck integration\n\nDocker Compose:\n- Fix auth-service volume mounts\n- Add healthcheck for auth-service\n- Add restart: unless-stopped for reliability\n\nScripts:\n- Add scripts/health.sh for one-command health verification\n- Add scripts/ensure-schema.sh for schema sync\n- Add scripts/reset.sh for clean restart\n\nDocs:\n- Add docs/ folder (API, Architecture, Deployment, Thesis chapters)\n- Add results/zap/zap-summary.md from OWASP ZAP scan\n- Add database/init/01-init.sql for PostgreSQL initialization","tree":{"sha":"39c577a35c1973bd4163e4241b171103e21dce9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m0hammad-ali/FYPLaptopMarketplace/git/trees/39c577a35c1973bd4163e4241b171103e21dce9f"},"ur