_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/a09afed5195cb1ac6f3e7e40d530b95b2e565d1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:23:31Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:23:31Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"message":"feat(chase-rs): 0.1.5 无缺口条目复用 5 小时缓存 + 移除未获批准的 POST 探测变体\n\n- 整点 job 复用上一轮「已核实无缺口」的行(5 小时窗口, 零 host.call): 无缺口条目\n  占订阅池大多数, 此前每小时全量重探, 把压在 Emby 上的覆盖查询压下一个数量级;\n  复用行的 at 保留真实核实时刻, 窗口过期后照旧重探(不许把 TTL 刷成永不过期)\n- 复用守卫: 订阅总数变化 / 目标未知 / 覆盖未知(emby_have_max = -1, 含「该季 0 集」)\n  / 有缺口(Emby 已有或 TMDB 目标超过订阅总数) / 补订或失败过的行, 一律不复用\n- 移除 emby/episodes 的 V4(POST JSON body)探测变体: 宿主安装期权限闸门只批\n  manifest 声明的 API, 官方目录里该端点只有 GET, POST 每次都被\n  \"host API was not approved at installation\" 挡下(2026-10-07 08:00 轮实测白烧 18 次);\n  旧状态里缓存的 v=4 指纹按「没指纹」处理, 从矩阵头重试\n- 回归: cargo test 230 项全绿(新增端到端复用/窗口过期重探 + 纯函数守卫两条)","tree":{"sha":"e93d01eeb45c1f8d53f42b4061236160b8f564b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/e93d01eeb45c1f8d53f42b4061236160b8f564b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/a09afed5195cb1ac6f3e7e40d530b95b2e565d1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","grav