SIGKILL, 收尾未执行 -> 任务卡死/(N) 残留堆积/循环 OOM):\n- 任务存储分片: tasks.idx 紧凑索引(UI 唯一数据源) + task:<id> 完整记录,\n  仅推进该任务时加载; 旧 tasks 数组幂等迁移\n- 单曲推进: 每轮最多新开 1 首(取链阶梯结束即释放)、收尾 1 个;\n  单任务独立作用域, 峰值内存与队列长度解耦\n- statics 全部字节上界化(DIAG 截断), 内存审计成文\n- 新 action pump + 任务卡「推进队列」按钮手动快进\n- 修复: 失败通知去掉 callback_data 按钮(通知 schema 只认 {text,url}, 真机 400);\n  clear_finished 孤儿分片; download 入队 O(队列) 扫描\n复查 5 项(确认 4 项已修), 门禁: cargo test+wasm / build-ui / build.mjs 全过","tree":{"sha":"db1cda8e165ebd32d3dbf4c3ddbf260e5480020c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/db1cda8e165ebd32d3dbf4c3ddbf260e5480020c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/c3dadabaf7924d7927908c88338e750737ffbca5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/c3dadabaf7924d7927908c88338e750737ffbca5","node_id":"C_kwDOUUiak9oAKGMzZGFkYWJhZjc5MjRkNzkyNzkwOGM4ODMzOGU3NTA3MzdmZmJjYTU",