026-10-02T05:02:04Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"message":"feat(chase-rs): 0.1.3 识别宿主 emby/episodes 的区间串契约——补订链路打通\n\n真实宿主实测响应(0.1.2 探测快照捕获):\n  {\"complete\":true,\"covered_episodes\":\"1-24\",\"needed_episodes\":\"\",...}\n契约是区间串不是数组——v0.1.2 之前所有候选都在找数组, 全部 40 条 unparsed。\n\n- 新增区间解析: \"\"/\"5\"/\"1-24\"/\"1,3,5-7\"(含膨胀上限防畸形), covered_episodes\n  → have 集, needed_episodes → 缺集; 数组/单值形态也宽容接收\n- parse_coverage 区间契约优先, 数组路径保留兜底\n- 实测响应原样钉为测试夹具; 畸形区间(1-2-3/5-1/x)整体拒绝\n- 214 测试全绿","tree":{"sha":"c624a26ec8caa428d8024f4c35c8c2f32ebf36b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/c624a26ec8caa428d8024f4c35c8c2f32ebf36b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/a7499b0cce9ae0a3db5ee2bd29b4b6df4f645cd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/a7499b0cce9ae0a3db5ee2bd29b4b6df4f64