ubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/b0fd08aa098f6ce57f1294a00dd86a5dc2385a5d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/4fff2c4e4f6d46af790d0c9244733c15f273e070/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:00:55Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:00:55Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"message":"fix(chase-rs): 订阅缺字段不再填默认值 + align-now 缓存按(剧,季)命中\n\n两条低危问题:\n\n1) intents::parse_intent 把缺失的 season / media_type 当默认值收下\n   (season=0 / media_type=\"tv\"), 于是 season=0 会去查特别篇、电影也可能被当成\n   追剧条目参与对齐, 默认值还被原样写进统计与界面。两者在 PoolIntent\n   (openapi-v1.yaml:6548-6557)里都是必填字段, 现在与 id/tmdb_id/\n   total_episodes_known 一样: 缺了(或空串)就跳过该条, 并在整点对齐里留一条\n   \"字段不完整, 已跳过\"的告警, 不再静默吞掉。\n\n2) align-now 的 6 小时缓存只按 intent_id 建索引, 且 Evidence::from_cache 把\n   target_upper 固定为 0: 订阅在窗口内改过 tmdb_id/season 后, 会拿上一季的\n   have_max 直接判定并 PATCH 且不再探测。缓存改为按 (intent_id, tmdb_id,\n   season) 命中, 并把该行记录的目标集数(AlignItem 新增 target_upper)一并复用 ——\n   同一季在 align-now 与整点对齐下给出相同目标。\n\n回归测试: 新增/改写 parse_intent 与 align-now 的用例, 并用回退实验确认它们确实\n能抓到旧行为(旧键会 PATCH 12 而非 4; 旧默认会把缺 season 的条目收下)。","tree":{"sha":"b73ef9b29bedbaf65deb43fd505f2cc5f7882bf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/b73ef9b29bedbaf65deb43fd505f2cc5f7882bf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/4fff2c4e4f6d46af790d0c9244733c15f273e070","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/4fff2c4e4f6d46af790d0c9244733c15f273e070","node_id":"C_kwDOUUiak9oAKDRmZmYyYzRlNGY2ZDQ2YWY3OTBkMGM5MjQ0NzMzYzE1ZjI3M2UwNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/93de9579608c58d3cc85a7bef0aaac036225429b","sha":"93de9579608c58d3cc85a7bef0aaac036225429b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits