ot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/1e88982397862f144f8313f1e5063919168d89ce","node_id":"C_kwDOUUiak9oAKDFlODg5ODIzOTc4NjJmMTQ0ZjgzMTNmMWU1MDYzOTE5MTY4ZDg5Y2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/d575584e2172e3f0a29b1340152be1ea08ffd8d9","sha":"d575584e2172e3f0a29b1340152be1ea08ffd8d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/d575584e2172e3f0a29b1340152be1ea08ffd8d9"}],"sha":"1e88982397862f144f8313f1e5063919168d89ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/1e88982397862f144f8313f1e5063919168d89ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/d575584e2172e3f0a29b1340152be1ea08ffd8d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T05:30:21Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T05:30:29Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"message":"feat(douban-rs): 0.2.0 第一批功能移植——回退匹配/订阅过滤器/已删除不重订\n\n对标 douban115 插件功能集, 三项移植(工作流两路并行完成, 258 测试全过):\n\n1. TMDB 匹配增强: 标题失配时取 rexxar 条目详情的 original_title/aka\n   逐候选回退重试(原名→又名), 仍失配才 needs_review; 回退命中记日志。\n2. 订阅过滤器: Settings 新增 min_rating/min_year/regions(0/空=不限),\n   can_subscribe 统一判定接入全部自动订阅路径(chart 到期/wish/手动),\n   被滤条目标 state=filtered; 无评分条目在设评分线时按不过处理;\n   wish 条目补提取 subject.rating。\n3. 已删除不重订: no_resub 墓碑集独立持久化(不再依赖会被 archive 清空\n   的 history——评审抓到的守卫失效已修: 订阅成功即写独立证据),\n   自动路径永不重订; action no-resub-clear 清除;\n   UI: 设置抽屉新增三项过滤器控件, 想看区显示''已阻止重订 N 条''+清除。\n\n前端(共享)同步更新; state 响应禁用键回归保持通过。","tree":{"sha":"e0fd0de6653b9726d2face6cfa5d8736a6f192cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/e0fd0de6653b9726d2face6cfa5d8736a6f192cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/d575584e2172e3f0a29b1340152be1ea08ffd8d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","u