TFhZGVjZmE1MGE1NTE2MTIyYzAzMmRkYTI1Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/093a5cd98bb20cb3390598ff74d39e07d3e7fe2d","sha":"093a5cd98bb20cb3390598ff74d39e07d3e7fe2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/093a5cd98bb20cb3390598ff74d39e07d3e7fe2d"}],"sha":"8bc9153e3e511adecfa50a5516122c032dda2528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/8bc9153e3e511adecfa50a5516122c032dda2528"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/093a5cd98bb20cb3390598ff74d39e07d3e7fe2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T00:05:34Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T00:05:42Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"message":"fix: 凭据字段不再回显——适配宿主 state 响应禁用 cookie 类 key 的新校验\n\n宿主 2026-09-30 起递归拒绝 runtime 响应中包含 \"cookie\" 的 key(防密钥经\n状态通道外泄, process-runtime-v1.md §4), cookiecloud_url/uuid/key 与\nmanual_cookie 四个字段全中招, state 整体被拒 → 插件页面前端加载失败\n(runtime_protocol_error: runtime response contains forbidden field)。\n\n修法(凭据不回显, 本就是更安全的设计):\n- state 响应 settings 改为脱敏视图: cc_url/cc_uuid 预填, 密钥与手动 cookie\n  只回 cc_key_set/cc_manual_set 布尔; 持久化存储字段原名不变;\n- settings-update 接受 cc_* 字段: cc_key/cc_manual 留空=保持已存值\n  (密钥不再经浏览器往返); 兼容旧字段名;\n- 前端(AppPage.vue, 两插件共享): cc_* 表单, 密钥框已配置时占位\n  ''已配置，留空保持不变'';\n- Rust 新增回归: 整棵 state 树递归断言无 cookie/password/secret/token 类 key\n  (210 测试全过); Go 版同步修复(0.3.15, 未发布);\n- 顺手: douban.rs memory_mb 128→192(实测 RSS 146MB 贴着 128 上限)。","tree":{"sha":"316eae1c03668d6e53ab15416d8733462d180b95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/316eae1c03668d6e53ab15416d8733462d180b95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/093a5cd98bb20cb3390598ff74d39e07d3e7fe2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoub