账号: CookieCloud 双算法解密(aes/cbc/md-5) + 想看同步 + 订阅链路\n- 发布: package/build/market 脚本 + release-douban-rs.yml(rs-v* 触发)\n\n实测(与宿主同款 wazero 解释器):\n  模块 1550KB(Go 4353KB, -64%), 加载 42MB(Go 109MB),\n  state 调用后 52MB(Go 生产峰值 ~240MB, -78%)\nmemory_mb=128(Go 版 512), 插件 id douban.rs(测试身份, 验证后换正式 id)。\n前端直接复用 douban-center 现有产物, 零改动。","tree":{"sha":"e9ec63787440fd261863e2da616b3905969e9d16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/e9ec63787440fd261863e2da616b3905969e9d16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/db4a1a9e07bfcfae65093b0a6228e1fa85c43bf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/db4a1a9e07bfcfae65093b0a6228e1fa85c43bf5","node_id":"C_kwDOUUiak9oAKGRiNGExYTllMDdiZmNmYWU2NTA5M2IwYTYyMjhlMWZhODVjNDNiZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/7e4dcaf87e6f76ed6e90c6e798e7b5