"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/d89fb405cec352630d34547bc35dde1570a3b142/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T05:55:11Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T05:55:20Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"message":"perf(douban-center): 0.3.13 wasm 瘦身 25%——去掉 net/http 依赖树\n\n海报 MIME 判断只用了 http.DetectContentType 两处, 却把整个 net/http\n(连带 mime 等)链进二进制。换成 8 行魔数嗅探 sniffImage(jpeg/png/gif/webp,\n语义兼容: 调用点只判断 image/ 前缀)后:\n\n  wasm 5.79MB -> 4.35MB (-24.9%)\n\n本机 wazero 解释器实测(与宿主同款): 仅实例化 RSS 139MB -> 109MB (-30MB)。\n解释器内存与模块大小成正比, 这是除 memory_mb=512 外压低峰值 RSS 的主要手段。\n数据本身很小(state 67KB 文本 + 海报缓存上限 64 张约 7MB), 291MB 大头是\nGo-on-wasm 解释器的基础设施成本。","tree":{"sha":"f88dfae06867dff2f0aa386bf5731d5d2a234892","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/f88dfae06867dff2f0aa386bf5731d5d2a234892"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/d89fb405cec352630d34547bc35dde1570a3b142","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/f