zhong"},"message":"fix(douban-center): 0.3.11 榜单配置防丢——合并保存 + 缺键自愈 + 空状态禁止保存\n\n事故: worker 被杀期间状态拉取失败, 设置表单为空, 用户点「保存设置」\n送出 lists:{} → 后端整块替换 → 4 个榜单配置被清(normalize 只回填了\nupcoming), 界面上只剩即将上映一个榜。\n\n- settingsUpdate: lists 改为按键合并, 空对象忽略, 不再整块替换;\n- normalizeSettingsLocked: 缺失的榜单键从默认配置(全开)自动补回,\n  已有键的开关/限额等用户配置不受影响;\n- 前端: 状态未加载时点保存直接拦下并提示, 不再发出空表单;\n- 附: 想看功能已全链路跑通(3 部全部订阅成功), 本次为配置防丢收尾。","tree":{"sha":"8846a65e915b36115a53878e87106a8e85095a9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/8846a65e915b36115a53878e87106a8e85095a9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/0065b3536cf0bad270270d93ae2fa667a97a4084","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/0065b3536cf0bad270270d93ae2fa667a97a4084","node_id":"C_kwDOUUiak9oAKDAwNjViMzUzNmNmMGJhZDI3MDI3MGQ5M2FlMmZhNjY3YTk3YTQwODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/