pi.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/b1d0093d803b1537e5f3d20c655ed63e1fd08c59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T03:13:05Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T03:13:33Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"message":"fix(douban-center): 0.3.9 设置抽屉空状态防崩——修复打开设置白屏\n\n浏览器控制台实锤: TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''enabled'')\nat __federation_expose_AppPage-*.js —— 设置抽屉里 settingsForm.lists[key].enabled\n在 lists 为空/缺 key 时崩溃, Vue3 渲染错误直接卸载整棵组件树 = 白屏。\n\n触发链: 宿主 worker 重启/更新窗口里 GET runtime/state 会 502, 插件页拿到\n空 runtimeState, settingsForm.lists 保持初始 {}; 此时点「设置」即崩。\n这也解释了\"更新插件之前也白屏\": 任何一次 state 拉取失败后打开设置就会白。\n\n修复:\n- watch 深合并 lists 并为 5 个榜单定义补默认行(不再整块覆盖);\n- 抽屉改为渲染 settingsListRows 计算行, 状态未加载时显示提示而非崩溃;\n- SSR 红绿验证: 旧代码+空状态复现同款 TypeError, 新代码空/满状态均通过。","tree":{"sha":"71e5e2d273f6415fb7f43666478a091b5510021d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/71e5e2d273f6415fb7f43666478a091b5510021d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/b