arents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/ef71471c9494e0f5ec5b7ce497123bd1970dbcae","sha":"ef71471c9494e0f5ec5b7ce497123bd1970dbcae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/ef71471c9494e0f5ec5b7ce497123bd1970dbcae"}],"sha":"77d07e59d07554a119b7e73050dfde0f91dabb5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/77d07e59d07554a119b7e73050dfde0f91dabb5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/ef71471c9494e0f5ec5b7ce497123bd1970dbcae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T13:33:23Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T13:33:23Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"message":"fix(douban-center): 0.3.7 修复宿主存储信封解析——找回被静默丢弃的配置与历史状态\n\n根因: 宿主 GET /api/plugin-runtime/storage/:key 返回\n{\"data\":{key,value,revision,updated_at},\"meta\":...}(OpenAPI StorageValueEnvelope),\n运行时只认顶层 \"value\", 于是把整个信封当成值:\n- 状态文档解析成空结构, 每次 worker 启动都当作没有历史, 退回默认配置;\n- persistAll 在\"读到值但解析不出状态\"时继续落盘, 用内存默认值覆盖宿主里的\n  用户数据(2026-09-28 18:00 定时任务实际发生);\n- account 覆盖读不到, CookieCloud/想看配置永远不生效。\n\n修复:\n- wasmStorageRead 走 unwrapStorageValue: 先 data.value, 再顶层 value, 兼容裸值;\n- persistAll: 读到无法识别的状态文档时拒绝落盘(而不是覆盖);\n- loadAll 把加载结果写进 diag 键(字节数/恢复/覆盖), 下次可一眼定位;\n- abi.go 加 wasip1 构建标签 + 非 wasip1 占位, 包可在本机跑单元测试;\n- 新增 storage_test.go 回归用例(信封/旧扁平/裸值)。\n\nmusic-dl 同源代码一并修复(版本另发)。","tree":{"sha":"edef3c4f4fb4de89544713a9ed38ecbce6f21448","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/edef3c4f4fb4de89544713a9ed38ecbce6f21448"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/ef71471c9494e0f5ec5b7ce497123bd1970dbcae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzc2NDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commit/ef71471c9494e0f5ec5b7ce497123bd1970dbcae","node_id":"C_kwDOUUiak9oA