d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/commits/6101fa583da243d91a78d791d2253c69bb187283/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:32:20Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:33:06Z","email":"zhangzhong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zhangzhong"},"message":"fix(douban-center): 0.3.1 存储加载竞态——读取失败重试+禁止默认值落盘覆盖用户配置\n\n症状: 0.3.0 保存的 CookieCloud 配置几分钟后被抹回默认(用户实测)。\n根因: loadAll 在 worker 启动初期宿主存储 GET 瞬时失败时静默落默认值,\n之后任意一次 persistAll 都会用默认 settings 整块覆盖存储里的用户配置。\n(该机制同样解释了历史上''豆瓣插件数据偶发丢失/白屏'')\n\n修复:\n- loadStateWithRetry: 3 次重试, 用 HTTP 状态区分 404(全新安装,允许初始化)与瞬态错误\n- persistAll: storageOK=false 期间不落盘并告警, 恢复读取后才继续\n- 这也是 settings/blacklist/想看配置持久化的共同保护","tree":{"sha":"140692ef6d566fa35a9ef89967af6b30d2716caa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/trees/140692ef6d566fa35a9ef89967af6b30d2716caa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/congyoubanmian/dian115-plugins/git/commits/6101fa583da243d91a78d791d2253c69bb187283","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3377649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangzhong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangzhong","id":3377649,"login":"zhangzhong","node_id":"MDQ6V