ps://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Philip38-hub","id":80720299,"login":"Philip38-hub","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNzIwMjk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/commits/2003a4b6947f7375e601a9b4410520136dad3a6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T12:59:21Z","email":"oumaphilip01@gmail.com","name":"Philip"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T12:59:21Z","email":"oumaphilip01@gmail.com","name":"Philip"},"message":"Let a contribution be recorded directly against a contributor at any time\n\nAdd a \"Record Contribution\" action on each contributor row (no M-PESA\nmessage required, choose which period it counts toward) for the case\nwhere money never generates a confirmation SMS at all -- e.g. an\norganizer collecting on their own phone number can''t M-PESA themselves.\nWires up the existing record_manual_contribution endpoint, previously\nonly reachable from the bulk-import backfill flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013bWhXCVdpPwXiu249Y75ZT","tree":{"sha":"82ec35dc3a0781b62b64c302cf6a1396d48d131c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/git/trees/82ec35dc3a0781b62b64c302cf6a1396d48d131c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/git/commits/2003a4b6947f7375e601a9b4410520136dad3a6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80720299?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Philip38-hub","id":80720299,"login":"Philip38-hub","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNzIwMjk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/commit/2003a4b6947f7375e601a9b4410520136dad3a6d","node_id":"C_kwDOUUrXeNoAKDIwMDNhNGI2OTQ3ZjczNzVlNjAxYTliNDQxMDUyMDEzNmRhZDNhNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/commit/aaf98be6c30bcfe940daf2a17e44102621cb49e8","sha":"aaf98be6c30bcfe940daf2a17e44102621cb49e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/commits/aaf98be6c30bcfe940daf2a17e44102621cb49e8"}],"sha":"2003a4b6947f7375e601a9b4410520136dad3a6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/commits/2003a4b6947f7375e601a9b4410520136dad3a6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80720299?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Philip38-hub","id":80720299,"login":"Philip38-hub","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNzIwMjk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/commits/aaf98be6c30bcfe940daf2a17e44102621cb49e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T12:48:19Z","email":"oumaphilip01@gmail.com","name":"Philip"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T12:48:19Z","email":"oumaphilip01@gmail.com","name":"Philip"},"message":"Let a confirmed transaction''s period be corrected at any time\n\nThe only existing way to move a payment to an earlier period (e.g. its\ncorrect catch-up week) was a one-time nudge shown right after a bulk\nreconcile, or the date picker during initial review -- both easy to miss\nand gone once you navigate away. Add a persistent \"Edit period\" control\non each confirmed transaction in the Transactions screen, reusing the\nexisting POST /transactions/{id}/effective-date endpoint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013bWhXCVdpPwXiu249Y75ZT","tree":{"sha":"74c1bb3a0413be2c347cafd73ef59cbc145239b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/git/trees/74c1bb3a0413be2c347cafd73ef59cbc145239b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/git/comm