NzIwMjk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/commits/fc47421853ca6d03cb73adb6945e3025b540b047/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T06:51:31Z","email":"oumaphilip01@gmail.com","name":"Philip"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T06:51:31Z","email":"oumaphilip01@gmail.com","name":"Philip"},"message":"Add the real-time SMS contribution alert\n\n- SmsAlertService classifies each new SMS, checks candidates across every\n  active collection, and only notifies when there''s an actual match --\n  strong (tap-to-import), weak (amount/group-only, needs review), or a\n  full name+amount+group match (imported and reconciled unattended,\n  behind a SharedPreferences kill switch).\n- SmsInboxService now also starts another_telephony''s foreground and\n  background SMS listener once permission is granted, surviving app\n  restarts via main()''s boot check.\n- main.dart adds a navigatorKey and decodes a tapped notification''s\n  payload to deep-link into the right collection''s Inbox or Transactions\n  screen, or a picker when the match was ambiguous.\n- Android manifest gains RECEIVE_SMS; Gradle enables core library\n  desugaring, which flutter_local_notifications requires.","tree":{"sha":"b097daed0b1918dbe0105efc52a845704b241537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/git/trees/b097daed0b1918dbe0105efc52a845704b241537"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/git/commits/fc47421853ca6d03cb73adb6945e3025b5