ers/Philip38-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Philip38-hub","id":80720299,"login":"Philip38-hub","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNzIwMjk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Philip38-hub","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/commits/44c46da3b162e42ffc5a70d4d6592037b641f81b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T06:51:09Z","email":"oumaphilip01@gmail.com","name":"Philip"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T06:51:09Z","email":"oumaphilip01@gmail.com","name":"Philip"},"message":"Add highlight/undo UI and a Close Project action\n\n- MpesaInboxScreen and TransactionsScreen accept a highlight id/code,\n  scrolling to and marking the matching tile once loaded.\n- TransactionsScreen shows an \"Auto-imported\" badge and an Undo action\n  (calls reverseTransaction) for anything imported unattended.\n- New SelectCollectionForAlertScreen lets the user pick a collection when\n  a real-time alert''s candidate matching genuinely ties across more than\n  one active collection.\n- ProjectDashboardScreen gets a Close Project button, mirroring the\n  existing per-collection close.","tree":{"sha":"1eeff2e4d16c9fd06fe0b94565fe35ee50e53b07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/git/trees/1eeff2e4d16c9fd06fe0b94565fe35ee50e53b07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Philip38-hub/changaSmart/git/commits/44c46da3b162e42ffc5a70d4d6592037b641f81b","verification":{"payload":null,"reaso