ollowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/68d4e5c28de014a48526864c51b07420d876eb00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:10:43Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:51:23Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"fix(private): E.4 review — invite correlation, teardown self-heal, routing\n\nReview findings fixed:\n\n- contract gap: the inviter never learned the sessionId, so\n  relay.declined / relay.closed{expired} could not correlate to a\n  pending invite — S10 waited forever and pendingInvites leaked.\n  Server now acks invites with relay.invited{sessionId, to, …} and\n  re-emits it in emitKnownSessions for pending inviter-side sessions;\n  inviteSent dedup covers both roles\n- teardown() nulled the client with no rebuild path — logout→login in\n  the same SPA left the private module dead. connect() now re-boots\n- S5 private toggle routed incoming invites to a keyless S12 chat —\n  now routes by session status (incoming/inviting → S10, live → S12);\n  S10 gained the invitee accept/decline state per spec\n- sessionByPeer ranks parallel sessions per peer (live > inviting >\n  incoming); a dup/late relay.invited can no longer regress an\n  established session''s status\n- pendingInvites entries expire (server invite TTL) so a rejected\n  invite cannot linger as \"waiting\" forever\n- S12 composer disabled until a session key exists; invite card''s\n  live banner no longer fires on inviting/incoming statuses; S10\n  invitee actions target the incoming session, not the best-ranked one\n- S10 exits to S5 when the session vanishes (decline/expiry), not\n  only on the closed status\n- mock mode no longer retries a relay socket that cannot exist —\n  boot/connect skipped when VITE_API_MODE=mock\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2bafc6dd6b8546eb0123558f0cbe212aae4a30d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/2bafc6dd6b8546eb0123558f0cbe212aae4a30d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/68d4e5c28de014a48526864c51b07420d876eb00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","use