ivate store behind VITE_PRIVATE_MODULE only:\n  /api/v1/relay + accessToken callback, teardown on logout + pagehide\n  (extracted to privateBoot.ts so the lifecycle contract is testable)\n- store: relayState + backoff reconnect, sessionByPeer/incomingInvites/\n  outgoingInvites getters for the UI layer\n- S5: private toggle on direct chats only (groups/saved excluded),\n  PrivateInviteCard async-imported behind the flag — live banner,\n  incoming accept/decline, outgoing waiting states\n- S11 setup: ttl / burnOnRead / strict options; S10 waiting room;\n  S11b emoji SAS grid with explicit MITM warning; S12 dark private\n  chat — countdown, unverified banner, peer-offline hint, burn dialog\n- burnOnRead ships as flag + UI marker only (receipt-based burn = E.5)\n- mock mode stays honest: no fake accept, \"live backend required\"\n- 11 new vitest cases; mvp bundle guard stays clean — private chunks\n  appear only in the dev-host build\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f9c6c411b2b1a650018bc7c95459a555edb4342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/9f9c6c411b2b1a650018bc7c95459a555edb4342"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/e31a54fed2e0b8555667110c748545e8ca4e9f71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","rec