→accept→\nestablished lifecycle, opaque blob routing with per-session msgSeq,\nin-process grace buffering (256 env / 1 MiB cap), resume tokens,\nsix death triggers, zero-persistence invariants binding on the\nimplementation, and client zero-trace discipline binding on the\nclient (memory-only except the dev-tier IndexedDB identity keys,\nwhich get deleteDatabase''d on teardown — including pre-allocated\nstores).\n\n02-private-layer gains the dev-tier IndexedDB exception (pwa-dev\nonly, weakest tier, explicitly scoped) and the platform\nimplementation order toward v0.9.0 \"any-device private\": pwa-dev →\nElectron desktop → Android → iOS. Overview maturity row updated;\nREADME links the new contract.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"82404b06f02d0f08309618ef08e2a53e8396cd2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/82404b06f02d0f08309618ef08e2a53e8396cd2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/2e3f379ea8978426239f461c7b9ae2d7a3c4f3a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti