oman Suleymanov"},"message":"docs(api): contract-drift pass — openapi vs handlers (D.4)\n\nRoute-by-route diff of public-api.openapi.yaml against internal/api:\n\n- otp/verify documented `429 rate_limited` — never emitted; attempt\n  lockout deletes the OTP and answers `otp_expired` 403. RateLimited\n  response kept but marked reserved (no endpoint emits it today);\n  errors.md lockout row corrected to match.\n- User.displayName/tag marked nullable — backend emits null until\n  profile setup (S3).\n- Missing error responses added: upload attachment 400/401/404\n  (existence-private member gate), open-direct-chat 400/404,\n  mark-read 400/404, create-group 400/403 (memberIds must be contacts).\n- 04-backend package map fixed (no internal/models; wire types live\n  in store.go).\n\nEverything else — all 34 routes present, wire shapes, query params,\nrequest bodies, 501 stubs — verified identical to the contract.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"886c901f050c42263fff3bc178a9cee70d8ac039","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/886c901f050c42263fff3bc178a9cee70d8ac039"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/9abc7b77d9b2a10b475f219ab600763df0d8a514","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"ht