e":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/d0845db3d129fd6631b3fd4f3b8290d2b7c34f27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:08:02Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:08:02Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"docs: sync public docs with shipped reality (D.3)\n\nREADME gains an honest status split (shipped / designed / 501-stubbed)\nand a security-model section: public layer is server-trusted by design,\nprivate E2EE is not built yet.\n\nArchitecture series rewritten around a maturity matrix instead of\npresent-tense claims: 02-private-layer is labeled DESIGN, 05-threat-model\nscopes the ciphertext guarantee to the private layer and conditions it\non SAS verification (unverified pair stays MITM-able), 04-backend drops\n\"planned\" markers and documents the real hub (per-session seq, bounded\nring replay, presence grace). False claims removed: Argon2 \"password\"\nhashing (it''s OTP), Redis rate-limiting (not wired), 4403/4429 close\ncodes (hub emits only 4401/4408), Redis-backed 60s replay buffer\n(in-memory ring, ReplayCap=256, 10min idle TTL).\n\nError catalog synced to emitted codes: too_large not payload_too_large,\ninternal/internal_error both real, rate_limited reserved-not-emitted,\nnot_implemented added. flows.md gains a shipped/pwa-dev/design status\ncolumn; S9 merged-into-S5 and S16 dev-only are noted.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ede15c5157624bdc690e86ec00295abbe16b62a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/ede15c5157624bdc690e86ec00295abbe16b62a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/d0845db3d129fd6631b3fd4f3b8290d2b7c34f27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":nul