users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/7ecd566bf3ae3c3232c4e0732129e436dfa7271d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:57:00Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:57:00Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"test(ws): fill the untested hub paths — expiry, backpressure, grace flap\n\n- afterExpiry drops the conn with 4401 when its access token dies\n  (1s TTL — jwt.NumericDate truncates, sub-second tokens are born dead)\n- non-auth first frame → 4401; typing from a non-member is dropped\n  silently; sender never sees its own typing echo; typing.stop lands\n  already-expired\n- reconnect inside OfflineGrace emits no presence{offline} flap\n- new white-box hub_test.go: slow-consumer conn drop keeps the replay\n  buffer, ring evicts oldest at ReplayCap, attach resolves gap vs\n  missed-tail replay\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c85bef2d39298afeaa4460ae066530f5e345630f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/c85bef2d39298afeaa4460ae066530f5e345630f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/7ecd566bf3ae3c3232c4e0732129e436dfa7271d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url