)\n- ws deltas as named handlers: contact.added flips mutual on an\n  existing edge (target-side semantics), contact.removed drops the\n  flag but keeps the edge, user.updated patches cached Users\n- chats.onUserUpdated propagates renames into summaries, details and\n  group rosters; resync.required revalidates contacts when loaded\n- chats.teardown() resets chats+contacts so session revoke/logout\n  never leaks one account''s data to the next login\n\nVerified live: mutual add/remove/rename round-trip on the dev server\n(13 ws+rest assertions pass).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd81a88a114155a77bd2b0a4e4907c3429195440","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/fd81a88a114155a77bd2b0a4e4907c3429195440"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/2b349cfe4682611c2e81c105b06e252b70af826c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ/openglass/commit/2b349cfe4682611c2e81c105b06e252b70af826c","node_id":"C_kwDOUUx9z9oAKDJiMzQ5Y2ZlNDY4MjYxMWMyZTgxYzEwNWIwNmUyNTJiNzBhZjgyNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ/openglass/commit/1cdfc05290b6392dd7da01b815bc85c005056944","sha":"1cdfc05290b6392dd7da01b815bc85c005056944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/1cdfc05290b6392dd7da01b815bc85c005056944"}],"sha":"2b349cfe4682611c2e81c105b06e252b70af826c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/2b349cfe4682611c2e81c105b06e252b70af826c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/1cdfc05290b6392dd7da01b815bc85c005056944/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:38:23Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:38:23Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"fix(frontend): reconnect flap, message dedup, attachment UX (manual QA)\n\nFound during owner walkthrough on the live stack:\n\n- WsClient never sent the contract heartbeat (ping/30s against the\n  server''s 90s idle drop) — sockets were killed every 90s, and a stale\n  reconnect timer kept tearing down healthy connections: visible as a\n  flickering offline banner. connect() now does a silent teardown and\n  `online` clears pending reconnect timers.\n- Sent messages could duplicate when the WS message.new event beat the\n  REST response: the optimistic local-<nonce> bubble is now upgraded\n  in place by clientNonce (contract echo), REST path dedups by id too.\n- Attachments (backend still 501): honest error text instead of a\n  blanket \"exceeds 25 mb limit\", error no longer blocks sending or\n  re-picking a file, strip can''t resurrect after mid-upload cancel.\n- S4 header per design: + left, Chats centered, avatar right; dead\n  \"work\" tab removed.\n\nRegression test: ws-before-REST race in chats store.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e170d9fc1840eb7334f5886af63c85d21f6f50e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/4e170d9fc1840eb7334f5886af63c85d21f6f50e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/1cdfc05290b6392dd7da01b815bc85c005056944","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u