nt): body validation incl. 8192 boundary,\n  replyTo same-chat/deleted/cross-chat, cursor edges (garbage cursor,\n  over-cap limit, empty bounds), tombstone exclusion from\n  history/search/lastMessage, 404 matrix, self-chat full flow\n- +3 security tests (security_agent): full mutual lifecycle\n  (one-way visibility, both-direction 403, mutual reset on removal,\n  membership survives contact removal), stranger-vs-member 404/403\n  matrix on message ops, member-only chat ops\n\nRefs #13\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"700d40797919f4b966782fc85baa6aed0c3e34ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/700d40797919f4b966782fc85baa6aed0c3e34ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/07a4c9033e675a42b66bdcc7bdff50b1f0835dc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ/openglass/commit/07a4c9033e675a42b66bdcc7bdff50b1f0835dc5","node_id":"C_kwDOUUx9z9oAKDA3YTRjOTAzM2U2NzVhNDJiNjZiZGNjN2JkZmY1MGIxZjA4MzVkYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ/openglass/commit/e092cf563cae6fdcc8e6652a82650b1e92acbdf7","sha":"e092cf563cae6fdcc8e6652a82650b1e92acbdf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/e092cf563cae6fdcc8e6652a82650b1e92acbdf7"}],"sha":"07a4c9033e675a42b66bdcc7bdff50b1f0835dc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/07a4c9033e675a42b66bdcc7bdff50b1f0835dc5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/e092cf563cae6fdcc8e6652a82650b1e92acbdf7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:42:46Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:42:46Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"B1: contacts, direct chats, messages — REST + Mem + PG\n\nMigration 0002: contacts, chats (direct_key dedup), chat_members\n(pin/read cursor), messages (per-chat seq, client_nonce unique),\nattachments staging table.\n\n- Store: ChatStore interface + Mem/PG impls; per-chat seq allocated\n  via UPDATE chats.last_seq inside the insert tx; clientNonce replay\n  returns the existing message (200) vs 201 on create\n- API: contacts CRUD, openDirectChat (mutual-contacts gate, self-chat\n  as direct), chat list/detail/pin, full message surface — cursor\n  pagination (before/after/around), ILIKE search, pinned filter,\n  edit/delete ownership, read markers — all behind bearer+membership\n- OpenDirectChat race-safe via direct_key ON CONFLICT\n- EditMessage does a conditional UPDATE (sender_id in WHERE) so a\n  foreign PATCH cannot mutate before the 403 — covered by test\n- PG integration: per-run hash/suffix so tests are re-runnable on the\n  persistent dev DB; live smoke on docker postgres verified E2E\n- Contract hygiene: PATCH /groups/{chatId}/members/{userId} stubbed\n  501 (was silently unrouted); PATCH /chats/{chatId} removed — not in\n  the contract\n\nCloses #13\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe624e865cf9bf884636b672ada5b40668319b71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/fe624e865cf9bf884636b672ada5b40668319b71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/e092cf563cae6fdcc8e6652a82650b1e92acbdf7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"h