jojouHZ/openglass/commits/c6e3e543a8617887a1593a5ab07b10bd0f9dadcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:17:58Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:17:58Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"compose: pin qdrant v1.19.1, move embedder behind ''kb'' profile\n\n- qdrant now runs in Docker like the rest of the stack; existing\n  collection data was migrated into the named volume. Pin v1.19.1\n  instead of floating :latest.\n- embedder (TEI, ~2 GB ghcr.io image) is optional and unreachable on\n  some networks; it now lives behind the ''kb'' compose profile.\n  scripts/tei_shim.py provides a local TEI-compatible /embed endpoint\n  (BGE-large via sentence-transformers) as a no-Docker fallback for\n  scripts/vectorize_docs.py --tei-url.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cf6129e5ba0b49b19b74b632c2a4ca55c625470","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/3cf6129e5ba0b49b19b74b632c2a4ca55c625470"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/c6e3e543a8617887a1593a5ab07b10bd0f9dadcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"