uHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/3741eb23e0bc5af0e1592d5eadbf070d379ad5f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:14:16Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:14:16Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"#12 review pass: auth hardening + migration bookkeeping\n\n- requestOtp: store errors no longer bypass the invite gate (500,\n  not an uninvited OTP)\n- verifyOtp: exhausted attempts → otp_expired (was negative\n  attemptsLeft through otp_invalid)\n- migrations: schema_migrations created before the version check,\n  and each applied version is now recorded (was: never written —\n  every boot re-ran all migrations)\n- ws stub: per-session seq starts at 1 for auth.ok/auth.fail\n  (was 2 for auth.ok — off-by-one vs ws-events.md framing)\n- middleware: revoked sessions now reject live access tokens\n  (previously valid until JWT expiry — up to 15 min post-logout);\n  SessionActive added to AuthStore (pg + mem)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8204a22e75796d269f633fdef1cdf7a74e706282","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/8204a22e75796d269f633fdef1cdf7a74e706282"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/3741eb23e0bc5af0e1592d5eadbf070d379ad5f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"