l":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/48963ca4fcf29305809d84599a56a87c1a69c058/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:10:34Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:10:34Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"Backend skeleton: Go monolith + auth endpoints (#12)\n\n- cmd/server: env config, pgx pool, embedded SQL migrations, redis,\n  graceful shutdown — compose-ready\n- internal/api: stdlib mux on /api/v1, contract envelope + error\n  codes (invite_required/invalid, otp_invalid/expired/cooldown,\n  tag_taken+tagSuggestions, conflict, unauthorized)\n- auth flow: requestOtp → verifyOtp (Argon2id-hashed codes, 60 s\n  cooldown, attempts counter) → JWT access (15 m) + rotating opaque\n  refresh (sha256 stored, reuse → session revoked); logout, sessions\n  list/revoke, completeProfile with name#NNNN tags, getMe/updateMe/\n  searchUsers/getUser\n- unimplemented contract routes answer 501 not_implemented (auth''d)\n  instead of silence — contacts/chats/messages/groups/push/reports\n- internal/ws: hub stub — first-frame auth (4401/4408), pong heartbeat;\n  delivery lands with messaging slices\n- internal/store: AuthStore interface, pgx impl, Mem impl for tests;\n  contract tests cover the full auth flow + error codes; PG roundtrip\n  test gated on OPENGLASS_TEST_PG_DSN\n- Dockerfile + server service in compose; pwa .env.example documents\n  the live mode (vite proxies /api → :8081)\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3546cdda188886ce87aa94ad79a4c812ac3dd2e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/3546cdda188886ce87aa94ad79a4c812ac3dd2e6"},"url":"https://ap