ithub.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/6da146d8e6d8b23c9bee13854ec34f5105c091b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:51:32Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:51:32Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"S4–S5: chat list + conversation on the mock API (#11)\n\nCore chats store: contract-ordered list (pinned → lastActivityAt),\nper-chat message windows with before/after/around pagination,\nnonce-keyed optimistic sends, markRead on open, and WS wiring for\nmessage/typing/receipt/presence/chat events.\n\nViews port the design-kit prototypes: S4 list (folders, typing\nindicator, unread badges, empty state) and S5 conversation (day\nseparators, series grouping, read ticks, scroll-anchored history,\ncontext menu, in-chat search, pinned bar, static offline state,\ncomposer strips for reply/edit/attachment with 25 MiB client-side\nvalidation). No outbox queue, no reactions — per contract/FDD.\n\nSaved messages lands as a direct self-chat fixture; direct history\ngrows to 60 messages so cursor pagination is testable.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3142b072bc1d6f8a079491093c773ede0cb9d259","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/3142b072bc1d6f8a079491093c773ede0cb9d259"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/6da146d8e6d8b23c9bee13854ec34f5105c091b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null