"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"Mock API client: MSW + typed fixtures over the real HttpApiClient (#9)\n\nApproach A per FDD — MSW answers real HTTP at network level, so the\nmock cannot drift from transport code:\n\n- http/: HttpTransport (JSON/multipart, error envelope →\n  ApiRequestError, bearer injection) + HttpApiClient covering all\n  36 operations + real WsClient (first-frame auth, last_seq replay,\n  4401/4408 semantics)\n- mock/: MockState + createHandlers (all endpoints, ~80ms latency,\n  honest nonce dedup + cursor pagination + error scenarios),\n  MockWsClient scripted player (auth.ok → presence.snapshot → demo\n  ticks — a player, not a hub)\n- fixtures: typed from generated schema; mutual/incoming contacts,\n  direct chat with pinned message + unread, group with rights\n- browser entry via msw/browser worker (msw init''ed into\n  apps/pwa/public), node entry kept in a separate module so\n  msw/node never enters the browser bundle\n- contract.test.ts: 10-test suite driving the real client through\n  auth/401s/pagination/nonce-dedup/error envelopes — same suite will\n  run against the Go backend\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e20c5920ad6a7a56f9d13e7cb173998042f695df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/e20c5920ad6a7a56f9d13e7cb173998042f695df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/45d249b8757d147ff465326c276f591999f19554","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/