PI contract round 6: forward pagination, verified mark, own email\n\n- listMessages gained `after` param + `newerCursor` — without forward\n  pagination an `around` jump left the user unable to scroll down\n- getUser response carries verifiedAt (US-2.5 verified mark on S7)\n- getMe returns own email (private field, never on public User) — S13\n  settings had no way to show the account email\n- receipt.read documented as echoing to all sessions of both parties —\n  this is the mechanism behind cross-device unread sync\n- logout removes session-bound push subscriptions\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2002da7db18f707e4594c1c7aead54f4a4b5c855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/2002da7db18f707e4594c1c7aead54f4a4b5c855"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/c175889acb7bc923c835478d7e8e731fcc5958f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_typ