added; without it the\n  other side keeps a stale mutual status until manual refetch\n- ChatSummary.memberCount (groups) and pinned-chats ordering rule\n- unreadCount documented per-user, synced across devices\n- attachment url requires bearer auth — not a public link\n- presence.snapshot ordering: first event after auth.ok\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e629b8901958b2a25999be6c24bdf1ca71cab682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/e629b8901958b2a25999be6c24bdf1ca71cab682"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/ee352ec90a8b341286a9b6143206a036271653eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ/openglass/commit/ee352ec90a8b341286a9b6143206a036271653eb","node_id":"C_kwDOUUx9z9oAKGVlMzUyZWM5MGE4YjM0MTI4NmE5YjYxNDMyMDZhMDM2MjcxNjUzZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ/openglass/commit/40a44f5b14cfaf37b3edc7be95446648f0a91e6e","sha":"40a44f5b14cfaf37b3edc7be95446648f0a91e6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/40a44f5b14cfaf37b3edc7be95446648f0a91e6e"}],"sha":"ee352ec90a8b341286a9b6143206a036271653eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/ee352ec90a8b341286a9b6143206a036271653eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/40a44f5b14cfaf37b3edc7be95446648f0a91e6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:47:08Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:47:08Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"API contract round 4: session-scoped WS seq, message pinning\n\n- FIX: WS frame seq was declared per-connection while ?last_seq= replay\n  needs it to survive reconnects — seq is now per-session monotonic,\n  resetting only on a new device session. Without this, replay was\n  broken by design\n- Framing clarified: seq/ts exist only on server→client frames\n- POST /messages/{id}/pin + `pinned` filter on listMessages — the\n  message.pinned WS event existed but nothing could toggle a pin\n  (S5b pinned view was unbuildable)\n- Push subscribe is now upsert-per-endpoint (200 on re-subscribe)\n- completeProfile documented one-shot: existing profile → conflict\n- Refresh rotation: reuse detection revokes the device session\n- replyToMessageId must reference a message in the same chat\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"db789aa111113d7459d1efd169fe6c4a993d963c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/db789aa111113d7459d1efd169fe6c4a993d963c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/40a44f5b14cfaf37b3edc7be95446648f0a91e6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ/openglass/commit/40a44f5b14cfaf37b3edc7be95446648f0a91e6e","node_id":"C_kwDOUUx9z9oAKDQwYTQ0ZjViMTRjZmFmMzdiM2VkYzdiZTk1NDQ2NjQ4ZjBhOTFlNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ/openglass/commit/bbcdb18475532e3c58e2aa94e779d92f8e78043d","sha":"bbcdb18475532e3c58e2aa94e779d92f8e78043d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/bbcdb18475532e3c58e2aa94e779d92f8e78043d"}],"sha":"40a44f5b14cfaf37b3edc7be95446648f0a91e6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/40a44f5b14cfaf37b3edc7be95446648f0a91e6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/commits/bbcdb18475532e3c58e2aa94e779d92f8e78043d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:44:03Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:44:03Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"API contract round 3: WS first-frame auth, mutual-contact completion\n\nThird review pass hit the realtime layer and design details:\n\n- WS auth moved out of the URL: connect, then first-frame `auth`\n  (5 s deadline) → `auth.ok`/`auth.fail`; tokens in query strings leak\n  into proxy logs. `?last_seq=N` now specified for reconnect replay\n- relationship enum gained contact_incoming + new `contact.added`\n  event — mutual contacts were unbuildable without a \"they added you\"\n  signal\n- `user.updated` / `chat.updated` events — profile and group changes\n  propagate to peers instead of going stale\n- tag_taken suggestions moved into error.details (envelope consistency)\n- invite consumption timing fixed: burned at verifyOtp, not request\n- attachmentIds must reference uploads to the same chat\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f96a3d9b220eaba7447bd2e071aa86ac2b56e309","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/f96a3d9b220eaba7447bd2e071aa86ac2b56e309"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/bbcdb18475532e3c58e2aa94e779d92f8e78043d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},