 the first pass missed:\n\n- CRITICAL: verifyOtp required a full User object, but first login has\n  no displayName/tag yet — user is now nullable when needsProfile=true\n- requestOtp required inviteCode always: invites gate account creation,\n  not every sign-in — inviteCode is now optional, unknown email without\n  one gets invite_required (new error code)\n- listMessages gained `around` — jump-to-message for search results,\n  pins and replies\n- requestOtp 429 now uses the otp_cooldown code instead of generic\n  rate_limited (errors.md consistency)\n- sendMessage requires text or attachments — empty message rejected\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"df8aeabd25cc0403f090c0782b815bc54e4a712b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/df8aeabd25cc0403f090c0782b815bc54e4a712b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/0c20dcdf3c9ab3ddf66f3de8e58dd18959396d50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url"