idempotency\n\nCross-agent review of #7 (product/backend/frontend/devops) found and\nfixed real gaps before the contract hardened:\n\n- /users/me GET+PATCH — cold-start profile + changeable display name\n- /healthz — compose healthchecks (503 = degraded)\n- message search: q param on listMessages (S5b)\n- /chats/{id}/pin — user-side chat pinning\n- /push/* — VAPID key + Web Push subscriptions (MVP feature)\n- Contact.verifiedAt — nullable now, written by private layer later\n- clientNonce idempotency: unique (senderId, nonce), retry → 200 + same\n  message; cursor documented as opaque seq-based token\n- ws-events: presence.snapshot — online snapshot as first frame\n\n29 paths / 35 operations, redocly lint clean (1 benign warning on the\nhealthz probe — no meaningful 4xx for a liveness endpoint).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0af9216f9c66dbd5ef610a5b4ac9a5e1eacb913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/c0af9216f9c66dbd5ef610a5b4ac9a5e1eacb913"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/077f65d0f70c650f0da9e896676960ba95a661f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_ad