comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:31:16Z","email":"jojou112@gmail.com","name":"Roman Suleymanov"},"message":"API contract: OpenAPI spec, WS event catalog, error model\n\nSingle source of truth for the frontend-first strategy (#7):\n- public-api.openapi.yaml — 28 operations: auth (invite→OTP→tag),\n  users, mutual contacts, chats, messages (cursor pagination,\n  clientNonce idempotency, attachments), groups (party/raid rights),\n  reports\n- ws-events.md — event catalog + ordering guarantees + replay/resync\n- errors.md — error envelope, codes, WS close codes, shared constants\n\nPrivate layer excluded by design — relay envelope catalog lands with\nthe private module.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5993e2ee455f4b466c304b89414005e72d9ef71e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/5993e2ee455f4b466c304b89414005e72d9ef71e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/ad8489d37ced8facc29eb37e8bb381ab718fc9bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https