"},"message":"FDD strategy: contract-first mock frontend, dual PWA hosts\n\nRecord the frontend-first development decision: Vue3+Vite core and PWA\nshell are built against a mock API layer driven by a written contract\n(docs/api/, still to be authored), while the Go backend implements the\nsame contract in parallel.\n\nAlso records the pwa-dev exception: an internal-only host that loads the\nprivate module for real E2E testing before native shells exist, without\nweakening the production PWA boundary.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bff28daeecc63d969da37719e330f64c162bcc00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/trees/bff28daeecc63d969da37719e330f64c162bcc00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojouHZ/openglass/git/commits/4702515e8c9162d66fc1e0313720364cca026c65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232830553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ","id":232830553,"login":"jojouHZ","node_id":"U_kgDODeC2WQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojouHZ","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jojouHZ/openglass/commi