mmitter":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:50:24Z","email":"codecaine@gmail.com","name":"codecaine"},"message":"Refactor CLI applications for improved error handling and code clarity\n\n- Updated error handling in `regex_cli`, `system_cli`, and `watcher_cli` to use `eprintln` and exit with appropriate codes.\n- Enhanced `get_last_mtime` function in `watcher_cli` to return an error if the watch path does not exist.\n- Improved code formatting and readability across multiple files, including consistent use of braces and indentation.\n- Added comprehensive tests for CLI applications to ensure help, version, and invalid flag handling.\n- Introduced new tests for `simplegui` to validate control state updates and layout fallbacks for small screens.\n- Enhanced `webview` module with memory management improvements for string duplication and freeing.","tree":{"sha":"6992d98258c3f26e7e25e9390fdec7d93dbb4ddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codecaine-zz/vlang_webview_rad_studio/git/trees/6992d98258c3f26e7e25e9390fdec7d93dbb4ddf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codecaine-zz/vlang_webview_rad_studio/git/commits/66bc55cca068a3850bbf86d5900e6a3cf994c38f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5162237?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecaine-zz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecaine-zz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecaine-zz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecaine-zz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codecaine-zz","id":5162237,"login":"codecaine-zz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjIyMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecaine-zz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecaine-zz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecaine-zz/repos","site_admin":fa