wu/commits/6f9659b134a62fe47ebe04595cc5c04251beca4f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4266401?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamjianyuwu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamjianyuwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamjianyuwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamjianyuwu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/iamjianyuwu","id":4266401,"login":"iamjianyuwu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjY0MDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamjianyuwu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamjianyuwu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamjianyuwu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamjianyuwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamjianyuwu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamjianyuwu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamjianyuwu/iamjianyuwu/commits/7c3a4a2ce59ffd5f4958d89a3237f27daa7a4d69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:12:35Z","email":"wujianyuvip@gmail.com","name":"Jianyu Wu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:12:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Profile: fix stats card generation with a GRS_TOKEN PAT (#4)\n\n* Profile: fix stats card generation with GITHUB_TOKEN\n\nGITHUB_TOKEN cannot read private-contribution data, so the first run\ncommitted an error card. Only pass count_private/include_all_commits\nwhen a GRS_TOKEN PAT is set, and fail instead of committing an error card.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TWSo3MFFkExRcHuFCSTS5b\n\n* Profile: hide stats card until a GRS_TOKEN is set\n\nGITHUB_TOKEN cannot read the owner''s other repos, so the card needs a\nPAT. Remove the error card from the README and skip the workflow until\nthe secret exists instead of failing daily.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TWSo3MFFkExRcHuFCSTS5b\n\n* Update README cards\n\n* Profile: restore stats card now that GRS_TOKEN is set\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TWSo3MFFkExRcHuFCSTS5b\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions <github-actions@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac55348ceb6f8bf002c7515be4876cbbc572e74f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamjianyuwu/iamjianyuwu/git/trees/ac55348ceb6f8bf002c7515be4876cbbc572e74f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamjianyuwu/iamjianyuwu/git/commits/7c3a4a2ce59ffd5f4958d89a3237f27daa7a4d69","verification":{"payload":"tree ac55348ceb6f8bf002c7515be4876cbbc572e74f\nparent 27e95bb34d4b159e2d60f9d94ad409011b68c32b\nauthor Jianyu Wu <wujianyuvip@gmail.com> 1790593955 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790593955 +0800\n\nProfile: fix stats card generation with a GRS_TOKEN PAT (#4)\n\n* Profile: fix stats card generation with GITHUB_TOKEN\n\nGITHUB_TOKEN cannot read private-contribution data, so the first run\ncommitted an error card. Only pass count_private/include_all_commits\nwhen a GRS_TOKEN PAT is set, and fail instead of committing an error card.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TWSo3MFFkExRcHuFCSTS5b\n\n* Profile: hide stats card until a GRS_TOKEN is set\n\nGITHUB_TOKEN cannot read the owner''s other repos, so the card needs a\nPAT. Remove the error card from the README and skip the workflow until\nthe secret exists instead of failing daily.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TWSo3MFFkExRcHuFCSTS5b\n\n* Update README cards\n\n* Profile: restore s