e Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T09:47:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: shape the changelog the way chachalog writes it (#5)\n\nCHANGELOG.md now matches what chachalog emits and what every other Jahia module carries: the artifact name as the title, one section per released version, asterisk bullets, no Unreleased heading and no link definitions. Nothing was reworded. A future release therefore adds a section instead of reformatting history.\n\nThe fragment guide moves to .github/, because chachalog treats every markdown file in .chachalog/ as a fragment and would consume it on the first release.","tree":{"sha":"4087bf1127d6b8be041e3a7d9457715e087ab0f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/git/trees/4087bf1127d6b8be041e3a7d9457715e087ab0f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/git/commits/c71a84de86d02c328ce414709cbab5ea2ab18a70","verification":{"payload":"tree 4087bf1127d6b8be041e3a7d9457715e087ab0f6\nparent 0c4cf90e82df325ba50bbb5d67fb6f2dd3066ec0\nauthor Stephane Monier <smonier@Jahia.com> 1789379227 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789379227 +0200\n\ndocs: shape the changelog the way chachalog writes it (#5)\n\nCHANGELOG.md now matches what chachalog emits and what every other Jahia module carries: the artifact name as the title, one section per released version, asterisk bullets, no Unreleased heading and no link definitions. Nothing was reworded. A future release therefore adds a section instead of reformatting history.\n\nThe fragment guide moves to .github/, because chachalog treats every markdown file in .chachalog/ as a fragment and would consume it on the first release.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqp8KbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAURcQAKiVOtKSpv+bNsO7+K7400T/\nZuj0TcxUHskHnmP7uIh4kKL3+CCG9o5xc69VTx4LxIEIwqA89SGZeXCZ0cd3ikiv\njRVjkdYY7br7q9gQxWulvgZ2P7xjO3yEtkYIruByO0y81AAgrx0MyJv9QnrdTeUc\nfM2gXyhlyzBiqMZl