ype":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/d171f7c4b11e920474a3f1514e0d61ec12a18c5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:23:44Z","email":"smonier@Jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:23:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: settle site, scope, language and fetch target in the caller''s session (#1)\n\nThe dashboard route declares a permission in the front end, and the endpoints behind it require the same one, resolved on the site in the caller''s own session, so the screen and the server state one rule.\n\nA request carries three values shaped like a path: the node, the subtree a scan covers, and the language. Each is settled on the resolved node rather than on the string that arrived. The address a check fetches comes from the site or from configuration, and a sitemap index''s children are followed only on the same origin. A schedule belongs to the account that saved it, is re-checked on every run, and its trigger lives and dies with the bundle.","tree":{"sha":"281c013f327fccea321844db6d48fef250974dff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/git/trees/281c013f327fccea321844db6d48fef250974dff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/git/commits/d171f7c4b11e920474a3f1514e0d61ec12a18c5b","verification":{"payload":"tree 281c013f327fccea321844db6d48fef250974dff\nparent 2a3e7537aed8bdd04f4f48bc96673c95d1098061\nauthor Stephane Monier <smonier@Jahia.com> 1789323824 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789323824 +0200\n\nfix: settle site, scope, language and fetch target in the caller''s session (#1)\n\nThe dashboard route declares a permission in the front end, and the endpoints behind it require the same one, resolved on the site in the caller''s own session, so the screen and the server state one rule.\n\nA request carries three values shaped like a path: the node, the subtree a scan covers, and the language. Each is settled on the resolved node rather than on the string that arrived. The address a check fetches comes from the site or from configuration, and a sitemap index''s children are followed only on the same origin. A schedule belongs to the account that saved it, is re-checked on every run, and its trigger lives and dies with the bundle.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpuowCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkXUQAGCTUw5kSObbPTb8h9Fq+egl\n5JuGrmZwc4iHOIK5WQC15knPHdMKv79XNPDahF79+qhuStXsqXh91IyArXpsXdiQ\nLdvCZYC25XAI/JzD6GE+wmht701hqDHGg7BmdXISLvTNt6ZCvwpzmc2ADA0yv1kR\nKRPsum90AVSrzWK12oMUDLbR4ejP8160pgQSABVJY96ShS0b3AJrS3/RXt5lyygB\nTFppNdBJmwsI5RRqwk32NbHqov32OxpEgblfzDN6iXr0UBeH4SuMwumQ34FOOtlj\nV7mB9HtygOVLhiy2b5Dze0W1043ADlyCwegI+zvNreRgvGzAm4Cgh1WP7Gyg9MOS\nFuWmpQ8kCp4K/XzffMNxNIYOAIH+v73UDcNWXDB0WSbXWtPx7V2ZRpr0MGF0377k\nkN9wNq+3/XJ6VQPOer2/AoJWDImqejWXLqb1Hio6UXn4/WUZPSskHss+C+IJjuyX\nwnh2HtR6E/BqI4MvTIu6To81pL4E0eGz1FvMbu/BZjMmrMyvyRIOpqDghxbzpcIX\nsQjrdEuhZO/NIVDSi5YjmQYz5TeTJkvkn7icGysWmnLrfY9oWgg/iGaMn28oU4B9\nIj5wqzgHWw+oPu23WDUBF88IviVvGQLIlnsaJOe0Pd3YS+UaayRUDfVJaBm2V+SA\nnkVxAiBK4+3Yi+/5MGo0\n=t3PI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T18:23:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github