t_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/geo-readiness/commit/f5a98b9ffd61cf005749aaf6dcac03a0206f6c00","node_id":"C_kwDOUVN91NoAKGY1YTk4YjlmZmQ2MWNmMDA1NzQ5YWFmNmRjYWMwM2EwMjA2ZjZjMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/geo-readiness/commit/745034f1be1a0c4cb90974dfb83f9463e90ff45d","sha":"745034f1be1a0c4cb90974dfb83f9463e90ff45d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/745034f1be1a0c4cb90974dfb83f9463e90ff45d"}],"sha":"f5a98b9ffd61cf005749aaf6dcac03a0206f6c00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/f5a98b9ffd61cf005749aaf6dcac03a0206f6c00"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/745034f1be1a0c4cb90974dfb83f9463e90ff45d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:13:31Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:13:31Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"GEO score, llms.txt generation and robots.txt AI-crawler control\n\nCompletes Wave 1. The module reported before; it can now score a page and,\nfrom a site-level settings panel, write the two files that tell AI crawlers\nwhat to do with the site.\n\nScoring\n- Six extra signals read from HTML already in memory, so no extra requests:\n  html lang, hreflang alternates, sub-heading outline, alt-text coverage,\n  JSON-LD @type breakdown and dateModified.\n- GeoScore: 17 pass/fail checks in three groups, each naming the one fact it\n  read. Deliberately not a rating out of 100. Being disallowed in robots.txt\n  is not a failure, because refusing a crawler is a legitimate decision; a\n  disagreement between the policy and the server is.\n\nWriting, behind generate -> diff -> confirm\n- LlmsGenerator builds llms.txt from the published page tree. Deterministic,\n  no model call, so the same site always produces the same file. Section\n  nodes are usually jnt:navMenuText rather than pages, so pages under legal\n  or landing-pages are found by walking groups, not only page children.\n- RobotsEditor merges per-crawler decisions into the existing robots.txt.\n  Allow and block are not symmetric: block replaces the crawler''s rules with\n  a site-wide refusal, allow only undoes one, so path rules survive. A\n  crawler sharing a User-agent group is split into its own group. Blank\n  lines are separators and are never trimmed, or a second merge differs from\n  the first and shows a phantom diff. Applying twice is byte-identical and\n  empty decisions return the file unchanged.\n- SiteFilesServlet: preview returns generated plus stored so the caller can\n  diff them; apply writes exactly the text it was handed and publishes.\n  Hand-edits made before applying are kept.\n\nUI\n- New settings panel under Additional > SEO, beside Robots.txt and Sitemap,\n  because both files belong to the site rather than to whichever page an\n  editor has open. LayoutContent + Header titled after the site and language,\n  with a tab per file.\n- The drawer stays page-scoped and now only reports on the two files.\n- Moonstone throughout: Table, Switch, Chip, Banner, Textarea, Tab/TabItem.\n  The diff view is the one deliberate exception, a pre block.\n\nAlso\n- PublicUrls extracted so both servlets build page URLs the same way.\n- Base URL reuses the request scheme and port when the editor is already on\n  the site''s host, which fixes a non-localhost server name resolving to an\n  unreachable https address.\n- MIT LICENSE file added, matching the licence the pom already declared.\n- Fixture docs corrected: PUBLIC_BASE_URL must use host.docker.internal, not\n  localhost, when Jahia runs in Docker.\n- EN and FR both complete, 172 keys, no orphans either way.","tree":{"sha":"c54d8b02490cf526e46dd081493d7a66560120f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/git/trees/c54d8b02490cf526e46dd081493d7a66560120f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/git/commits/745034f1be1a0c4cb90974dfb83f9463e90ff45d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/geo-readiness/commit/745034f1be1a0c4cb90974dfb83f9463e90ff45d","node_id":"C_kwDOUVN91NoAKDc0NTAzNGYxYmUxYTBjNGNiOTA5NzRkZmI4M2Y5NDYzZTkwZmY0NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/geo-readiness/commit/f31fb5d3360cc0402625dcbfefac647c9bafec8c","sha":"f31fb5d3360cc0402625dcbfefac647c9bafec8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/f31fb5d3360cc0402625dcbfefac647c9bafec8c"}],"sha":"745034f1be1a0c4cb90974dfb83f9463e90ff45d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/745034f1be1a0c4cb90974dfb83f9463e90ff45d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/f31fb5d3360cc0402625dcbfefac647c9bafec8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T11:41:17Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"SMO"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T11:41:17Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"SMO"},"message":"Add test fixtures for the crawler and site-file checks\n\nA local Jahia has no WAF, so every crawler returns 200 and the check\nlooks like it always passes. These fixtures produce the cases that\nmatter: a blocked crawler, a JS-only page, an llms.txt that is really\nHTML, and a missing robots.txt.\n\nserve.js has no dependencies. robots.txt exercises every branch of\nRobotsRules: shared user-agent groups, a blanket disallow, Allow\nbeating Disallow on a longer match, wildcard and anchored rules.\n\nExpected results in test-fixtures/README.md were produced by replaying\nthe parser against the fixture and confirmed: blockedButAllowed fires\nfor GPTBot, reachableButDisallowed fires for PerplexityBot on /docs/,\nand CCBot stays silent because blocked and disallowed agree.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DudRPKuf3b31XRYEWz2RPQ","tree":{"sha":"63c379f236640faf24b824412a7c20682b7f089b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/git/trees/63c379f236640faf24b824412a7c20682b7f089b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/git/commits/f31fb5d3360cc0402625dcbfefac647c9bafec8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/geo-readiness/commit/f31fb5d3360cc0402625dcbfefac647c9bafec8c","node_id":"C_kwDOUVN91NoAKGYzMWZiNWQzMzYwY2MwNDAyNjI1ZGNiZmVmYWM2NDdjOWJhZmVjOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/geo-readiness/commit/828ce24229c38a009b62710cab3c58d8630f4fb9","sha":"828ce24229c38a009b62710cab3c58d8630f4fb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/828ce24229c38a009b62710cab3c58d8630f4fb9"}],"sha":"f31fb5d3360cc0402625dcbfefac647c9bafec8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/f31fb5d3360cc0402625dcbfefac647c9bafec8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/828ce24229c38a009b62710cab3c58d8630f4fb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T11:34:27Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"SMO"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T11:34:27Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"SMO"},"message":"GEO Readiness: crawler access check plus robots.txt and llms.txt\n\nWave 1, first increment. Adds a jContent action on pages that answers\nwhether AI crawlers can actually read the published page.\n\n- CrawlerCheckServlet fetches the live URL once per bot user agent,\n  server side, no cookies, no redirect following, and analyses the\n  initial HTML rather than a rendered DOM\n- SiteFilesChecker reports robots.txt and llms.txt, including the\n  llms.txt-returns-HTML false positive\n- RobotsRules evaluates 15 AI crawler tokens against this page''s path\n- The servlet cross-checks policy against reality and names two\n  contradictions: allowed but blocked, and reachable but disallowed\n- EN and FR locales at parity, 80 keys each\n\nNot verified: the module has not been compiled or deployed. Public URL\nresolution ignores vanity URLs and needs checking on a real instance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DudRPKuf3b31XRYEWz2RPQ","tree":{"sha":"086ea776db40d460ba0309a7ab45d14ebaae61eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/git/trees/086ea776db40d460ba0309a7ab45d14ebaae61eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/git/commits/828ce24229c38a009b62710cab3c58d8630f4fb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/geo-readiness/commit/828ce24229c38a009b62710cab3c58d8630f4fb9","node_id":"C_kwDOUVN91NoAKDgyOGNlMjQyMjljMzhhMDA5YjYyNzEwY2FiM2M1OGQ4NjMwZjRmYjk","parents":[],"sha":"828ce24229c38a009b62710cab3c58d8630f4fb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits/828ce24229c38a009b62710cab3c58d8630f4fb9"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/geo-readiness/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=222efcf663e00ed892e83d4975125754c427719e&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A15%3A42.530Z"}');
